Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在下界放置水的唯一方法是将水倒入炼药锅 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The only way to place any sort of water in the nether is by putting water in a cauldron.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不清楚为何或如何实现这一点 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:06.32,0:00:08.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Not sure why or how this is possible,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过倒也合理 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:08.82,0:00:09.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but fair enough.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.90,0:00:14.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若背包已满时投掷带有忠诚附魔的三叉戟 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:09.90,0:00:14.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you throw a trident with the loyalty enchantment while having a full inventory,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,三叉戟会一直跟随玩家 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:14.62,0:00:17.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the trident will just follow the player around.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.62,0:00:20.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,铁傀儡在水中不会溺水 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:17.62,0:00:20.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Iron golems are not able to drown in water.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.90,0:00:21.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你还好吗伙计？
Dialogue: 2,0:00:20.90,0:00:21.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You okay there, mate?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.00,0:00:22.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我觉得他没事 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.00,0:00:22.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I think he's fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.88,0:00:27.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,将盔甲架放在栅栏上会导致其悬空漂浮 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:22.88,0:00:27.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Putting an armor stand on top of a fence will cause the armor stand to float,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来相当诡异 
Dialogue: 2,0:00:27.50,0:00:29.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks rather strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.34,0:00:33.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当末影螨最初在1.8版本加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:00:29.34,0:00:33.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the endermite was first added into Minecraft in version 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.86,0:00:37.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们直接沿用了蠹虫模组的模型
Dialogue: 2,0:00:33.86,0:00:37.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they used the exact same model as the silverfish mod,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只不过颜色不同而已
Dialogue: 2,0:00:37.16,0:00:38.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but with just a different colour.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:38.94,0:00:45.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家能在一格空间爬行的特性其实是个意外诞生的功能
Dialogue: 2,0:00:38.94,0:00:45.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The feature of players being able to crawl in one block gaps was actually created by accident.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:45.62,0:00:52.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 Mojang 实在太喜欢这个意外特性  最终决定将爬行功能保留在游戏中
Dialogue: 2,0:00:45.62,0:00:49.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, Mojang liked this accidental feature so much
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.38,0:00:52.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that they decided to keep crawling in the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.14,0:00:56.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,早在我的世界Beta 1.8版本时期
Dialogue: 2,0:00:52.14,0:00:56.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft in beta 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.18,0:00:59.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时创造模式存在一个漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:00:56.18,0:00:59.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a bug existed in the game in creative mode.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.32,0:01:04.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知为何 玩家能用剑从超远距离攻击生物
Dialogue: 2,0:00:59.32,0:01:02.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So for some reason, players were able to hit mobs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.29,0:01:04.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,with their sword from a very long distance away,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这看起来确实有点诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:01:05.04,0:01:06.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was just a little bit weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看看这个
Dialogue: 2,0:01:07.12,0:01:08.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, just look at this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这怎么可能实现？
Dialogue: 2,0:01:08.58,0:01:09.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,How is this even possible?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:10.26,0:01:13.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,草径是隐藏物品的绝佳选择
Dialogue: 2,0:01:10.26,0:01:13.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Grass paths are a great way to hide your items in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.18,0:01:20.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为它不是完整方块 物品能透过草径被漏斗吸收
Dialogue: 2,0:01:14.18,0:01:16.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you can transport items into hoppers
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.69,0:01:20.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,through the grass path due to them not being a full block.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,棕色蘑菇非常独特
Dialogue: 2,0:01:20.52,0:01:22.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Brown mushrooms are unique,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.32,0:01:24.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它能发出1级亮度
Dialogue: 2,0:01:22.32,0:01:24.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as they will emit a light level of 1,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而红色蘑菇则完全不发光
Dialogue: 2,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas red mushrooms do not emit anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.88,0:01:30.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果沙砾落在灵魂沙上
Dialogue: 2,0:01:27.88,0:01:30.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If gravel falls onto soul sand,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,沙砾就会自动碎裂
Dialogue: 2,0:01:30.28,0:01:31.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the gravel will break.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:32.16,0:01:38.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,戴上苦力怕头颅能将其探测范围缩小50%
Dialogue: 2,0:01:32.16,0:01:38.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You can reduce a creeper's detection range by 50% if you are wearing a creeper head.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,大概苦力怕会把你当成同类吧
Dialogue: 2,0:01:38.22,0:01:39.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess the creeper thinks you're one of them.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,哦等等 当我没说 它还是想干掉我
Dialogue: 2,0:01:40.02,0:01:41.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, never mind, he still wants to kill me.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:41.82,0:01:48.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,船的合成配方是唯一无需任何物品  就能在配方书中解锁的配方
Dialogue: 2,0:01:41.82,0:01:45.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The crafting recipes for boats are the only recipes
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:48.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that can be unlocked in the recipe book without having any items.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.22,0:01:51.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你只需要跳进水里就行了 
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.22,0:01:51.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,All you do is just simply jump into water.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当我的世界迎来十周年之际
Dialogue: 2,0:01:52.10,0:01:54.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When Minecraft became 10 years old,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里所有蛋糕上都出现了数字10
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.60,0:01:57.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all cakes in the game had a number 10 on it,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来就像这样
Dialogue: 2,0:01:57.16,0:01:58.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:58.84,0:02:03.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,即使玩家处于隐身效果下  蝙蝠依然会飞走
Dialogue: 2,0:01:58.84,0:02:03.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Bats will still fly away from the player if they are under the invisibility effect.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 现实中的蝙蝠听力超群 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:03.92,0:02:06.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, bats in real life have amazing hearing,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以这很合理 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:06.46,0:02:07.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so it makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:07.80,0:02:12.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,使用时运III附魔时  沙砾必定会掉落燧石
Dialogue: 2,0:02:07.80,0:02:12.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Gravel will drop flint 100% of the time if you use the fortune 3 enchantment.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:13.00,0:02:19.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 玩家穿过一个蜘蛛网需要漫长的13秒
Dialogue: 2,0:02:13.00,0:02:19.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, it takes 13 long painful seconds for the player to fall through one cobweb,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:19.40,0:02:20.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直...
Dialogue: 2,0:02:19.40,0:02:20.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is just...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.18,0:02:21.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有人能把这个打破吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:02:20.18,0:02:21.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,could someone break this please?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:21.82,0:02:28.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界中的物品更惨  穿过一个蜘蛛网需要整整24秒
Dialogue: 2,0:02:21.82,0:02:24.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Items in Minecraft are even more painful as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.49,0:02:28.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they take a long 24 seconds to fall through a single cobweb.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,快给我钻石 现在就要 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:29.02,0:02:30.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Any time now, I want my diamonds.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.10,0:02:33.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当我的世界里的小熊猫打喷嚏时
Dialogue: 2,0:02:31.10,0:02:33.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When baby pandas sneeze in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.72,0:02:37.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们有0.1%的几率掉落粘液球
Dialogue: 2,0:02:33.72,0:02:37.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they have a 0.1% chance to drop a slime ball.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:37.62,0:02:42.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中  你可以用骨粉来复制两格高的花朵
Dialogue: 2,0:02:37.62,0:02:42.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, you are able to duplicate two block tall flowers by using bonemeal.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.66,0:02:46.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只需对高茎花右键使用骨粉  砰的一下就复制好了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:42.66,0:02:46.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just simply right click on the tall flower with bonemeal and bam,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.46,0:02:48.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就能无限复制这种花了
Dialogue: 2,0:02:46.46,0:02:48.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you can get an infinite amount of that flower.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:49.04,0:02:51.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当末地传送门首次加入我的世界时 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:49.04,0:02:51.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When end portals were first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们原本长这样 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:52.24,0:02:54.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they originally looked like this,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,呈现蓝色并带有透明斑块 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,appearing blue with transparent patches.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:57.38,0:02:59.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 这造型还挺酷的 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:57.38,0:02:59.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie, they look kinda cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.54,0:03:01.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家生成一个我的世界存档 
Dialogue: 2,0:02:59.54,0:03:01.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If the player generates a Minecraft world,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.04,0:03:09.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么再次生成完全相同世界种子的概率是280万亿分之一 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:02.04,0:03:06.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then there is a 1 in 280 trillion chance of you generating
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.36,0:03:09.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that exact same world seed for a second time.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 概率极低 但确实存在可能 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:09.38,0:03:11.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, very rare, but still possible.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:11.96,0:03:17.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要塞里的单个图书馆恰好有233个书架 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:11.96,0:03:17.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There are exactly 233 bookshelves in a single library within a stronghold.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.96,0:03:24.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着玩家拆光整个图书馆的书架后 最多能获得699本书 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:17.96,0:03:21.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This means the player can yield up to 699 books
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.81,0:03:24.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when they destroy every bookshelf within one library.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.00,0:03:29.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.9战斗更新的15w31a快照中 
Dialogue: 2,0:03:25.00,0:03:29.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the 15w31a snapshot for the 1.9 combat update,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:29.66,0:03:34.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过用粘土搭建苦力怕脸来重生末影龙  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:29.66,0:03:34.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the player could respawn the ender dragon by building a creeper face made out of clay.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.94,0:03:37.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个功能当然只是个占位设计  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:34.94,0:03:37.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this feature was of course a placeholder,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但依然非常酷炫  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:37.82,0:03:39.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it's still really cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:39.44,0:03:41.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当铁傀儡生命值偏低时  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:39.44,0:03:41.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If an iron golem is low on health,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.68,0:03:45.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对其右键使用铁锭即可为其治疗  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:41.68,0:03:45.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you can heal them by right clicking on them with an iron ingot.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:45.72,0:03:46.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,感觉好些了吗  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:45.72,0:03:46.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You feeling better now,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.76,0:03:47.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,伙计？  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:46.76,0:03:47.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,mate?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可太喜欢铁傀儡了  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:47.10,0:03:48.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I love iron golems, man.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:48.54,0:03:52.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,击败末影龙后生成的末地折跃门  
Dialogue: 2,0:03:48.54,0:03:52.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The end gateway portal that generates after defeating the ender dragon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.81,0:03:56.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,are usually entered when you throw an ender pearl at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:52.81,0:03:56.19,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,通常需要朝其投掷末影珍珠才能进入
Dialogue: 1,0:03:56.28,0:04:04.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过更简便的通行方式是  直接在基岩上放置活板门  然后强行挤进去
Dialogue: 2,0:03:56.28,0:03:59.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, an easier way to travel through the portal is
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:04.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to simply place a trapdoor on the bedrock and force in the crawling position.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.82,0:04:05.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,完成这个操作后 
Dialogue: 2,0:04:04.82,0:04:05.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Once you've done that,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,爬进去就能瞬间传送
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.88,0:04:07.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,just crawl through and bam,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:07.68,0:04:08.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就能找到一座末地城
Dialogue: 2,0:04:07.68,0:04:08.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you can find an end city.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你仔细观察铁轨转角处的纹理
Dialogue: 2,0:04:09.20,0:04:11.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you look closely at the corner rail texture,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.76,0:04:14.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现它酷似一把铁镐
Dialogue: 2,0:04:11.76,0:04:14.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that it closely resembles an iron pickaxe,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设计其实相当酷炫
Dialogue: 2,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is quite cool actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.54,0:04:19.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界中有多种不同类型的台阶
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.54,0:04:19.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There are many different types of slabs in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.58,0:04:22.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但史上首个被创造出来的台阶  其实是泥土台阶
Dialogue: 2,0:04:19.58,0:04:22.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but the first slab ever created was the dirt slab,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它的外观长这样
Dialogue: 2,0:04:22.80,0:04:24.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我们终究没能等来泥土台阶
Dialogue: 2,0:04:24.34,0:04:26.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,We never even got the dirt slab,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,愿它安息吧
Dialogue: 2,0:04:26.26,0:04:27.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so rest in peace.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:27.46,0:04:31.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,基岩的纹理其实就是石头纹理
Dialogue: 2,0:04:27.46,0:04:31.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The bedrock texture in Minecraft is just the stone texture,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:31.48,0:04:33.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只不过对比度调得极高
Dialogue: 2,0:04:31.48,0:04:33.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but with a really high contrast.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:33.80,0:04:35.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:36.16,0:04:41.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想要获得宠物猫  得先在丛林生物群系驯服豹猫
Dialogue: 2,0:04:36.16,0:04:41.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,cats were instead obtained as a pet by taming an ocelot in a jungle biome.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在1.14版本更新后
Dialogue: 2,0:04:41.26,0:04:43.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But then in version 1.14,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.52,0:04:47.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,流浪猫成了独立生物  直接在村庄里刷新
Dialogue: 2,0:04:43.52,0:04:47.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,stray cats became their own separate mob and spawned in villages.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.9战斗更新的快照阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:04:47.82,0:04:50.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the snapshot phase for the 1.9 combat update,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.78,0:04:53.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时船存在一个漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:04:50.78,0:04:53.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a glitch existed when it came to boats.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以当玩家把船放在粘液块上时
Dialogue: 2,0:04:53.62,0:04:56.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if the player placed a boat on a slime block,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,等待几秒钟后
Dialogue: 2,0:04:56.98,0:04:58.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,waited a few seconds,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然后进入船中
Dialogue: 2,0:04:58.14,0:04:59.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then got into the boat,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就会被弹射到高空
Dialogue: 2,0:04:59.50,0:05:01.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you would be launched up into the air.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:01.62,0:05:04.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而且等待上船的时间越长
Dialogue: 2,0:05:01.62,0:05:04.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Also, the longer you waited to get into the boat,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,弹射高度就会越高
Dialogue: 2,0:05:04.64,0:05:06.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the higher you would be launched,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.50,0:05:07.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直太酷了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:06.50,0:05:07.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was so cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.86,0:05:12.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是我的世界地牢结构的  第一张历史性截图
Dialogue: 2,0:05:07.86,0:05:12.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is the first ever screenshot for a Minecraft stronghold structure.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:12.60,0:05:17.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如你所见 这座地牢外观相当独特  而且罕见地生成在了地表
Dialogue: 2,0:05:12.60,0:05:17.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As you can see, the stronghold looks rather different and has also generated on the surface,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这与我们现在的地牢结构截然不同
Dialogue: 2,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is quite a change to the strongholds we have today.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.04,0:05:23.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你仔细观察我的世界中的快捷栏
Dialogue: 2,0:05:21.04,0:05:23.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you look closely at your hotbar in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,会发现每个物品槽都使用了沙子纹理
Dialogue: 2,0:05:24.16,0:05:27.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that each slot is using the sand texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 我第一次注意到这个细节时惊呆了
Dialogue: 2,0:05:27.88,0:05:30.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I won't lie, this blew me away when I first noticed this.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.18,0:05:34.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,猪灵能够开关门
Dialogue: 2,0:05:31.18,0:05:34.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Piglins are able to open and close doors,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:34.38,0:05:36.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说这其实挺吓人的
Dialogue: 2,0:05:34.38,0:05:36.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is actually quite terrifying to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们都知道动物被火烧死时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:37.02,0:05:39.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that when an animal dies to fire,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.10,0:05:42.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,会掉落熟的食物
Dialogue: 2,0:05:40.10,0:05:42.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it drops its cooked variant of the food.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但当动物被营火烧死时
Dialogue: 2,0:05:42.80,0:05:45.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, when an animal dies to a campfire,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,却会掉落生肉
Dialogue: 2,0:05:45.90,0:05:48.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it drops the raw variant of the food,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这确实有点奇怪
Dialogue: 2,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is rather strange to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.96,0:05:57.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,爬行功能使用的动画与游泳动画完全相同 两者看起来都很棒
Dialogue: 2,0:05:50.96,0:05:53.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The crawling feature in Minecraft uses the exact
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:57.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,same animation as the swimming animation and both look awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:58.02,0:06:04.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在创造模式物品栏中 耐久III附魔书同时出现在工具标签页和武器标签页
Dialogue: 2,0:05:58.02,0:06:01.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The Unbreaking 3 book appears in both the tools tab
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:04.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and the weapons tab in the creative inventory.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:04.54,0:06:09.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,音乐唱片11的播放时长正好是1分11秒
Dialogue: 2,0:06:04.54,0:06:09.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The music disc 11 will play for exactly 1 minute and 11 seconds.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.48,0:06:16.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.14.4版本中 船存在一个漏洞：每次在船上跳跃时
Dialogue: 2,0:06:09.48,0:06:16.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In version 1.14.4, there was a glitch with boats where each jump you made on top of a boat,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,上岸行走时会累积坠落伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,fall damage was added for when you walked on land.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.80,0:06:24.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如 我在船上跳4次然后上岸
Dialogue: 2,0:06:19.80,0:06:24.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So for example, if I jump 4 times on top of the boat and then walk on land,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:25.02,0:06:27.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就会受到2颗心的伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:06:25.02,0:06:27.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I will take 2 hearts of damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:27.48,0:06:32.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 利用这个漏洞 你完全可以通过在船上跳跃来杀死自己或朋友
Dialogue: 2,0:06:27.48,0:06:32.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, with this glitch you could essentially kill you or your friend by jumping on boats.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:32.86,0:06:36.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,被驯服的狼默认项圈颜色是红色
Dialogue: 2,0:06:32.86,0:06:36.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The default collar colour for a tamed wolf is red.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:36.20,0:06:38.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过在1.8版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:36.20,0:06:38.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in version 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.24,0:06:42.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,被驯服的狼默认项圈颜色不知为何被改成了橙色
Dialogue: 2,0:06:38.24,0:06:42.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the default collar colour for a tamed wolf was changed to orange for some reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.00,0:06:48.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,输入数字0作为种子时 系统会随机生成一个种子数值
Dialogue: 2,0:06:43.00,0:06:48.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Trying to generate a seed using the number 0 will just give you a random seed number.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:48.74,0:06:52.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着获得数字0作为种子是不可能的
Dialogue: 2,0:06:48.74,0:06:52.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This means that getting the number 0 seed is impossible,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.64,0:06:52.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:06:52.64,0:06:52.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:53.12,0:06:54.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其实 并非如此
Dialogue: 2,0:06:53.12,0:06:54.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well actually, no.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你用以下种子生成世界 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:54.86,0:06:57.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you generate a world using the following seed,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:58.08,0:07:00.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然后在游戏内输入指令/seed 
Dialogue: 2,0:06:58.08,0:07:00.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then type slash seed within the world,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:00.06,0:07:03.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现种子数值实际上就是0
Dialogue: 2,0:07:00.06,0:07:03.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that the seed number is in fact 0,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:03.54,0:07:06.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这说明确实有可能获得0号种子
Dialogue: 2,0:07:03.54,0:07:06.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which shows that it is possible to get the 0 seed.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当杀手兔最初加入我的世界时  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the killer bunny was first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:10.26,0:07:15.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它在自然生成时有1/2500的几率出现  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:10.26,0:07:15.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it had a 1 in 2,500 chance to naturally spawn in your world.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:15.44,0:07:20.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如今它只是个未被启用的生物  只能通过指令生成  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:15.44,0:07:20.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, nowadays it's just an unused mob and you can only spawn it in using commands,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.78,0:07:22.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这有点可惜  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:20.78,0:07:22.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a bit of a shame to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:22.70,0:07:24.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在熔炉里烧制湿海绵时  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:22.70,0:07:24.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you smelt a wet sponge in a furnace,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:25.04,0:07:26.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,往熔炉里放个空桶  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:25.04,0:07:26.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then put a bucket in the furnace,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.98,0:07:31.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当海绵烧制完成时  桶会自动装满水  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:26.98,0:07:31.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the bucket will be filled with water when the finished sponge is smelting.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是Alpha和Beta时期  
Dialogue: 2,0:07:33.68,0:07:35.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha and beta days of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,骷髅持弓的姿势是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,skeletons used to hold their bows like this,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.94,0:07:41.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来非常非常诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:07:38.94,0:07:41.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked really, really weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.58,0:07:44.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,羊仍然能够透过半砖吃草
Dialogue: 2,0:07:41.58,0:07:44.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Sheep are still able to eat grass through slabs,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.68,0:07:47.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你到底是怎么做到的 老兄？
Dialogue: 2,0:07:44.68,0:07:47.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,how on earth are you doing this mate?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:47.24,0:07:51.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界中最稀有的生物群系是经过变种的丛林边缘地带
Dialogue: 2,0:07:47.24,0:07:51.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The rarest biome in Minecraft is the modified jungle edge,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:51.74,0:07:55.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是丛林生物群系中极其罕见的变种
Dialogue: 2,0:07:51.74,0:07:55.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is an extremely rare variation of the jungle biome.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:55.38,0:08:04.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个生物群系稀有到仅占主世界百万分之一  也就是0.0001%的面积
Dialogue: 2,0:07:55.38,0:08:04.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This biome is so rare that it only covers a millionth or 0.0001% of the Minecraft overworld.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.32,0:08:07.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正如你们所知  当箱子最初加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:08:04.32,0:08:07.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As some of you know, when chests were first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们原本是一个完整的方块  看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:08:07.80,0:08:10.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they were a full block looking like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:10.74,0:08:16.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你们知道吗  老版本的双联箱子中间  其实有一条黑色分割线
Dialogue: 2,0:08:10.74,0:08:16.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But did you guys also know that the old double chest had a black outline going down the middle,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.62,0:08:17.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就像这样？
Dialogue: 2,0:08:16.62,0:08:17.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.16,0:08:21.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今我的世界里的双联箱子  已经没有了这条分割线
Dialogue: 2,0:08:18.16,0:08:21.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Double chests in Minecraft today do not have this outline.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.66,0:08:28.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,鞘翅的设计灵感其实源自  超级马里奥64中马里奥穿戴的翅膀帽道具
Dialogue: 2,0:08:21.66,0:08:28.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The elytra wings are actually a reference to the wing cap item Mario wears in Super Mario 64.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:29.32,0:08:30.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 这游戏真棒
Dialogue: 2,0:08:29.32,0:08:30.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Great game by the way.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.46,0:08:33.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当末地石最初加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:08:30.46,0:08:33.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When end stone was first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它最初会掉落圆石作为占位物品
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it used to drop cobblestone as a placeholder.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.96,0:08:40.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界中的猫比豹猫体型略小
Dialogue: 2,0:08:36.96,0:08:40.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Cats in Minecraft are slightly smaller than ocelots.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.80,0:08:42.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:08:40.80,0:08:42.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:42.58,0:08:48.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,基岩版还有个独家特性  下雪时树叶会变成霜白色
Dialogue: 2,0:08:42.58,0:08:48.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there is an exclusive feature where leaves will turn to a white frosty colour when it is snowing.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.64,0:08:50.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,太酷了
Dialogue: 2,0:08:48.64,0:08:50.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, that is awesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么Java版就没有这个特性呢
Dialogue: 2,0:08:50.22,0:08:52.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Why can't Java Edition have this feature,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是蜘蛛在游戏中的首张截图
Dialogue: 2,0:08:52.60,0:08:55.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is the first ever screenshot of spiders.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们最初是棕色的 还长着黑色眼睛
Dialogue: 2,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They were originally brown and had black eyes,
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.84,0:09:01.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而如今游戏里的蜘蛛是黑色身躯配红色眼睛
Dialogue: 2,0:08:58.84,0:09:01.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas in Minecraft today they're black and have red eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.22,0:09:06.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,猪是我的世界现存历史最悠久的被动型生物
Dialogue: 2,0:09:02.22,0:09:06.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The pig is the oldest existing passive mob in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.72,0:09:09.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果生物手持不死图腾
Dialogue: 2,0:09:06.72,0:09:09.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a mob is holding a totem of undying,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.58,0:09:13.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么它的效果将与玩家濒死时完全一致
Dialogue: 2,0:09:09.58,0:09:13.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it will actually work the same as it does for the player when they're about to die,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我觉得这简直帅呆了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:13.56,0:09:15.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is pretty cool if you ask me.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:15.72,0:09:23.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,化石是我的世界中最稀有的生成结构之一  因为每个区块中它们仅有1/64的生成概率
Dialogue: 2,0:09:15.72,0:09:19.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Fossils are one of the rarest generated structures in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.91,0:09:23.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as they only have a 1 in 64 chance to generate per chunk.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:24.70,0:09:31.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,同时按下键盘上的F3和F4键  可以切换我的世界中的所有游戏模式
Dialogue: 2,0:09:24.70,0:09:31.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Pressing F3 and F4 on your keyboard allows you to switch between all the game modes in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:31.48,0:09:36.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,狐狸有5%的几率会叼着绿宝石生成
Dialogue: 2,0:09:31.48,0:09:36.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There is a 5% chance for a fox to spawn with an emerald in its mouth,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.56,0:09:38.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要我说 这简直是欧皇附体才能撞见
Dialogue: 2,0:09:36.56,0:09:38.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is quite a lucky find if you ask me.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.96,0:09:42.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你身处云层下方时 无法透过云层看到上方景象
Dialogue: 2,0:09:38.96,0:09:42.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are not able to see through clouds when you are below them,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但若置身云层之上 便能俯瞰云海
Dialogue: 2,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you can see through them if you are above them.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.98,0:09:46.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真奇怪 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:45.98,0:09:46.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Very strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,制作这期视频时我漏讲了一个冷知识
Dialogue: 2,0:09:47.18,0:09:49.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I forgot to do one of the facts while making this video,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:50.04,0:09:52.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以我现在半梦半醒地补上这条
Dialogue: 2,0:09:50.04,0:09:52.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so here I am doing it while half asleep.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:52.22,0:09:57.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界中的物品展示框  使用的纹理与白桦木板完全相同
Dialogue: 2,0:09:52.22,0:09:57.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So, item frames in Minecraft use the same texture as the birch planks texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.50,0:09:57.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:09:57.50,0:09:57.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我要去睡觉了
Dialogue: 2,0:09:58.38,0:09:59.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to bed now.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.76,0:10:01.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:09:59.76,0:10:01.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:02.08,0:10:06.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,南瓜在自然生成时  就已经自带雕刻好的鬼脸
Dialogue: 2,0:10:02.08,0:10:06.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,pumpkins used to naturally spawn with their face already carved.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在如今的我的世界版本中  南瓜自然生成时  不再自带雕刻面容了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:06.54,0:10:08.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, they don't,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:08.62,0:10:11.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在你需要用剪刀  自己雕刻南瓜脸了
Dialogue: 2,0:10:08.62,0:10:11.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and you instead have to carve your own pumpkin face with shears.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.06,0:10:14.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你进入旁观者游戏模式 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:12.06,0:10:14.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you go into game mode spectator mode,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然后左键点击一幅画
Dialogue: 2,0:10:14.42,0:10:15.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then left click on a painting,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.98,0:10:18.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就能透过画作的视角  观察你的我的世界世界
Dialogue: 2,0:10:15.98,0:10:18.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you can see your Minecraft world through the eyes of a,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.66,0:10:19.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,嗯 画作 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:18.66,0:10:19.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,well, painting.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:19.96,0:10:24.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,站在灵魂沙旁边靠近岩浆时  玩家真的会被点燃
Dialogue: 2,0:10:19.96,0:10:24.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Standing on soul sand next to lava will actually set the player on fire.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,哎哟 这可真疼
Dialogue: 2,0:10:25.12,0:10:26.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Ow, this hurts quite a lot.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.06,0:10:33.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,苦力怕之所以呈现鲜绿色  是因为游戏创始人Notch希望它们能完美融入草丛环境
Dialogue: 2,0:10:27.06,0:10:30.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The reason why creepers are their bright green colour is
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.68,0:10:33.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because Minecraft creator Notch wanted them to blend in and be
Dialogue: 1,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,与我的世界早期地形中的草丛融为一体
Dialogue: 2,0:10:34.76,0:10:37.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,camouflaged with Minecraft's old world terrain,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.70,0:10:40.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时游戏里的草丛  正是这种鲜绿色
Dialogue: 2,0:10:37.70,0:10:40.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which at the time was a bright green colour.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:10:40.26,0:10:42.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:42.70,0:10:51.09,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.5版本更新中游戏曾出现一个bug  恶魂会向玩家喷射钻石头盔  而非它们原本的火球攻击
Dialogue: 2,0:10:42.70,0:10:46.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the 1.5 update, there was a bug in the game where ghasts would shoot
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.94,0:10:51.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,diamond helmets at the player instead of their regular fireball.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.14,0:10:53.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 如果恶魂朝我发射钻石头盔 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:51.14,0:10:53.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, if a ghast was shooting diamond helmets at me,
Dialogue: 1,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我可不会抱怨 毕竟白捡钻石啊
Dialogue: 2,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't complain, it's free diamonds after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,呃 算是吧 
Dialogue: 2,0:10:56.78,0:10:57.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:57.82,0:11:04.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,普通南瓜的藤茎  永远指向我的世界地图的西北方向  
Dialogue: 2,0:10:57.82,0:11:00.41,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The pumpkin stems on regular pumpkins
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.41,0:11:04.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,will always face in the northwest direction of your Minecraft world,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此它们是非常实用的导航工具  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:04.62,0:11:06.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making them very useful for navigation.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:06.84,0:11:11.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你是否好奇过  沙漠神殿主体上方为何会有个小房间？  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:06.84,0:11:11.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Have you ever wondered why there's this small room above the main part of a desert pyramid?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我来揭晓答案  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:12.22,0:11:13.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:13.42,0:11:20.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,沙漠神殿二楼的空间  恰好能完美搭建一个全功率信标  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:13.42,0:11:16.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So the second floor of the desert temple actually
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.51,0:11:20.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,allows you to perfectly build a fully powered beacon,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,令人极度舒适  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:20.66,0:11:22.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is so satisfying.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:22.60,0:11:23.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然不确定  是否是开发者有意为之  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:22.60,0:11:23.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Whether this was done on purpose,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:24.18,0:11:27.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但二楼确实是安放信标的绝佳位置  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:24.18,0:11:27.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but the second floor is perfect for a beacon.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.54,0:11:34.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,猪灵蛮兵击败后  会掉落20点经验值  
Dialogue: 2,0:11:27.54,0:11:30.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The Piglin Brute mob drops the highest amount of
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.68,0:11:34.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,experience points out of any non-boss mob in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.90,0:11:37.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是我的世界普通生物中经验值最高的
Dialogue: 2,0:11:34.90,0:11:37.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,dropping a total of 20 experience.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说 这再合理不过了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I should hope so,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这些家伙打起来可太烦人了
Dialogue: 2,0:11:39.44,0:11:41.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,these guys are so annoying to kill.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.76,0:11:48.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,岩浆怪行走时的摇摆动作  最初是个意外产物
Dialogue: 2,0:11:41.76,0:11:48.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The bobbing animation that the strider makes while walking was initially created by accident.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而开发者们认为这个效果  用他们原话说
Dialogue: 2,0:11:48.56,0:11:51.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, the developers thought it was quote,
Dialogue: 1,0:11:51.36,0:11:54.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,“既古怪又有趣”于是便将其保留为正式特性
Dialogue: 2,0:11:51.36,0:11:54.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,quirky and fun, so it was added as a feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.16,0:11:59.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界中  目前存在一个关于盾牌的漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:11:55.16,0:11:59.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, there is currently a glitch in the game when it comes to shields.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.16,0:12:03.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以当你举着盾牌  穿过下界传送门时
Dialogue: 2,0:12:00.16,0:12:03.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you hold up a shield while entering a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:03.68,0:12:06.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就会发生非常诡异的现象
Dialogue: 2,0:12:03.68,0:12:06.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then something very strange will happen.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:06.32,0:12:07.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一旦进入下界
Dialogue: 2,0:12:06.32,0:12:07.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So once you are in the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.06,0:12:10.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你的盾牌会一直处于防御状态
Dialogue: 2,0:12:08.06,0:12:10.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,your shield will always be in use,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:10.74,0:12:13.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,即便你没有右键点击  它也会持续保持防御姿态
Dialogue: 2,0:12:10.74,0:12:13.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,even when you're not right clicking on it to hold it up,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这反而相当实用 
Dialogue: 2,0:12:13.44,0:12:14.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very useful.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.86,0:12:20.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为即使盾牌处于防御状态  你依然可以冲刺和使用武器
Dialogue: 2,0:12:14.86,0:12:20.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is because you can still sprint and use your weapons while the shield is protecting you.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:20.46,0:12:22.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 这真是个绝妙的漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:12:20.46,0:12:22.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, a very good glitch.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.48,0:12:26.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果狐狸在雪地生物群系中  试图扑杀一只鸡
Dialogue: 2,0:12:22.48,0:12:26.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a fox attempts to pounce and kill a chicken in a snow biome,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,狐狸可能会  卡在雪地里
Dialogue: 2,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the fox can get stuck in snow.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:28.92,0:12:29.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,狐狸兄 你还好吗
Dialogue: 2,0:12:28.92,0:12:29.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You okay there, fox?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看来你需要帮把手
Dialogue: 2,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It looks like you could do with a bit of help.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:31.92,0:12:37.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从末影人身上安全获取末影珍珠的有效方法  就是将它们困在船里
Dialogue: 2,0:12:31.92,0:12:37.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A safe and effective way to get enderpearls from endermen is to trap them in a boat.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:37.94,0:12:41.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为一旦末影人被船困住
Dialogue: 2,0:12:37.94,0:12:41.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is because once the endermen is trapped in the boat,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们就无法传送逃走  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:41.38,0:12:43.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they cannot teleport away,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.40,0:12:46.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这样你就能随意击杀它们  获取末影珍珠了  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:43.40,0:12:46.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which means you're just free to kill them for the enderpearls.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 我有点愧疚  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:46.24,0:12:48.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie, I feel a bit bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.44,0:12:49.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对不起啊 末影人  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:48.44,0:12:49.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, endermen.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在早期版本的我的世界中  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:49.46,0:12:51.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,史莱姆还没有游泳能力  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:52.06,0:12:54.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,slimes were not given the ability to swim,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以每当它们进入水中  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:55.04,0:12:56.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so whenever they entered the water,
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.92,0:13:00.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就会缓缓沉底  最终溺亡  
Dialogue: 2,0:12:56.92,0:13:00.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they would just slowly sink to the bottom and eventually drown,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:00.62,0:13:02.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这让我非常非常难过  
Dialogue: 2,0:13:00.62,0:13:02.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which made me very, very sad.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.04,0:13:05.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过别担心 现在的游戏里
Dialogue: 2,0:13:03.04,0:13:05.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.26,0:13:09.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,史莱姆已经学会了游泳  它们能在水中游动  并试图攻击你
Dialogue: 2,0:13:05.26,0:13:09.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,slimes have had swimming lessons and they can swim around and attempt to kill you,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.64,0:13:10.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了 
Dialogue: 2,0:13:09.64,0:13:10.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is just lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:11.02,0:13:15.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当玩家首次放置附魔台并使用时
Dialogue: 2,0:13:11.02,0:13:15.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the player places down an enchanting table and uses it for the first time,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:16.04,0:13:20.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,弓的第一个附魔等级必定是力量Ⅰ
Dialogue: 2,0:13:16.04,0:13:20.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the first level enchantment for a bow will always be power 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:21.14,0:13:22.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:13:21.14,0:13:22.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.06,0:13:27.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,基岩版中营火有个独有特性
Dialogue: 2,0:13:23.06,0:13:27.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there is an exclusive feature in the game when it comes to campfires.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.48,0:13:32.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此如果玩家站在未点燃的营火上时自身着火
Dialogue: 2,0:13:27.48,0:13:32.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if the player stands on an unlit campfire while they're on fire,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,营火就会被自动点燃
Dialogue: 2,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the campfire will actually become lit,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个细节设计相当精妙
Dialogue: 2,0:13:35.02,0:13:37.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a nice attention to detail,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.12,0:13:37.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说 
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.12,0:13:37.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界Java版中
Dialogue: 2,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Java Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.58,0:13:42.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在Java版中  这一特性并不存在
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.58,0:13:42.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,however, this feature is not a thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.20,0:13:46.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是我的世界首次公开的狼群游戏截图 
Dialogue: 2,0:13:42.20,0:13:46.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is the first ever screenshot released for wolves in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如你所见 它们存在显著差异
Dialogue: 2,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As you can see, they have noticeable differences,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.02,0:13:54.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如头部纹理的毛色有所不同
Dialogue: 2,0:13:50.02,0:13:54.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,such as having different fur color on the head part of the texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这张截图让我不禁思考
Dialogue: 2,0:13:54.38,0:13:56.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This screenshot got me thinking,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:56.30,0:14:00.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你觉得我的世界是否应该像加入不同猫咪纹理那样  也为狼群添加多样化外观？
Dialogue: 2,0:13:56.30,0:14:00.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,do you think Minecraft should add different wolf textures just like the cats?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我你的想法
Dialogue: 2,0:14:00.32,0:14:01.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments below.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.88,0:14:06.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管下界合金镐是我的世界中最坚固耐用的镐具
Dialogue: 2,0:14:01.88,0:14:06.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Despite the netherite pickaxe being the strongest and most durable pickaxe in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.32,0:14:11.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,金镐依然是挖掘速度最快的镐
Dialogue: 2,0:14:07.32,0:14:11.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the gold pickaxe is still the pick that minds blocks the fastest.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:11.12,0:14:16.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中  利用船只确实可以突破世界边界
Dialogue: 2,0:14:11.12,0:14:16.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, it is actually possible to get out of the world border by using boats.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.12,0:14:19.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只需在世界边界旁放置一艘船
Dialogue: 2,0:14:17.12,0:14:19.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just simply place a boat next to the world border,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,进入船内 砰的一下
Dialogue: 2,0:14:20.18,0:14:21.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,get into the boat and bam,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就能突破世界边界
Dialogue: 2,0:14:22.08,0:14:23.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll be outside the world border.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过要小心 因为你可能会因此丧命 
Dialogue: 2,0:14:23.78,0:14:26.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Be careful though, because you might die.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:26.32,0:14:28.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:14:26.32,0:14:28.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.54,0:14:30.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界开发版早期
Dialogue: 2,0:14:28.54,0:14:30.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the early versions of Minecraft in dev,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.08,0:14:34.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时游戏里还没有加入工作台方块
Dialogue: 2,0:14:31.08,0:14:34.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the crafting table block was not yet added into the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.70,0:14:38.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是否意味着当时玩家无法合成物品？
Dialogue: 2,0:14:34.70,0:14:38.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So did this mean players could not craft items at the time?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:38.44,0:14:39.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过 事实并非如此
Dialogue: 2,0:14:38.44,0:14:39.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, not exactly.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:39.84,0:14:43.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你按下键盘上的B键 
Dialogue: 2,0:14:39.84,0:14:43.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in in if you press the B key on your keyboard,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:43.70,0:14:49.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,按下键盘上的B键  就能打开3x3合成界面  就像使用普通工作台一样
Dialogue: 2,0:14:43.70,0:14:49.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you would open a 3x3 crafting interface as if you were using a regular crafting table.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:49.94,0:14:54.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,此外 当时按下I键打开物品栏时
Dialogue: 2,0:14:49.94,0:14:54.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Additionally, when you opened your regular inventory at the time by pressing I,
Dialogue: 1,0:14:55.06,0:14:59.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现这里没有2x2合成格  无法制作小型物品
Dialogue: 2,0:14:55.06,0:14:59.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that there's no 2x2 crafting grid to craft smaller items.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.18,0:15:05.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 尽管开发版中  并没有实体工作台
Dialogue: 2,0:15:00.18,0:15:05.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, despite there being no physical crafting table in Minecraft in dev,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你依然可以通过按B键来合成物品
Dialogue: 2,0:15:05.12,0:15:07.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you could still craft items by pressing B.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们都知道 如果攻击一只僵尸猪灵 
Dialogue: 2,0:15:07.96,0:15:10.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that if you hit a zombified piglin,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.04,0:15:16.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么情况就会变得有点疯狂  因为其他所有僵尸猪灵都会对你产生敌意
Dialogue: 2,0:15:11.04,0:15:14.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then things will get a little bit crazy as all the other zombie piglins
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.81,0:15:16.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,will become hostile towards you.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要我说的话 这根本毫无乐趣可言
Dialogue: 2,0:15:16.64,0:15:18.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And if you ask me, that's not fun at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这实在太吓人了
Dialogue: 2,0:15:18.88,0:15:20.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's just very scary.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.36,0:15:24.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你能一击秒杀僵尸猪灵
Dialogue: 2,0:15:20.36,0:15:24.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you manage to kill a zombified piglin in one hit,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:24.50,0:15:27.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么其他僵尸猪灵  就不会对你产生敌意
Dialogue: 2,0:15:24.50,0:15:27.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the rest of them won't become aggro towards you,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是让人松一口气
Dialogue: 2,0:15:27.32,0:15:29.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a very relieving feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 正是如此
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:30.18,0:15:33.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我打赌你绝对想不到  几秒前我刚干掉了你的同伴
Dialogue: 2,0:15:30.18,0:15:33.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I bet you had no idea that I killed your mate just a few seconds ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:33.48,0:15:35.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总之 趁他觉得我可疑之前  咱们赶紧开溜吧
Dialogue: 2,0:15:33.48,0:15:35.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's just move on before he thinks I'm sus.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.56,0:15:40.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果一只苦力怕被施加了药水效果后爆炸 
Dialogue: 2,0:15:35.56,0:15:40.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a creeper is inflicted with a potion effect and proceeds to explode,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:40.96,0:15:44.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,爆炸后会留下该药水的滞留效果
Dialogue: 2,0:15:40.96,0:15:44.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it will leave behind a lingering form of said potion,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我这里就是剧毒效果 
Dialogue: 2,0:15:44.28,0:15:46.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which in my case is poison.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界多人游戏中
Dialogue: 2,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft multiplayer,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你的朋友在海边蹲下时  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:48.20,0:15:50.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if your friend crouches by the ocean,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:50.48,0:15:55.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,透过他的名牌看水面  水会变得透明  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:50.48,0:15:55.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the water itself becomes see-through when you look through your friend's name tag,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这相当诡异  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:55.24,0:15:56.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is rather strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,谢了Derpy Whale  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:56.78,0:15:58.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the help Derpy Whale,
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这样我看水下清楚多了  
Dialogue: 2,0:15:58.14,0:16:00.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm able to see underwater a lot easier.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 说到水  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:00.70,0:16:01.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Wait, speaking of water,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:02.24,0:16:03.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,快回水里去  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:02.24,0:16:03.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,get back in the water,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可是鲸鱼啊  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:03.16,0:16:04.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you're a whale.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界里  你可以在水下造雪傀儡  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:04.28,0:16:07.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, you are able to create snow golems underwater,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:08.06,0:16:11.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这毫无意义  因为它们会立刻开始掉血
Dialogue: 2,0:16:08.06,0:16:11.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it's a pretty pointless task as they'll just instantly start dying.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉伙计 为了视频效果我不得不这么做  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry mate, I had to do it for the purpose of the video,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,请原谅我  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:14.18,0:16:15.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,please forgive me.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.10,0:16:16.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但不知为何  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:15.10,0:16:16.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, for some reason,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.88,0:16:20.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,水下无法生成铁傀儡  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:16.88,0:16:20.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you are not able to create iron golems underwater,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管生成机制和雪傀儡相同  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:20.22,0:16:23.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,even though the spawn concept is the same as a snow golem.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,搞什么啊 我就盯着个南瓜  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:23.70,0:16:25.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What gives man, I'm just staring at a pumpkin,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这可不是我想要的  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:26.20,0:16:27.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this isn't what I want,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.16,0:16:29.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我想要铁傀儡给我献虞美人  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:27.16,0:16:29.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I want an iron golem to hold a poppy out for me.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.46,0:16:33.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2009年告示牌刚加入我的世界时  
Dialogue: 2,0:16:29.46,0:16:33.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the sign was first added into Minecraft in 2009,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们只能以实体形式生成
Dialogue: 2,0:16:33.74,0:16:36.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they could only be spawned in as entities,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:36.38,0:16:39.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时只能通过按键盘上的B键来生成它们
Dialogue: 2,0:16:36.38,0:16:39.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and this was done by pressing the B key on your keyboard.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:39.78,0:16:42.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一旦生成 它们总会显示：
Dialogue: 2,0:16:39.78,0:16:42.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Once spawned in, they would always say,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是告示牌的测试
Dialogue: 2,0:16:42.22,0:16:43.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this is a test of the signs,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,每行可写15个字
Dialogue: 2,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,each line can be 15 characters,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:46.18,0:16:50.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这些实体告示牌看起来确实非常诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:16:46.18,0:16:50.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, these signs just look really really weird as entities.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:50.42,0:16:53.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,众所周知 若在箱子上放置泥土方块
Dialogue: 2,0:16:50.42,0:16:53.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As you know, if you have a dirt block on top of a chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.00,0:16:56.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就无法打开箱子
Dialogue: 2,0:16:54.00,0:16:56.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are not able to open it.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:56.36,0:16:59.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但若用锄头翻耕这块泥土
Dialogue: 2,0:16:56.36,0:16:59.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you use a hoe on the dirt,
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.28,0:17:03.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就能成功打开箱子 正如所见
Dialogue: 2,0:16:59.28,0:17:03.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are in fact able to open the chest as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:03.22,0:17:08.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我现在说话这么小声  是因为这段旁白是凌晨四点录的
Dialogue: 2,0:17:03.22,0:17:05.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The reason why I'm talking so quietly right now
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.99,0:17:08.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is because I'm recording this fact at 4 in the morning.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总之 继续往下看
Dialogue: 2,0:17:08.80,0:17:09.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.30,0:17:19.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.8版本之前  錾制石砖曾是游戏中最稀有的方块之一
Dialogue: 2,0:17:12.30,0:17:16.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,before version 1.8, the chiselled stone brick was considered to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.76,0:17:19.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,be one of the rarest blocks in the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.58,0:17:26.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是由于錾制石砖当时没有合成配方  只能自然生成于
Dialogue: 2,0:17:19.58,0:17:24.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was due to the chiselled stone brick not having a crafting recipe
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.01,0:17:26.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and could only be found naturally generated in a
Dialogue: 1,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,丛林神庙结构中
Dialogue: 2,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,jungle temple structure,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而丛林神庙本身也是相当罕见的建筑
Dialogue: 2,0:17:28.46,0:17:30.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which are also quite rare as well.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你仔细观察疣猪兽的纹理
Dialogue: 2,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you look closely at the hoglin's texture,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现它的一个鼻孔比另一个大
Dialogue: 2,0:17:33.20,0:17:36.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that it has one nostril bigger than the other.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,帅呆了 疣猪兽！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:37.02,0:17:38.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Looking good, hoglin!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 你在干什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:38.60,0:17:39.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Wait, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.50,0:17:39.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你在干什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:17:39.50,0:17:39.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,别杀我！
Dialogue: 2,0:17:40.28,0:17:41.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Don't kill me!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:17:41.62,0:17:43.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,附魔台
Dialogue: 2,0:17:43.46,0:17:44.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the enchanting table,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:44.84,0:17:47.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,放置时  会发出12级的光照强度
Dialogue: 2,0:17:44.84,0:17:47.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when placed, will emit a light level of 12.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.18,0:17:49.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在Java版中
Dialogue: 2,0:17:48.18,0:17:49.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Java Edition however,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们则不会发出任何光照
Dialogue: 2,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they don't emit any light level,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.82,0:17:53.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就有点逊了 
Dialogue: 2,0:17:51.82,0:17:53.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a bit lame.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:53.88,0:17:57.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2009年苦力怕首次加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:17:53.88,0:17:57.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the creeper was first added into Minecraft in 2009,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.18,0:18:01.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们的纹理采用了更深的绿色调 
Dialogue: 2,0:17:58.18,0:18:01.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,their texture had a much darker shade of green,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.58,0:18:02.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样的 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:01.58,0:18:02.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:02.76,0:18:04.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.28,0:18:12.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Alpha版曾计划实现一个特性 地狱传送门会在主世界生成恶魂 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:05.28,0:18:09.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in Minecraft Alpha, there was a feature planned where ghasts
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.19,0:18:12.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would spawn from nether portals in the overworld.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这个特性最终未能实装 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:12.78,0:18:15.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, the feature was never implemented.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.50,0:18:19.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这倒是件好事   否则绝对会引发大混乱 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:15.50,0:18:19.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And good thing too, because that would be absolutely mayhem.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:19.38,0:18:21.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,箭矢最初加入游戏时 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:19.38,0:18:21.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the arrow was first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,合成配方是 一根羽毛 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:22.16,0:18:24.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was originally crafted with one feather,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一根木棍  和一块铁锭 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:24.96,0:18:27.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,one stick and one iron ingot.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在现今版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:27.18,0:18:28.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Whereas in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.38,0:18:29.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,配方改为了 一根羽毛 
Dialogue: 2,0:18:28.38,0:18:29.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it's crafted with one feather,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一根木棍和一块燧石  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:29.84,0:18:31.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,one stick and one flint.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.78,0:18:34.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最初幼年僵尸不会在阳光下燃烧  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:31.78,0:18:34.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Originally, baby zombies did not burn in sunlight,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这让玩家们不胜其烦  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:35.18,0:18:37.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making them extremely annoying for players,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.78,0:18:38.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但现在它们也会被阳光灼烧  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:37.78,0:18:38.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but now they do.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.82,0:18:46.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,基岩版中弩的装填动画  实际上与Java版有所不同  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.82,0:18:42.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The animation for loading a crossbow in Minecraft Bedrock Edition
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.89,0:18:45.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is actually different to the animation in Java Edition
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.00,0:18:46.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正如你所见  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:46.00,0:18:46.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知道有没有人尝试过  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:47.10,0:18:48.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know if anyone's actually tried this,
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.86,0:18:52.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你无法在末地激活地狱传送门  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:48.86,0:18:52.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you are not able to make a nether portal in the end.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.46,0:18:57.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,指南针永远指向  你创建世界时的出生点  
Dialogue: 2,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A compass will always point towards the world spawn point
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:57.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from where you first created the Minecraft world.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:58.10,0:19:01.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过用这些材料合成指南针毫无意义
Dialogue: 2,0:18:58.10,0:19:01.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, using the materials to craft a compass is pointless,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为若将合成配方摆在工作台中
Dialogue: 2,0:19:01.74,0:19:04.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because if you lay out the crafting recipe in the grid,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.68,0:19:08.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现指南针预览图标  已经指向了你的出生点
Dialogue: 2,0:19:04.68,0:19:08.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll see that the compass preview is already pointing towards your spawn,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此根本没必要合成它
Dialogue: 2,0:19:08.20,0:19:09.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so there's no need to craft it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the Bedrock Edition of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.20,0:19:15.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家的眼睛现在会像这样眨动
Dialogue: 2,0:19:12.20,0:19:15.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players eyes will actually now blink as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:15.62,0:19:18.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知道这算是诡异  还是超酷的功能
Dialogue: 2,0:19:15.62,0:19:18.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I don't know if that's just creepy or a really cool feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的Alpha版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:19:18.68,0:19:20.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the alpha version of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.84,0:19:23.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,熔炉顶部曾使用过石头材质
Dialogue: 2,0:19:20.84,0:19:23.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the top of the furnace had the stone texture,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:23.20,0:19:26.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,使其极易与普通石块融为一体
Dialogue: 2,0:19:23.20,0:19:26.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making it very easy to blend in with regular stone.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.44,0:19:30.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你拾取物品的顺序  永远与丢弃时的顺序一致
Dialogue: 2,0:19:26.44,0:19:30.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You will always pick up your items in the same order you threw them on the ground.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.22,0:19:37.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如图所示  用未点燃的营火就能造出超酷的桥梁设计
Dialogue: 2,0:19:31.22,0:19:37.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You can create a pretty cool looking bridge design by using unlit campfires as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个效果我超喜欢
Dialogue: 2,0:19:37.50,0:19:39.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I really like the look of this.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期开发版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:19:39.16,0:19:41.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In an early version of Minecraft in dev,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当移除火把所依附的方块时
Dialogue: 2,0:19:41.70,0:19:44.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when removing the block the torch was placed on,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.34,0:19:48.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,火把会转移到相邻方块上  而非直接掉落
Dialogue: 2,0:19:44.34,0:19:48.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the torch would move to another block instead of falling off the block,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:48.54,0:19:49.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设定简直诡异到离谱
Dialogue: 2,0:19:48.54,0:19:49.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is really weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的远古时期
Dialogue: 2,0:19:49.96,0:19:51.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.20,0:19:57.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Beta 1.9版本中  跳跃竟会莫名给予玩家经验值
Dialogue: 2,0:19:52.20,0:19:57.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in Beta 1.9, jumping would give the player experience for some reason,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.52,0:19:58.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设定有点诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:19:57.52,0:19:58.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a little bit weird,
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.02,0:19:59.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但...行吧
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.02,0:19:59.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but okay.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:59.60,0:20:06.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,同样在Beta 1.9版本中  太阳曾短暂地从方形变成了圆形
Dialogue: 2,0:19:59.60,0:20:06.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Also in Beta 1.9, the sun was changed for a brief time from being a square to a circle,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.62,0:20:07.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:06.62,0:20:07.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,looking like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.94,0:20:12.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家试图睡在已被村民占用的床上
Dialogue: 2,0:20:07.94,0:20:12.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a player tries to sleep in a bed that is occupied by a villager,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.48,0:20:15.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民会被直接踢下床
Dialogue: 2,0:20:12.48,0:20:15.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the villager is kicked out of the bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你怎么能这么残忍？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:15.34,0:20:16.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,How could you be so mean?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:16.94,0:20:20.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,史蒂夫最初的默认皮肤其实是留着胡子的
Dialogue: 2,0:20:16.94,0:20:20.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The original default skin for Steve had a beard.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或者笑脸 也可能是个笑脸 
Dialogue: 2,0:20:20.40,0:20:22.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Or a smile, it could have been a smile too.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:22.94,0:20:24.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Notch 我的世界的创造者
Dialogue: 2,0:20:22.94,0:20:24.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Notch, the creator of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.64,0:20:27.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,曾计划在游戏中加入爆炸箭
Dialogue: 2,0:20:24.64,0:20:27.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,planned to add exploding arrows into the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:27.72,0:20:29.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但遗憾的是这个功能最终未能实现
Dialogue: 2,0:20:27.72,0:20:29.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but sadly this feature never made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有点伤心 看起来挺不错的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.08,0:20:31.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It is kind of sad because they looked really cool
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.98,0:20:38.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,将地毯铺在栅栏上  是玩家自由进出农场的好方法  还能防止敌对生物闯入
Dialogue: 2,0:20:31.98,0:20:35.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Placing carpets on top of fences is a great way for the player
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.46,0:20:38.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to get in and out of their farm without hostile mobs
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.26,0:20:41.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为它们无法攀爬地毯 
Dialogue: 2,0:20:38.26,0:20:41.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,interfering, as they are not able to climb on the carpet.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:20:41.46,0:20:43.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界开发版早期
Dialogue: 2,0:20:43.64,0:20:45.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the early versions of Minecraft in dev,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.08,0:20:51.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,物品堆叠上限曾经是99个  而如今的标准堆叠上限是64个
Dialogue: 2,0:20:46.08,0:20:51.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,items used to stack up to 99 instead of stacking up to 64 like they do today.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.54,0:20:55.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玫瑰丛不会对穿过的玩家造成伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:20:51.54,0:20:55.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Rose bushes do not apply damage to the player when you walk through them,
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.42,0:20:57.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管如你所见 它们确实长着尖刺
Dialogue: 2,0:20:55.42,0:20:57.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,despite them having thorns on them as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你认为他们应该修改这个吗？
Dialogue: 2,0:20:58.20,0:20:59.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you think they should change this?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.74,0:21:00.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我你的想法
Dialogue: 2,0:20:59.74,0:21:00.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.26,0:21:02.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界旧版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:21:01.26,0:21:02.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In older versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:03.06,0:21:08.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在创造模式中攻击敌对生物实际上会引发它们的敌对反应
Dialogue: 2,0:21:03.06,0:21:08.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in creative mode, attacking a hostile mob would actually cause them to be hostile towards you,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:08.44,0:21:09.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实有点烦人 
Dialogue: 2,0:21:08.44,0:21:09.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was a little bit annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:10.22,0:21:14.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我永远都会坚持呼吁  直到他们把这个功能重新加回我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:21:10.22,0:21:14.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I will never stop talking about this until they add this back to Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.28,0:21:16.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而玫瑰曾经存在于游戏中
Dialogue: 2,0:21:14.28,0:21:16.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and that is that the rose used to be in the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:17.04,0:21:20.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但它们被移除了  取而代之的是虞美人
Dialogue: 2,0:21:17.04,0:21:20.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but they removed it and added the poppy instead.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.70,0:21:21.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.70,0:21:21.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.48,0:21:23.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,为什么不能两者并存呢？
Dialogue: 2,0:21:21.48,0:21:23.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Why can't we just have both?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.40,0:21:27.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中  所有向日葵永远都会朝向东方
Dialogue: 2,0:21:23.40,0:21:27.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,All sunflowers found in your Minecraft world will always face east,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这使它们成为非常实用的导航标志
Dialogue: 2,0:21:27.80,0:21:30.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making them quite useful for navigation.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:30.46,0:21:33.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,末影螨若停留在灵魂沙上  会因窒息而死亡
Dialogue: 2,0:21:30.46,0:21:33.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Endermites will suffocate and die if they are on soul sand.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,安息吧 随机生成的末影螨  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace random endermites.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2014年4月1日愚人节当天  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:35.78,0:21:39.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On April Fool's Day, on April 1st 2014,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.52,0:21:44.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所有玩家的皮肤都被替换成了村民皮肤  正如你所见  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:39.52,0:21:44.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,every player had their Minecraft skin replaced by a villager skin as you can see,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:44.58,0:21:46.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这看起来非常滑稽  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:44.58,0:21:46.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked really funny.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:46.36,0:21:52.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,与小史莱姆不同  小型岩浆怪确实能对你造成伤害  如你所见  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:46.36,0:21:52.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Unlike tiny slimes, tiny magma cubes can actually deal damage to you as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:52.56,0:21:55.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若将炼药锅放在户外淋雨  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:52.56,0:21:55.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a cauldron is left outside while it's raining,
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.88,0:21:59.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它就会像这样慢慢积攒雨水  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:55.88,0:21:59.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it will actually slowly fill up with water as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:59.28,0:22:04.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,徒手破坏黑曜石需要4分10秒  
Dialogue: 2,0:21:59.28,0:22:04.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Destroying obsidian with only your fist takes 4 minutes and 10 seconds to do,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.88,0:22:08.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,很不幸 为了做这期视频  我不得不亲自尝试  
Dialogue: 2,0:22:04.88,0:22:08.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and unfortunately I had to do this for the sake of the video,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真希望我没这么干
Dialogue: 2,0:22:08.88,0:22:10.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I wish I didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.16,0:22:12.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你从高处坠落即将摔死
Dialogue: 2,0:22:10.16,0:22:12.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you fall from a high place and you're about to die,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.08,0:22:15.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就在即将触地前退出游戏世界
Dialogue: 2,0:22:13.08,0:22:15.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then exit the world right before you hit the ground,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.92,0:22:20.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,重新加载世界后  你将毫发无损  正如所见
Dialogue: 2,0:22:15.92,0:22:20.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then load back into the world and you won't take any damage as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.54,0:22:22.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的测试版时期 
Dialogue: 2,0:22:20.54,0:22:22.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the beta days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:23.34,0:22:32.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若有人游玩未授权的Minecraft测试版  便会看到“未授权Minecraft测试版”的提示  附带一个悲伤表情
Dialogue: 2,0:22:23.34,0:22:26.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a message reading Minecraft beta unlicensed copy
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.89,0:22:32.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,with a sad face could be seen if someone was to play Minecraft without purchasing the game.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.78,0:22:36.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当苦力怕最初加入Minecraft生存测试时
Dialogue: 2,0:22:32.78,0:22:36.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the creeper was first added in the Minecraft survival test,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.28,0:22:41.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们最初拥有近战攻击能力  每次能对玩家造成2颗心的伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:22:36.28,0:22:41.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they actually had a melee attack and dealt 2 hearts of damage to the player.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:41.62,0:22:43.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家进行远距离移动
Dialogue: 2,0:22:41.62,0:22:43.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If the player was to travel,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:43.76,0:22:47.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或传送至距离出生点三千万方块外的位置
Dialogue: 2,0:22:43.76,0:22:47.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,or teleport, 30 million blocks from the spawn point,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.68,0:22:51.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他们就会抵达世界边界  正如眼前所见  
Dialogue: 2,0:22:47.68,0:22:51.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then they will actually reach a world border as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.36,0:22:53.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当热带鱼在Minecraft中生成时  
Dialogue: 2,0:22:51.36,0:22:53.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When tropical fish spawn in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:54.10,0:23:00.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,90%的概率会呈现屏幕上这22种固定形态  
Dialogue: 2,0:22:54.10,0:23:00.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,90% of the time they will appear as one of the 22 varieties that are seen on screen,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.26,0:23:03.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而剩余10%生成的热带鱼  
Dialogue: 2,0:23:00.26,0:23:03.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas the other 10% of tropical fish that spawn,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:03.32,0:23:06.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其花纹 体型和颜色完全随机  
Dialogue: 2,0:23:03.32,0:23:06.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,their patterns, size and colours are completely random,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:06.62,0:23:12.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最终形成2700种自然生成的热带鱼组合  
Dialogue: 2,0:23:06.62,0:23:12.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,resulting in 2700 different naturally occurring combinations of tropical fish.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在PAX游戏展的1.8测试版演示中  
Dialogue: 2,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the beta 1.8 demo at the PAX gaming event,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.58,0:23:18.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,末影人初次加入游戏时  
Dialogue: 2,0:23:16.58,0:23:18.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when the enderman was first added,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.46,0:23:23.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,死亡后掉落的是钻石（占位符）  而非末影珍珠  
Dialogue: 2,0:23:18.46,0:23:23.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they actually dropped diamonds as a placeholder upon death instead of enderpearls.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.72,0:23:28.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,利用栅栏和地毯  可以搭建出造型奇特的阶梯
Dialogue: 2,0:23:23.72,0:23:28.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are able to make a really weird looking staircase by using fences and carpets.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:28.94,0:23:29.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这太奇怪了
Dialogue: 2,0:23:28.94,0:23:29.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以用雪球杀死烈焰人
Dialogue: 2,0:23:29.84,0:23:31.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You can kill a blaze with a snowball,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.42,0:23:34.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看来它们真的不喜欢打雪仗
Dialogue: 2,0:23:32.42,0:23:34.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess they just don't like snowball fights.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:34.66,0:23:40.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在任何难度下 玩家从23格高处坠落不会死亡
Dialogue: 2,0:23:34.66,0:23:40.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The most amount of blocks you can fall from before dying on any difficulty is 23 blocks,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:40.90,0:23:42.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此若从24格高度坠落
Dialogue: 2,0:23:40.90,0:23:42.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so if you fall from 24 blocks,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:42.98,0:23:43.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就会一命呜呼
Dialogue: 2,0:23:42.98,0:23:43.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:43.82,0:23:52.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,生存测试版中苦力怕还有个诡异特性  它们会在玩家击杀它们后立即自爆
Dialogue: 2,0:23:43.82,0:23:47.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another weird feature about creepers in the survival test
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.18,0:23:52.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,version of Minecraft is that they would actually explode after the player killed them,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:52.60,0:23:56.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,苦力怕不会通过自爆攻击玩家  而是会在被玩家击杀时爆炸
Dialogue: 2,0:23:52.60,0:23:56.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,rather than the creeper exploding on the player as a method of attacking you.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:57.10,0:24:01.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,用蛋糕可以做出造型诡异的阶梯
Dialogue: 2,0:23:57.10,0:24:01.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You can create a weird looking staircase by using cake slicers.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:01.48,0:24:06.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,末影人最初加入游戏时  眼睛是绿色的  还会散发黑色烟雾粒子
Dialogue: 2,0:24:01.48,0:24:06.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When endermen were first added they originally had green eyes and emitted black smoke particles,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:06.98,0:24:10.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而如今它们的眼睛变成了紫色  还会散发紫色粒子
Dialogue: 2,0:24:06.98,0:24:10.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas today they have purple eyes and emit purple particles.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:10.42,0:24:13.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当蜘蛛最初在我的世界中被设计时 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:10.42,0:24:13.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When spiders were first being created in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:13.82,0:24:15.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们原本是棕色的 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:13.82,0:24:15.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they were originally brown.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:15.98,0:24:18.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:24:15.98,0:24:18.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:18.58,0:24:23.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,恶魂最初发射的火球  其实是燃烧的雪球
Dialogue: 2,0:24:18.58,0:24:23.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the ghast's fireball actually used to be a snowball that was on fire.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:23.36,0:24:27.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界曾有个漏洞  射出的箭矢若击中目标
Dialogue: 2,0:24:23.36,0:24:27.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,There used to be a bug in Minecraft where if you shot with an arrow,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:28.04,0:24:32.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你驯服的狼会突然反叛  转而攻击并杀死主人
Dialogue: 2,0:24:28.04,0:24:32.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,your tamed wolves would actually turn on you and begin to attack and kill you.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:33.08,0:24:39.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界Alpha版本中  存在一种地形生成错误区域  被称为“独石”  其外观类似区块加载错误
Dialogue: 2,0:24:33.08,0:24:36.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Monoliths were glitched areas of terrain that could be found
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.46,0:24:39.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in Minecraft Alpha which resembled chunk errors and they
Dialogue: 1,0:24:39.88,0:24:40.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:24:39.88,0:24:40.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:40.86,0:24:42.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界生存测试版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:24:40.86,0:24:42.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the survival test version of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:43.28,0:24:50.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过第二次击打TNT  来取消它的爆炸  这样就能把TNT物品回收回来
Dialogue: 2,0:24:43.28,0:24:46.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to cancel the detonation of TNT
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.78,0:24:50.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,by hitting it for the second time as they'll get the item back rather
Dialogue: 1,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而非让TNT爆炸
Dialogue: 2,0:24:50.50,0:24:52.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,than the TNT exploding.
Dialogue: 1,0:24:52.32,0:24:55.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你手持物品时退出我的世界存档
Dialogue: 2,0:24:52.32,0:24:55.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you exit your Minecraft world when holding an item,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:55.30,0:24:56.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如钻石之类的物品
Dialogue: 2,0:24:55.30,0:24:56.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,like a diamond for example,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:57.02,0:24:59.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接着创建一个新的我的世界存档
Dialogue: 2,0:24:57.02,0:24:59.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then create a new Minecraft world,
Dialogue: 1,0:24:59.36,0:25:04.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会在瞬间看到手中仍握着钻石  随后物品才会消失不见
Dialogue: 2,0:24:59.36,0:25:02.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will actually see a diamond in your hand for a split second
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.78,0:25:04.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,before returning to having nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:04.80,0:25:08.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果红狐恰好生成在雪原虎群生物群系中
Dialogue: 2,0:25:04.80,0:25:08.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a red fox happens to spawn in a snowy tiger biome,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:08.74,0:25:12.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么它就会变成雪狐  外观看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:25:08.74,0:25:12.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it will instead be a snowy fox which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:12.60,0:25:16.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 如果用红狐与雪狐进行繁殖 
Dialogue: 2,0:25:12.60,0:25:16.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of that, if a red fox is bred with a snowy fox,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:16.58,0:25:22.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么幼崽将有50%的几率  生成红狐或雪狐
Dialogue: 2,0:25:16.58,0:25:22.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the baby has a 50% chance of either a red fox or a snowy fox.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:22.42,0:25:30.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,鸡是在我的世界Alpha阶段加入游戏的  而将鸡推下悬崖的机制
Dialogue: 2,0:25:22.42,0:25:26.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The chicken was added into Minecraft in the Alpha phase of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.94,0:25:30.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and the mechanics for pushing a chicken off the edge
Dialogue: 1,0:25:30.10,0:25:32.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,与现在略有不同
Dialogue: 2,0:25:30.10,0:25:32.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,of a cliff was slightly different back then.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:32.84,0:25:34.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们都知道在如今的我的世界中
Dialogue: 2,0:25:32.84,0:25:34.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:35.10,0:25:40.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,把鸡推下悬崖时  它会扑腾翅膀安全着陆
Dialogue: 2,0:25:35.10,0:25:40.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that pushing a chicken off an edge will cause the chicken to flap their wings down to safety.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:41.04,0:25:43.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在我的世界Alpha版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:25:41.04,0:25:43.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in Minecraft Alpha,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:43.22,0:25:46.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,鸡也会扑腾翅膀落地
Dialogue: 2,0:25:43.22,0:25:46.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the chicken would still flap their wings to the ground,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:46.34,0:25:50.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但实际并不安全  因为无论它们下落时多么轻柔
Dialogue: 2,0:25:46.34,0:25:50.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it wasn't really safe as regardless of how soft their fall was,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:51.02,0:25:53.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们依然会受到伤害并死亡
Dialogue: 2,0:25:51.02,0:25:53.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they would still take damage and die.
Dialogue: 1,0:25:53.52,0:25:55.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:25:53.52,0:25:55.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:25:55.62,0:26:00.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当雪傀儡首次在Beta 1.9版本加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:25:55.62,0:26:00.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when the snow golem was first added into Minecraft in Beta 1.9,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:00.28,0:26:07.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏中存在一个bug 如果玩家手持小麦 雪傀儡就会朝玩家扔雪球
Dialogue: 2,0:26:00.28,0:26:04.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there was a bug in the game where the snow golem would throw snowballs
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.09,0:26:07.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,at the player if the player was holding wheat in their hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:07.94,0:26:09.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,雪傀儡和小麦有什么过节？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:07.94,0:26:09.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What do snow golems have against wheat?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:10.02,0:26:11.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我只是想做个面包
Dialogue: 2,0:26:10.02,0:26:11.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I just want to make some bread,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:11.60,0:26:12.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这到底怎么回事？
Dialogue: 2,0:26:11.60,0:26:12.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,what's going on?
Dialogue: 1,0:26:12.52,0:26:14.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:26:12.52,0:26:14.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:15.06,0:26:17.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是Alpha初期阶段
Dialogue: 2,0:26:15.06,0:26:17.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the early stages of Minecraft Alpha,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:17.64,0:26:21.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏曾有个非常独特的特性叫“冬季模式”
Dialogue: 2,0:26:17.64,0:26:21.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there was a really unique feature in the game which was known as Winter Mode.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:22.02,0:26:26.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,冬季模式是两种随机生成的世界类型之一
Dialogue: 2,0:26:22.02,0:26:26.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now Winter Mode was one of the two randomly occurring world types,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:26.40,0:26:28.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,另一种则是普通世界类型 
Dialogue: 2,0:26:26.40,0:26:28.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,with the other being a normal world type.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:28.94,0:26:31.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当创建冬季模式世界时 
Dialogue: 2,0:26:28.94,0:26:31.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So upon creating a Winter Mode world type,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:31.80,0:26:36.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家会看到四种不同类型的雪花飘落地面
Dialogue: 2,0:26:31.80,0:26:34.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the player would be greeted with four different types
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.58,0:26:36.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,of snowflakes that would fall to the ground,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:36.78,0:26:40.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在露天方块上形成积雪层
Dialogue: 2,0:26:36.78,0:26:40.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,creating a snow layer on any block exposed to the sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:40.74,0:26:44.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,换句话说 你的我的世界会持续不断地下雪
Dialogue: 2,0:26:40.74,0:26:44.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In other words, your Minecraft world would be snowing 24x7.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:45.20,0:26:52.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家创建新世界时  有25%的几率生成冬季模式
Dialogue: 2,0:26:45.20,0:26:52.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now there was a 25% chance for the player to get a Winter Mode world when creating a new world,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:52.40,0:26:56.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而有75%的几率生成普通世界
Dialogue: 2,0:26:52.40,0:26:56.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and a 75% chance to get a normal type world.
Dialogue: 1,0:26:56.40,0:26:59.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在我的世界Alpha的后续版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:26:56.40,0:26:59.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in a later version of Minecraft Alpha,
Dialogue: 1,0:26:59.84,0:27:08.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,生物群系被引入游戏  这意味着冬季模式世界类型被移除  玩家需要自行寻找雪地生物群系
Dialogue: 2,0:26:59.84,0:27:04.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,biomes were added into the game which meant the Winter Mode world type was removed
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.21,0:27:08.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and you would instead have to find a biome with a snowy environment.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:08.70,0:27:13.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Beta 1.9版本加入雪傀儡生物前  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:08.70,0:27:13.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before the snow golem mob was added into Minecraft in version beta 1.9,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:14.10,0:27:16.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界创始人Notch  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:14.10,0:27:16.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Notch, the creator of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:16.36,0:27:19.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,原本计划将其命名为“雪人”
Dialogue: 2,0:27:16.36,0:27:19.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,originally planned to call the snow golem a snowman.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:20.00,0:27:23.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,根据Mojang纪录片所述  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:20.00,0:27:23.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,We know this as in the story of Mojang documentary,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:24.02,0:27:28.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Notch提到想加入会扔雪球的雪人  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:24.02,0:27:28.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Notch mentioned that he wanted to add snowmen that threw snowballs.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:28.40,0:27:29.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,听听他怎么说  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:28.40,0:27:29.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Take a listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.74,0:27:35.74,MC-CN,注释,0,0,0,,{\blur10\pos(183.6,60.133)}*该片段在正式的纪录片中没有\N该片段在官方的概念宣传片第二部分中3分17秒处*
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.29,0:27:33.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,另一个建议是做个稻草人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.29,0:27:33.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another thing asuggestion is it to make a scarecrow
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.49,0:27:36.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为这很有趣 它用南瓜
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.49,0:27:36.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because it would be so fun because they're like a pumpkin here
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.86,0:27:40.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,加上木棍做成 非常可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.86,0:27:40.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and that's applause noting sticks very cute
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.39,0:27:42.91,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们应该有个能扔雪球的雪人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.39,0:27:42.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and we should have snowman that's the throw snowballs
Dialogue: 1,0:27:44.76,0:27:48.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而当Notch宣布将加入雪人后  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:44.76,0:27:48.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, after Notch revealed that he would add snowmen into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:48.94,0:27:55.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一位Reddit用户建议改称“雪傀儡”  这个名称最终被官方采纳  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:48.94,0:27:52.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a Reddit user stated he would instead call the mob snow golems
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.93,0:27:55.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which later became the official name for the mob.
Dialogue: 1,0:27:55.74,0:27:57.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果仔细观察  
Dialogue: 2,0:27:55.74,0:27:57.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you look very closely,
Dialogue: 1,0:27:57.66,0:28:03.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现酿造台放置时会发出几乎不可见的亮度等级1的光
Dialogue: 2,0:27:57.66,0:28:03.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will notice that the brewing stand when placed will emit a barely visible light level of 1.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:03.76,0:28:06.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错各位  酿造台确实能提供光源
Dialogue: 2,0:28:03.76,0:28:06.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right guys, brewing stands provide you with light.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:06.84,0:28:09.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说 其实也没啥用  因为我照样啥都看不见
Dialogue: 2,0:28:06.84,0:28:09.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, not really to be honest because I still can't see a thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:10.14,0:28:18.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,将任何喷溅药水朝头顶投掷  比朝脚下投掷效果更佳
Dialogue: 2,0:28:10.14,0:28:14.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Throwing a splash potion of any kind on top of your head
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.34,0:28:18.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,is more efficient than throwing the potion at your feet as the
Dialogue: 1,0:28:18.16,0:28:22.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,药水效果持续时间会略微延长  正如你所见
Dialogue: 2,0:28:18.16,0:28:22.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,status effect from the potion will last slightly longer as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:22.68,0:28:29.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,箱子是原版我的世界中  少数能在三个维度自然生成的方块之一
Dialogue: 2,0:28:22.68,0:28:26.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The chest is one of the only blocks in vanilla Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.04,0:28:29.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that can naturally generate in all three dimensions which is
Dialogue: 1,0:28:29.70,0:28:31.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,主世界 下界
Dialogue: 2,0:28:29.70,0:28:31.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the overworld, the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:28:31.44,0:28:32.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,以及末地
Dialogue: 2,0:28:31.44,0:28:32.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and the end.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:32.50,0:28:42.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若使用双箱并装满潜影盒  则最多可存储90,000件物品
Dialogue: 2,0:28:32.50,0:28:35.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you have a double chest and store it with
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.56,0:28:42.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,maxed out shulker boxes then you are able to store up to 90,000 items within said double chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:42.14,0:28:43.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这存储量可真是惊人
Dialogue: 2,0:28:42.14,0:28:43.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now that is a lot of item.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:43.78,0:28:50.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界基岩版中  有个独特设定 箱子在物品栏里会显示为完整方块  
Dialogue: 2,0:28:43.78,0:28:47.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition there is an exclusive feature in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.78,0:28:50.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where chests will render as a full block within
Dialogue: 1,0:28:50.14,0:28:52.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但放置后却不会  
Dialogue: 2,0:28:50.14,0:28:52.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the inventory but not when it is placed.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:53.16,0:28:58.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在Java版中  箱子在物品栏和放置后的外观一致  这才是本该有的样子  
Dialogue: 2,0:28:53.16,0:28:56.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On Java Edition, chests within the inventory look the same
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.14,0:28:58.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as when they are placed which is how it should be.
Dialogue: 1,0:28:58.70,0:29:03.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏中共有16种不同结构  会自然生成箱子  
Dialogue: 2,0:28:58.70,0:29:03.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Chests are able to generate in a total of 16 different structures in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 几乎每种建筑结构里  都会藏有箱子  
Dialogue: 2,0:29:04.12,0:29:07.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, nearly every structure in Minecraft will have a chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:07.72,0:29:09.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说到建筑内的箱子  
Dialogue: 2,0:29:07.72,0:29:09.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Speaking of chests in structures,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:09.76,0:29:15.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,原版中最稀有的战利品当属附魔金苹果  
Dialogue: 2,0:29:09.76,0:29:15.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the rarest item you can find within a chest in vanilla Minecraft is the enchanted golden apple.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:15.76,0:29:23.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过不同建筑中  附魔金苹果的爆率天差地别  
Dialogue: 2,0:29:15.76,0:29:20.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, the rarity of the enchanted golden apple varies across each 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.33,0:29:23.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,structure with the rarest being the mineshaft chest
Dialogue: 1,0:29:23.30,0:29:27.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最稀有的是废弃矿井箱子  仅有0.014%的生成概率  
Dialogue: 2,0:29:23.30,0:29:27.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,only having a 0.014% chance of spawning.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:28.24,0:29:31.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你在矿井箱子里  发现了附魔金苹果
Dialogue: 2,0:29:28.24,0:29:31.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you find a mineshaft chest with a notch apple in it,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:31.66,0:29:33.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可真是欧皇附体
Dialogue: 2,0:29:31.66,0:29:33.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you are extremely lucky.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:33.42,0:29:39.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.3版本中  大箱子物品栏标题  经历了一次颠覆性改动
Dialogue: 2,0:29:33.42,0:29:39.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In version 1.3, a mind-blowing change was made to the large chest inventory title.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:39.86,0:29:47.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在1.3版本之前它叫大箱子  但在1.3版本后它被重命名为...大箱子？
Dialogue: 2,0:29:39.86,0:29:43.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, before 1.3 it was called the large chest
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.56,0:29:47.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but in 1.3 it was renamed to the large chest?
Dialogue: 1,0:29:47.26,0:29:50.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 你听好了  箱子的英文名首字母从此变成了大写
Dialogue: 2,0:29:47.26,0:29:50.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yep, you heard me, the word chest received a capital C.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:50.86,0:29:51.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,多么可爱 
Dialogue: 2,0:29:50.86,0:29:51.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,How lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:29:51.92,0:29:57.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一个更广为人知的事实是  每年12月24日至26日期间
Dialogue: 2,0:29:51.92,0:29:57.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A more known fact but every year on December 24th to December 26th,
Dialogue: 1,0:29:57.10,0:30:04.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,单个和双联箱子的材质会变成圣诞礼盒样式  看起来就像包装好的圣诞礼物
Dialogue: 2,0:29:57.10,0:30:00.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,single and double chests will have their textures changed to
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:04.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Christmas chests which will closely resemble wrapped Christmas presents.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:04.64,0:30:07.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当幼年村民站在床上时
Dialogue: 2,0:30:04.64,0:30:07.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When baby villagers are standing on a bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:07.32,0:30:10.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们会在床上蹦蹦跳跳  看起来特别有趣
Dialogue: 2,0:30:07.32,0:30:10.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they will bounce up and down on it which looks pretty fun,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:10.68,0:30:11.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说 
Dialogue: 2,0:30:10.68,0:30:11.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:11.52,0:30:13.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:30:11.52,0:30:13.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:13.96,0:30:18.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床底下的床腿其实是2D贴图  看起来就像这样
Dialogue: 2,0:30:13.96,0:30:18.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the legs underneath beds were actually 2D and looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:18.44,0:30:20.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过在1.12版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:30:18.44,0:30:20.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in version 1.12,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:20.68,0:30:25.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏进行了更新  现在床腿都变成了3D模型并一直沿用至今
Dialogue: 2,0:30:20.68,0:30:25.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was made to where beds now have 3D legs and that's how they remain today.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:26.08,0:30:29.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,此外 在Minecraft的床还使用2D床腿的年代 
Dialogue: 2,0:30:26.08,0:30:29.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Additionally, back when beds had 2D legs in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:29.62,0:30:33.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从特定角度观察床时  会出现一个视觉错误
Dialogue: 2,0:30:29.62,0:30:33.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a visual bug occurred when looking at the bed from a certain angle.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:33.54,0:30:40.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以当你直接仰视床底时  床腿会完全消失不见  这个现象相当诡异
Dialogue: 2,0:30:33.54,0:30:36.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So looking directly underneath the bed would make the bed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.83,0:30:40.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,legs completely invisible which was rather strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:40.32,0:30:46.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft中使用setblock指令放置床时  只会生成半张床  这有点奇怪
Dialogue: 2,0:30:40.32,0:30:44.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Placing a bed by using the set block command in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.04,0:30:46.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,will only place half of the bed which is a bit weird.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说 其实并不算
Dialogue: 2,0:30:47.18,0:30:48.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, not really to be honest,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:48.56,0:30:51.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为床的模型  实际占用了两格空间
Dialogue: 2,0:30:48.56,0:30:51.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this only happens because the bed is 2 blocks long.
Dialogue: 1,0:30:51.10,0:30:54.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft多人服务器的旧版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:30:51.10,0:30:54.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In older versions of Minecraft on multiplayer servers,
Dialogue: 1,0:30:54.56,0:31:00.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以传送正在睡觉的玩家  而他们被传送后依然会保持睡眠姿势
Dialogue: 2,0:30:54.56,0:30:57.91,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you were able to teleport another player while they were sleeping
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.91,0:31:00.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they'd still be in the sleeping position when you
Dialogue: 1,0:31:00.38,0:31:02.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这看起来相当滑稽
Dialogue: 2,0:31:00.38,0:31:02.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,teleported them which looked pretty funny.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:02.48,0:31:07.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如今在Minecraft中  你依然可以传送正在睡觉的玩家  但传送后他们会立即醒来
Dialogue: 2,0:31:02.48,0:31:05.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft today, you can still teleport another player
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.08,0:31:07.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,while they're sleeping but they'll instead be woken up
Dialogue: 1,0:31:07.40,0:31:10.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这肯定会让他们非常恼火  毕竟你打扰了他们的美梦
Dialogue: 2,0:31:07.40,0:31:10.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,instantly which I'm sure they'll find very annoying for disturbing them.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:10.84,0:31:12.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,兄弟我真不是故意的
Dialogue: 2,0:31:10.84,0:31:12.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry man, it was an accident, please!
Dialogue: 1,0:31:12.88,0:31:15.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家在冰面上放置床 
Dialogue: 2,0:31:12.88,0:31:15.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If the player places a bed on ice,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:15.38,0:31:19.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床本身会变得滑溜溜的  就像直接踩在冰面上行走一样
Dialogue: 2,0:31:15.38,0:31:19.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the bed itself becomes slippery as if you were walking on the ice itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:20.00,0:31:27.81,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,用金苹果和虚弱药水将僵尸村民转化为普通村民大约需要3-5分钟
Dialogue: 2,0:31:20.00,0:31:24.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Turning a zombie villager into a normal villager by using a golden apple
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.08,0:31:27.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and a splash potion of weakness takes roughly 3-5 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:27.86,0:31:34.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在转化过程中若将床放置在僵尸村民旁边 实际上能加速转化进程
Dialogue: 2,0:31:27.86,0:31:30.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, placing a bed next to the zombie villager
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.68,0:31:34.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,while it's in the curing phase will actually speed up the process.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:34.38,0:31:38.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft中  床存在一个奇怪的游戏漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:31:34.38,0:31:38.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, there is a strange glitch in the game when it comes to beds.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:38.62,0:31:43.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以 如果你像这样在床边放置矿车然后躺上床睡觉
Dialogue: 2,0:31:38.62,0:31:43.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So, if you place a minecart next to a bed like so and then sleep in the bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:43.92,0:31:48.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会莫名其妙地以睡眠姿势漂浮在床边
Dialogue: 2,0:31:43.92,0:31:48.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll for some reason end up floating in the sleeping position next to the bed itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:49.14,0:31:51.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看来那辆矿车不想让你在床上睡觉
Dialogue: 2,0:31:49.14,0:31:51.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess that minecart doesn't want you sleeping in the bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:52.04,0:31:55.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft 1.12版本加入彩色床之前
Dialogue: 2,0:31:52.04,0:31:55.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before coloured beds were added into Minecraft in version 1.12,
Dialogue: 1,0:31:55.80,0:31:58.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,制作原版红色床其实有好几种配方  
Dialogue: 2,0:31:55.80,0:31:58.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there were quite a few ways to craft the OG red bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:31:59.06,0:32:02.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 共有3,456种
Dialogue: 2,0:31:59.06,0:32:02.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, there were 3,456
Dialogue: 1,0:32:02.40,0:32:07.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,种不同的合成配方  可以通过所有羊毛与木板组合来制作床  这简直太疯狂了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:02.40,0:32:06.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,different ways to craft a bed by using all of the wool and wooden plank 
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.11,0:32:07.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,combinations which is insane.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:08.08,0:32:17.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床在下界会爆炸的特性  是因为Notch最初只打算让床在主世界作为重生点使用
Dialogue: 2,0:32:08.08,0:32:11.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The feature of beds exploding in the nether was added
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.51,0:32:17.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because Minecraft creator Notch only wanted beds to work as a respawn point in the overworld.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:17.56,0:32:23.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说白了 这就是Notch想戏弄整个Minecraft社区  而且他确实做到了
Dialogue: 2,0:32:17.56,0:32:20.01,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, that just translates to Notch wanting to
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.01,0:32:23.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,troll the whole Minecraft community and boy did he do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:23.58,0:32:26.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家睡在岩浆里的床上
Dialogue: 2,0:32:23.58,0:32:26.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a player is sleeping in a bed that is inside lava,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:27.12,0:32:30.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,睡在岩浆里的床上  竟然不会受到任何伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:32:27.12,0:32:30.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you actually don't take any damage from the lava itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:30.88,0:32:34.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,直到你在岩浆中醒来  开始被活活烧死
Dialogue: 2,0:32:30.88,0:32:34.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That is until you wake up inside the lava and start burning to death,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:35.00,0:32:36.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但我相信你一定能逃出生天
Dialogue: 2,0:32:35.00,0:32:36.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure you'll be able to escape,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:36.76,0:32:36.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:32:36.76,0:32:36.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:37.04,0:32:38.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正如你们中有些人所知 
Dialogue: 2,0:32:37.04,0:32:38.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As some of you may know,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:38.34,0:32:45.53,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,利用床可以击败末影龙  因为在末地右键点击床会引发爆炸
Dialogue: 2,0:32:38.34,0:32:41.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it is possible to defeat the ender dragon by
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.53,0:32:45.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,using beds due to the beds exploding when you right click on them in the end.
Dialogue: 1,0:32:45.56,0:32:52.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你们知道吗  大约需要引爆4次床才能击败末影龙？
Dialogue: 2,0:32:45.56,0:32:49.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, did you guys also know that it takes approximately
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.31,0:32:52.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,4 bed explosions to defeat the ender dragon?
Dialogue: 1,0:32:52.72,0:32:53.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你想尝试这个 
Dialogue: 2,0:32:52.72,0:32:53.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you're gonna try this,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:53.96,0:32:56.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只是别在这个过程中把自己炸飞了 
Dialogue: 2,0:32:53.96,0:32:56.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,just try not to blow yourself up in the process,
Dialogue: 1,0:32:56.88,0:33:04.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个特性从beta 1.3版本持续到beta 1.8版本  最终在beta 1.9更新中被移除
Dialogue: 2,0:32:56.88,0:33:01.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this feature lasted from beta 1.3 to beta 1.8
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:04.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,until it was finally removed in the beta 1.9 update.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:05.22,0:33:06.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在旧版我的世界中 
Dialogue: 2,0:33:05.22,0:33:06.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In older versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:07.26,0:33:08.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你躺在床上时
Dialogue: 2,0:33:07.26,0:33:08.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when you slept in a bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:08.74,0:33:11.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以同时打开物品栏
Dialogue: 2,0:33:08.74,0:33:11.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you could open your inventory at the same time,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:11.54,0:33:16.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这会导致你的角色模型以睡眠姿势显示在物品栏界面上  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:11.54,0:33:16.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which resulted in showing your player model in the sleeping position on the inventory screen,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:16.78,0:33:17.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来有点滑稽  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:16.78,0:33:17.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked kinda funny.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:18.08,0:33:18.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你还好吗伙计？  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:18.08,0:33:18.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You alright there mate?
Dialogue: 1,0:33:18.82,0:33:19.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看起来有点累  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:18.82,0:33:19.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You're looking a bit tired.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:20.06,0:33:22.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管史莱姆是我的世界中的敌对生物  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:20.06,0:33:22.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Despite slimes being hostile mobs in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:23.14,0:33:28.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们却是游戏中少数  不会阻止玩家在床上睡觉的敌对生物之一  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:23.14,0:33:25.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they are one of the only hostile mobs in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.54,0:33:28.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that does not prevent the player from sleeping in a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:28.64,0:33:31.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,公平地说 史莱姆看起来天真又可爱  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:28.64,0:33:31.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,To be fair, slimes look so innocent and cute,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:31.30,0:33:34.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,直到它们杀死你之前  你根本想不到它们是敌对生物  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:31.30,0:33:34.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there's no way you'd think they're a hostile mob until they kill you of because
Dialogue: 1,0:33:35.24,0:33:41.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床是在2011年2月22日  beta 1.3版本中加入游戏的  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:35.24,0:33:41.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Beds were added into Minecraft in version beta 1.3 on February 22nd in 2011.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:42.30,0:33:45.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,另外 当床最初加入游戏时
Dialogue: 2,0:33:42.30,0:33:45.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Additionally, when beds were first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:45.46,0:33:48.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,物品在物品栏中使用的是2D贴图  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:45.46,0:33:48.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the item used a sprite texture in the inventory,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:49.00,0:33:50.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而如今在我的世界里  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:49.00,0:33:50.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:50.32,0:33:51.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们采用的是3D纹理  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:50.32,0:33:51.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they use a 3D texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:33:52.22,0:33:56.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在游戏中坠落到床上  是个可能救你一命的好方法  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:52.22,0:33:56.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Falling onto a bed in Minecraft is a good way to potentially save your life,
Dialogue: 1,0:33:56.88,0:34:00.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为床能减免高达50%的坠落伤害  
Dialogue: 2,0:33:56.88,0:34:00.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as the bed will take up to 50% of normal fall damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:00.90,0:34:03.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,无论在现实生活还是游戏里  
Dialogue: 2,0:34:00.90,0:34:03.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Beds are just amazing in every way,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:03.22,0:34:04.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床在方方面面都棒极了  
Dialogue: 2,0:34:03.22,0:34:04.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,both in real life and in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.00,0:34:05.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 我们继续  
Dialogue: 2,0:34:05.00,0:34:05.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.90,0:34:12.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,天域曾是我的世界规划中的一个维度  设计初衷是与下界相对  
Dialogue: 2,0:34:05.90,0:34:09.23,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The Sky Dimension was a planned dimension in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.23,0:34:12.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and it was intended to be the opposite of the Nether.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:12.52,0:34:14.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要进入天域维度
Dialogue: 2,0:34:12.52,0:34:14.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, to get to the Sky Dimension,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:14.30,0:34:20.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家需要躺在床上睡觉  并有几率被传送到这个维度
Dialogue: 2,0:34:14.30,0:34:16.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the player would have to sleep in a bed
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.46,0:34:20.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and there would be a chance of the player teleporting to said dimension.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:20.90,0:34:24.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而随着现今末路之地的推出
Dialogue: 2,0:34:20.90,0:34:24.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, with the introduction of the End Dimension we have today,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:24.46,0:34:26.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,天域维度的构想最终被废弃
Dialogue: 2,0:34:24.46,0:34:26.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the Sky Dimension idea was scrapped,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:26.48,0:34:29.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这真的很可惜  因为天域听起来超酷的
Dialogue: 2,0:34:26.48,0:34:29.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is really unfortunate to be honest because it sounded so cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:29.92,0:34:31.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界旧版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:34:29.92,0:34:31.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In older versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:31.82,0:34:33.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你躺在床上睡觉时
Dialogue: 2,0:34:31.82,0:34:33.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when you went to sleep in a bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你在床上是看不到自己身体的
Dialogue: 2,0:34:33.48,0:34:35.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you couldn't see your body in the bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:36.00,0:34:37.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实有点诡异 
Dialogue: 2,0:34:36.00,0:34:37.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was kinda creepy.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:37.84,0:34:39.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如今在我的世界里
Dialogue: 2,0:34:37.84,0:34:39.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:39.30,0:34:41.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,睡觉时  你终于能看到自己的皮肤了
Dialogue: 2,0:34:39.30,0:34:41.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when you sleep, you can actually see your skin,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:41.42,0:34:42.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这才符合常理
Dialogue: 2,0:34:41.42,0:34:42.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is how it should be.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:42.68,0:34:43.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢现在这样 
Dialogue: 2,0:34:42.68,0:34:43.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I much prefer it.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:43.86,0:34:49.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家从高处坠落  下落高度足以造成伤害  但在触地前使用了床
Dialogue: 2,0:34:43.86,0:34:47.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If the player falls from a height high enough to take damage
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.06,0:34:49.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but uses a bed before they hit the ground,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:49.74,0:34:52.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么他们实际上不会受到任何坠落伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:34:49.74,0:34:52.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then they won't actually take any fall damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:52.50,0:34:54.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,直到你从床上醒来时才会受伤
Dialogue: 2,0:34:52.50,0:34:54.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That is until you wake up from the bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:54.90,0:34:57.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,感谢你啊床铺  我还以为你会救我命呢  结果并没有
Dialogue: 2,0:34:54.90,0:34:57.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Cheers for that bed, I thought you were gonna save my life but nope,
Dialogue: 1,0:34:57.88,0:34:58.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你骗了我 
Dialogue: 2,0:34:57.88,0:34:58.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you lied to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:58.68,0:35:00.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我现在死了 真是谢谢你啊 
Dialogue: 2,0:34:58.68,0:35:00.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm dead now, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:01.00,0:35:03.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,哇 我刚才听起来是真的生气了
Dialogue: 2,0:35:01.00,0:35:03.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Wow, I actually sounded genuinely annoyed just then.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:03.54,0:35:04.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我没事的 真的
Dialogue: 2,0:35:03.54,0:35:04.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm fine guys, I promise.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:04.78,0:35:06.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:35:04.78,0:35:06.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:07.26,0:35:10.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从Beta 1.3到Beta 1.5版本期间
Dialogue: 2,0:35:07.26,0:35:10.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from Beta 1.3 to Beta 1.5,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:10.42,0:35:14.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时在下界尝试睡觉时  床铺并不会爆炸
Dialogue: 2,0:35:10.42,0:35:14.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,beds did not explode when you tried to sleep in them in the Nether.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:14.50,0:35:16.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 试图在床上睡觉反而会 
Dialogue: 2,0:35:14.50,0:35:16.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Instead, trying to sleep in a bed did,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:17.20,0:35:18.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,什么都不会发生
Dialogue: 2,0:35:17.20,0:35:18.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,well, nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:18.36,0:35:19.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这有点虎头蛇尾啊
Dialogue: 2,0:35:18.36,0:35:19.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is a bit anticlimactic.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:20.16,0:35:21.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总之 继续往下说
Dialogue: 2,0:35:20.16,0:35:21.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:21.28,0:35:27.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床的底部材质与橡木板材质完全相同 
Dialogue: 2,0:35:21.28,0:35:27.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The underneath part of a bed uses the exact same texture as the oak plank texture.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:27.50,0:35:27.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看吧？
Dialogue: 2,0:35:27.50,0:35:27.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 1,0:35:27.98,0:35:33.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一个比较广为人知的事实是  白天遇到雷暴天气时  其实也是可以睡觉的
Dialogue: 2,0:35:27.98,0:35:31.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A more known fact, but it is possible to sleep in a bed during the
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.73,0:35:33.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,daytime if there is a thunderstorm.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:34.38,0:35:35.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:35:34.38,0:35:35.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:36.12,0:35:42.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床的物品栏贴图  实际上沿用了这种老式的2D像素风格贴图
Dialogue: 2,0:35:36.12,0:35:40.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the inventory textures for beds are actually using the old 2D sprite
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.64,0:35:42.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,textures which look like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:42.70,0:35:44.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在Java版中 
Dialogue: 2,0:35:42.70,0:35:44.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On Java Edition however,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:44.40,0:35:48.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,床的物品栏贴图  则采用了这种3D立体模型贴图
Dialogue: 2,0:35:44.40,0:35:48.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,beds use 3D inventory textures which look like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:48.40,0:35:54.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft基岩版的另一个不同之处  在于睡觉时的动画效果
Dialogue: 2,0:35:48.40,0:35:54.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another difference in Minecraft Bedrock Edition is the animation when you sleep in a bed.
Dialogue: 1,0:35:54.18,0:35:56.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在基岩版中 当你躺在床上时
Dialogue: 2,0:35:54.18,0:35:56.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On Bedrock Edition, when you sleep in a bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:35:56.66,0:36:03.31,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,动画开始时你会仰望天空  然后慢慢将头转向玩家视角
Dialogue: 2,0:35:56.66,0:35:59.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the animation starts with you looking up in the sky
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:03.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then you slowly tilt your head towards the player's point of view.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:03.50,0:36:04.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在Java版中
Dialogue: 2,0:36:03.50,0:36:04.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On Java Edition however,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:04.86,0:36:06.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,动画效果就没那么酷了  因为当你躺在床上时
Dialogue: 2,0:36:04.86,0:36:06.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it's not as cool because when you sleep in a bed,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:07.00,0:36:09.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会直接低头看向自己的腿部
Dialogue: 2,0:36:07.00,0:36:09.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you just instantly look at your player's legs.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:09.12,0:36:11.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我制作这个视频的时候 
Dialogue: 2,0:36:09.12,0:36:11.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At the time of me making this video,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:11.30,0:36:16.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,目前我的世界中  共有105种独特的村民皮肤
Dialogue: 2,0:36:11.30,0:36:16.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there are a total of 105 unique villager skins in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:16.20,0:36:17.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比我预想的还要多
Dialogue: 2,0:36:16.20,0:36:17.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is more than I thought.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:18.12,0:36:21.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你其实可以给村民穿上盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:36:18.12,0:36:21.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You are actually able to give villagers armour,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:21.28,0:36:24.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这在你想要保护他们时非常实用
Dialogue: 2,0:36:21.28,0:36:24.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very useful if you want to protect them.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:24.16,0:36:30.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只需将盔甲放入发射器中  然后对准附近的村民发射即可
Dialogue: 2,0:36:24.16,0:36:27.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is done by placing the armour in a dispenser
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.43,0:36:30.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then dispensing the armour onto a nearby villager.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:30.76,0:36:33.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过盔甲本身不会在视觉上显示出来
Dialogue: 2,0:36:30.76,0:36:33.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the armour itself won't be visually visible,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:33.82,0:36:35.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但防护效果会正常生效
Dialogue: 2,0:36:33.82,0:36:35.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it will work as intended.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:35.88,0:36:43.99,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸对村民的仇恨如此之深  即便村民处于隐身状态  仍能攻击村民
Dialogue: 2,0:36:35.88,0:36:39.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Zombies hate villagers so much that they are still able to track
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.94,0:36:43.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and hunt down a villager that's under the invisibility effect.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:44.02,0:36:46.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不得不说 僵尸这执着劲儿还挺让人佩服
Dialogue: 2,0:36:44.02,0:36:46.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you have to give the zombie credit,
Dialogue: 1,0:36:46.30,0:36:47.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,确实挺聪明的
Dialogue: 2,0:36:46.30,0:36:47.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it's quite smart.
Dialogue: 1,0:36:47.58,0:36:54.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,日落时分  我的世界里大多数村民  都会躺到最近的床上  一直睡到天亮
Dialogue: 2,0:36:47.58,0:36:51.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At sunset, most villagers in Minecraft will lay down in the
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.61,0:36:54.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,nearest bed and remain there until morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.46,0:36:52.43,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(169.6,105.955)}滚开 安东尼
Dialogue: 1,0:36:54.40,0:37:01.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过绿色衣服的傻子村民  会比其他村民更晚入睡  早上也会起得更迟
Dialogue: 2,0:36:54.40,0:36:58.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, the green nitwit villager will stay up later
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.19,0:37:01.79,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,before sleeping and also wake up later in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.43,0:36:58.83,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\frz3.31\pos(145.6,100.978)}“起来 去吃麦当劳！”
Dialogue: 1,0:37:02.00,0:37:03.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这说的简直就是在下
Dialogue: 2,0:37:02.00,0:37:03.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That sounds a lot like me.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:03.90,0:37:04.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 继续下一个话题
Dialogue: 2,0:37:03.90,0:37:04.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:04.90,0:37:07.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你仔细观察渔夫村民
Dialogue: 2,0:37:04.90,0:37:07.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you look closely at the fisherman villager,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:07.62,0:37:10.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现它的衣服上印着一条鱼
Dialogue: 2,0:37:07.62,0:37:10.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that it has a fish on it.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:10.18,0:37:12.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,哦真的吗安东尼  这还用你说啊老兄
Dialogue: 2,0:37:10.18,0:37:12.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh really Anthony, we never would have guessed mate.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:12.48,0:37:18.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以渔夫村民身上的鱼图案  其实是生鱼物品的旧版材质
Dialogue: 2,0:37:12.48,0:37:18.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So the fish you see on the fisherman villager is actually the old texture for the raw fish item.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:18.56,0:37:27.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是Mojang特意设计的村民鱼纹  以此致敬最初的鱼类材质
Dialogue: 2,0:37:18.56,0:37:22.71,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this villager fish texture was intentionally done by Mojang
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.71,0:37:27.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as a nice little callback to the original fish texture we had in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:27.18,0:37:32.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,众所周知  在我的世界里我们是用绿宝石和村民进行交易的
Dialogue: 2,0:37:27.18,0:37:32.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that we use emeralds as a currency to trade with villagers in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:32.40,0:37:34.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但情况并非一直如此
Dialogue: 2,0:37:32.40,0:37:34.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but this wasn't always the case.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:34.42,0:37:37.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 当初开发村民交易系统时 
Dialogue: 2,0:37:34.42,0:37:37.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, when villager trading was first being developed,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:37.82,0:37:44.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Mojang原本计划在游戏中  加入红宝石矿石和红宝石作为与村民交易的货币
Dialogue: 2,0:37:37.82,0:37:41.31,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Mojang originally planned to add ruby ore and
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.31,0:37:44.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,rubies into Minecraft as a currency to trade with villagers.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:45.36,0:37:50.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 一位我的世界开发者认为  红宝石矿石看起来和红石太相似了
Dialogue: 2,0:37:45.36,0:37:50.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, a Minecraft developer thought that ruby ore looked too similar to redstone,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:50.36,0:37:52.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,于是最终改用绿宝石作为替代货币
Dialogue: 2,0:37:50.36,0:37:52.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant emeralds were added instead.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:52.76,0:37:54.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,红宝石还是绿宝石？
Dialogue: 2,0:37:52.76,0:37:54.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Rubies or emeralds?
Dialogue: 1,0:37:54.14,0:37:55.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:37:54.14,0:37:55.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:37:55.34,0:37:57.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:37:55.34,0:37:57.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:37:57.66,0:38:02.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸村民曾与普通僵尸  使用完全相同的皮肤
Dialogue: 2,0:37:57.66,0:38:02.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombie villagers used to use the exact same skin as regular zombies.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:02.56,0:38:07.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,唯一的区别在于  它们顶着的是僵尸村民的脑袋  而非普通僵尸的头颅
Dialogue: 2,0:38:02.56,0:38:04.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The only difference is that they of course had
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.76,0:38:07.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the zombie villager head instead of a normal zombie,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:07.40,0:38:10.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过 如果你还记得  老版僵尸村民的皮肤
Dialogue: 2,0:38:07.40,0:38:10.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, if you remember the old zombie villager skin,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:10.12,0:38:12.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:10.12,0:38:12.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:12.36,0:38:13.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,0:38:12.36,0:38:13.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:14.08,0:38:18.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民乘船时会发生非常诡异的状况
Dialogue: 2,0:38:14.08,0:38:18.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,something very strange can happen with the villagers when they're sitting in a boat.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:19.10,0:38:23.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此 如果村民在船上时  使用了附近的床 
Dialogue: 2,0:38:19.10,0:38:23.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if the villager uses a nearby bed while they're in the boat,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:23.24,0:38:27.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们会保持乘船状态  同时呈现睡眠姿势
Dialogue: 2,0:38:23.24,0:38:27.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they'll be put in the sleeping position while still remaining in said boat.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:27.90,0:38:29.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 各位
Dialogue: 2,0:38:27.90,0:38:29.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right guys,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:29.22,0:38:31.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民就这样在船里睡着了
Dialogue: 2,0:38:29.22,0:38:31.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the villager is sleeping inside the boat.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:31.82,0:38:33.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 这睡姿看着还挺惬意的
Dialogue: 2,0:38:31.82,0:38:33.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It looks quite comfy to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:33.66,0:38:34.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,言归正传
Dialogue: 2,0:38:33.66,0:38:34.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:34.58,0:38:42.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民是我的世界中少数  乘船或在矿车 时不会呈现明显坐姿的生物之一
Dialogue: 2,0:38:34.58,0:38:37.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Villagers are one of the only mobs in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.53,0:38:42.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that do not visually sit down when they're sitting in a boat or minecart.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:42.32,0:38:46.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但正如你所见  灾厄村民和僵尸村民却会呈现坐姿
Dialogue: 2,0:38:42.32,0:38:46.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But as you can see, illager mobs and zombie villagers will sit down.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:46.62,0:38:48.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看来村民就是喜欢站着
Dialogue: 2,0:38:46.62,0:38:48.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I guess villagers just love standing.
Dialogue: 1,0:38:48.64,0:38:52.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Beta 1.9版本加入村民之前 
Dialogue: 2,0:38:48.64,0:38:52.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before the addition of villagers in Beta 1.9,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:52.22,0:38:57.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界创始人Notch最初计划  让村庄建筑由猪人居住
Dialogue: 2,0:38:52.22,0:38:57.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft creator Nodge originally planned for village structures to be populated by pigmen,
Dialogue: 1,0:38:57.96,0:39:01.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而所谓的猪人  就是这些猪脸村民  它们长这样
Dialogue: 2,0:38:57.96,0:39:01.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I guess were these pig-like villagers and looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:01.76,0:39:05.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们更喜欢猪人  还是现在的村民呢
Dialogue: 2,0:39:01.76,0:39:05.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys prefer the pigmen or the villagers we have now?
Dialogue: 1,0:39:05.42,0:39:06.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在评论区告诉我吧
Dialogue: 2,0:39:05.42,0:39:06.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:06.60,0:39:12.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 幼年村民是唯一没有超大头部比例的幼年生物
Dialogue: 2,0:39:06.60,0:39:12.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, baby villagers are the only baby mob in the game that doesn't have a large,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:12.22,0:39:14.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,成年体型头部比例的幼年生物
Dialogue: 2,0:39:12.22,0:39:14.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,adult-sized head compared to the body.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:14.88,0:39:17.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而像幼狼这样的生物
Dialogue: 2,0:39:14.88,0:39:17.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, mobs such as baby wolves,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:17.26,0:39:22.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,幼猪 幼牛等其他幼年生物  却都沿用着成年体的头部比例
Dialogue: 2,0:39:17.26,0:39:22.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,baby pigs, baby cows and all the other baby mobs use the same head size as an adult mob,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:22.48,0:39:25.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,使得它们的头部看起来比身体大得多
Dialogue: 2,0:39:22.48,0:39:25.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making their heads appear much bigger than their body.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:25.44,0:39:31.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,与玩家不同  我的世界中的村民  可以在地狱和末地睡在床上
Dialogue: 2,0:39:25.44,0:39:31.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Unlike the player, villagers in Minecraft are able to sleep in beds in the Nether and the End.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.78,0:39:26.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(108.799,81.778)\frz7.882}“你能闭嘴吗？”
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.64,0:39:29.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(210.667,58.889)}“你还没睡吗？”
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.31,0:39:31.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(260.267,64.578)}“滚”
Dialogue: 1,0:39:31.56,0:39:33.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当玩家尝试这样做时
Dialogue: 2,0:39:31.56,0:39:33.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the player tries to do this,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:33.36,0:39:34.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就会导致死亡  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:33.36,0:39:34.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it will result in death,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:35.06,0:39:35.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:35.06,0:39:35.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:36.24,0:39:38.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,开玩笑的 这一点都不棒  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:36.24,0:39:38.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm joking, it is not lovely,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:38.20,0:39:39.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直烦死人了  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:38.20,0:39:39.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it is so annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:39.50,0:39:40.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 继续下一个知识点  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:39.50,0:39:40.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:40.60,0:39:47.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,袭击事件发生时  右键点击村民  它们会害怕得冒出冷汗粒子  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:40.60,0:39:43.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,During a raid, villagers can get scared and
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.74,0:39:47.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,begin emitting sweat particles when you right-click on them,
Dialogue: 1,0:39:47.18,0:39:48.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就像这样  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:47.18,0:39:48.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:48.68,0:39:50.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,别怕啊村民老兄  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:48.68,0:39:50.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's okay villager, don't be scared mate.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:51.12,0:39:58.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,平原村庄生成的牧师村民  其长袍背面印着某个生物的图案  
Dialogue: 2,0:39:51.12,0:39:54.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The cleric villager that spawns in the plains village actually
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.78,0:39:58.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,wears a robe that has a certain mob on the back.
Dialogue: 1,0:39:58.40,0:40:02.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 这位牧师穿的是  苦力怕头像长袍
Dialogue: 2,0:39:58.40,0:40:02.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right guys, this cleric villager is repping the creeper face robe.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:02.86,0:40:12.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民的外观和设定  其实源自1993年游戏迷宫魔兽 2里的商店老板
Dialogue: 2,0:40:02.86,0:40:06.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The appearance and concept of villagers were actually
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.59,0:40:12.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,inspired by the shopkeepers from the 1993 game known as Dungeon Master 2.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:12.32,0:40:15.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,众所周知 村民能开门
Dialogue: 2,0:40:12.32,0:40:15.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that villagers are able to open doors,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:15.90,0:40:20.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但不知为何  它们却打不开活板门和栅栏门
Dialogue: 2,0:40:15.90,0:40:20.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but for some reason they cannot open trap doors or fence gates.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:20.30,0:40:21.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民老兄 你还好吗
Dialogue: 2,0:40:20.30,0:40:21.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You okay there villager?
Dialogue: 1,0:40:21.40,0:40:22.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看起来有点卡住了
Dialogue: 2,0:40:21.40,0:40:22.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You're looking a bit stuck.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:22.84,0:40:27.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我的世界里的村民  其实还能爬梯子 你看
Dialogue: 2,0:40:22.84,0:40:27.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Villagers in Minecraft are also able to climb ladders as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:27.52,0:40:32.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 它们并不把梯子视为路径 也不会主动攀爬 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:27.52,0:40:32.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, they do not recognise the ladders as paths and don't climb them deliberately,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:32.98,0:40:34.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过嘛 它们还是能爬上去的 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:32.98,0:40:34.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but hey, they can still climb them.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:34.92,0:40:37.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2014年愚人节那天 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:34.92,0:40:37.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On April Fool's Day 2014,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:37.52,0:40:40.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Mojang宣布村民占领了我的世界 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:37.52,0:40:40.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Mojang announced that villagers had taken over Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:41.00,0:40:42.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他们可不是在开玩笑 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:41.00,0:40:42.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they were not joking.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:42.82,0:40:45.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,呃 其实确实是在开玩笑 毕竟那天是愚人节 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:42.82,0:40:45.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well actually they were joking since it was April Fool's Day,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.14,0:40:45.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你们懂我意思 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:45.14,0:40:45.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you know what I mean.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:45.98,0:40:48.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,总之在2014年愚人节 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:45.98,0:40:48.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, on April Fool's Day 2014,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:48.72,0:40:51.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所有玩家的皮肤都被强制替换成了村民皮肤 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:48.72,0:40:51.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,everyone's skin on Minecraft was changed to a villager skin,
Dialogue: 1,0:40:52.08,0:40:54.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这张截图展示了服务器当时的景象 
Dialogue: 2,0:40:52.08,0:40:54.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and here's a screenshot of how it looked on a server.
Dialogue: 1,0:40:54.76,0:41:03.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,用金苹果和虚弱药水将僵尸村民变回普通村民大约需要3到5分钟
Dialogue: 2,0:40:54.76,0:40:58.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Turning a zombie villager back into a normal villager with a
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.76,0:41:03.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,golden apple and splash potion of weakness takes roughly 3-5 minutes.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:03.62,0:41:08.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过 如果在治愈过程中将床放置在僵尸村民旁边 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:03.62,0:41:08.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you place a bed next to the zombie villager while it's in the curing phase,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:08.82,0:41:11.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,能显著加快转化进程
Dialogue: 2,0:41:08.82,0:41:11.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it will speed up the transition process.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:11.30,0:41:16.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,另一个能加速僵尸村民治愈过程的方块是铁栏杆 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:11.30,0:41:16.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another block that speeds up the zombie villager curing time are iron bars.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:16.72,0:41:20.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 如果在僵尸村民周围放置一些铁栏杆 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:16.72,0:41:20.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, if you place some iron bars around the zombie villager,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:20.62,0:41:22.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,同样能缩短治愈所需时间
Dialogue: 2,0:41:20.62,0:41:22.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it will too speed up the cure time.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:22.96,0:41:26.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 若同时存在铁傀儡和幼年村民 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:22.96,0:41:26.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, if an iron golem and baby villager are present,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:27.02,0:41:31.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,铁傀儡有概率会向幼年村民递出一朵虞美人
Dialogue: 2,0:41:27.02,0:41:31.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there is a small chance the iron golem will hold out a poppy for the baby villager,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:31.78,0:41:33.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这一幕非常温馨有爱
Dialogue: 2,0:41:31.78,0:41:33.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:33.38,0:41:42.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个暖心的我的世界设定其实致敬了 1986年日本动画电影天空之城 
Dialogue: 2,0:41:33.38,0:41:38.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this wholesome Minecraft feature is actually a reference to the 1986 
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.34,0:41:42.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Japanese animated movie that is known as Laputa Castle in the Sky.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:43.06,0:41:48.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏中的绿色傻子村民原本被称为普通村民
Dialogue: 2,0:41:43.06,0:41:48.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The green nitwit villager in Minecraft used to be called the generic villager.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:48.48,0:41:52.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我更喜欢“傻子”这个称呼 因为这些家伙确实傻得可爱
Dialogue: 2,0:41:48.48,0:41:52.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I much prefer the name nitwit because man these guys are nitwits.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:52.40,0:41:53.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,抱歉伙计 开个玩笑
Dialogue: 2,0:41:52.40,0:41:53.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Sorry mate, only joking,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:54.04,0:41:54.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也不完全是玩笑
Dialogue: 2,0:41:54.04,0:41:54.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,well not really.
Dialogue: 1,0:41:54.86,0:41:56.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当玩家成功抵御袭击事件后
Dialogue: 2,0:41:54.86,0:41:56.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If the player defeats a raid,
Dialogue: 1,0:41:56.84,0:42:00.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,将获得“村庄英雄”状态效果
Dialogue: 2,0:41:56.84,0:42:00.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you'll be granted with the hero of the village status effect.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:00.80,0:42:03.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,获得这个效果后
Dialogue: 2,0:42:00.80,0:42:03.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now when the player has said status effect,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:03.38,0:42:07.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,幼年村民会向玩家赠送虞美人 以此感谢玩家拯救村庄
Dialogue: 2,0:42:03.38,0:42:07.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,baby villagers will give the player a poppy as a thank you for saving the villagers,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:08.14,0:42:09.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个互动非常治愈
Dialogue: 2,0:42:08.14,0:42:09.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very wholesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:09.80,0:42:11.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的午后时分
Dialogue: 2,0:42:09.80,0:42:11.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the afternoon of a Minecraft day,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:11.88,0:42:17.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,除傻子外的所有成年村民都会聚集到钟下开村民大会
Dialogue: 2,0:42:11.88,0:42:17.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all adult villagers apart from the nitwits will gather at the village bell for a town meeting,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:17.30,0:42:19.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个细节设计得相当精妙
Dialogue: 2,0:42:17.30,0:42:19.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a very nice attention to detail.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:19.72,0:42:22.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.6版本更新宣传图中
Dialogue: 2,0:42:19.72,0:42:22.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the artwork for the Minecraft 1.6 update,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:22.74,0:42:29.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,背景里潜伏着蓝袍村民的身影 但游戏从未实装过蓝色着装村民 
Dialogue: 2,0:42:22.74,0:42:26.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a blue villager can be seen lurking in the background
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.04,0:42:29.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,despite Minecraft never adding a villager with a blue robe.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:29.80,0:42:34.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若村民被闪电击中 会立即转变为女巫
Dialogue: 2,0:42:29.80,0:42:34.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a villager is struck by a lightning bolt then it will turn into a witch.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:35.10,0:42:37.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.4版本游戏文件中
Dialogue: 2,0:42:35.10,0:42:37.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft version 1.4,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:37.56,0:42:42.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,曾出现过一张愤怒村民头部贴图 
Dialogue: 2,0:42:37.56,0:42:42.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a texture appeared in the game files that appeared to be an angry looking villager head,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:42.98,0:42:44.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,造型如图所示
Dialogue: 2,0:42:42.98,0:42:44.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and it looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:44.60,0:42:49.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,开发组可能原本计划加入愤怒表情的村民
Dialogue: 2,0:42:44.60,0:42:49.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It seems like Minecraft possibly planned to add an angry villager expression to the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:42:49.90,0:42:51.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但最终未能实现
Dialogue: 2,0:42:49.90,0:42:51.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but never did.
Dialogue: 1,0:42:51.14,0:42:58.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这张愤怒村民贴图在游戏文件中留存至1.13版本
Dialogue: 2,0:42:51.14,0:42:54.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This angry villager head remained unused in the game
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.56,0:42:58.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,files all the way up to version 1.13 until it was officially
Dialogue: 1,0:42:58.72,0:43:00.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,直到1.14更新才被移除
Dialogue: 2,0:42:58.72,0:43:00.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,removed in Minecraft 1.14.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:01.20,0:43:04.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,即使玩家处于隐身状态
Dialogue: 2,0:43:01.20,0:43:04.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If the player is under the invisibility effect,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:04.30,0:43:07.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民仍会像看得见你一样注视着你
Dialogue: 2,0:43:04.30,0:43:07.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,villagers will still look at you as if they can see you,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:07.78,0:43:09.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话有点瘆人
Dialogue: 2,0:43:07.78,0:43:09.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is kinda creepy,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:09.20,0:43:10.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老实说
Dialogue: 2,0:43:09.20,0:43:10.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,not gonna lie.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:10.28,0:43:20.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当前版本虽未实装沼泽和丛林村民 但游戏文件中早已存在对应的生物群系村民贴图
Dialogue: 2,0:43:10.28,0:43:13.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, there are villager textures for swamp biomes
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.89,0:43:20.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and jungle biomes despite swamp and jungle villagers not currently existing in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:20.22,0:43:23.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真心希望未来能实装沼泽和丛林村民 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:20.22,0:43:23.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I really hope we get swamp and jungle villagers one day,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:23.28,0:43:24.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那一定会很酷 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:23.28,0:43:24.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that'd be really cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:24.50,0:43:33.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,1.14村庄更新中的村民皮肤设计灵感源自2018年某场现实时装秀 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:24.50,0:43:28.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The villager skins that were added in the 1.14 village and pillage update
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.94,0:43:33.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were actually inspired from a real life 2018 fashion show.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:33.60,0:43:35.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不得不承认 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:33.60,0:43:35.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, you can't deny it,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:35.42,0:43:36.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民们的穿搭确实时髦 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:35.42,0:43:36.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the villagers have style.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:37.10,0:43:45.39,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,屏幕上显示的是基础村民皮肤模板 现今所有村民变种皮肤都由此衍生
Dialogue: 2,0:43:37.10,0:43:40.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The picture you see on screen is the base villager skin
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.94,0:43:45.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that was used to create all the unique villager skins in Minecraft today.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:45.58,0:43:49.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然这个基础模板不会在游戏中出现 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:45.58,0:43:49.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, this base villager skin is of course never seen in game,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:49.20,0:43:54.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但正是它奠定了如今丰富的村民皮肤体系 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:49.20,0:43:51.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it's cool it was used as the foundation to create
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.96,0:43:54.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all the awesome villager skins we have today.
Dialogue: 1,0:43:54.52,0:43:57.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在村庄内攻击任何村民 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:54.52,0:43:57.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you attack any villager within the village,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:57.20,0:43:58.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,都会降低你的声望值 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:57.20,0:43:58.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,your popularity will decrease,
Dialogue: 1,0:43:59.26,0:44:02.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,普通交易价格将随之上涨 
Dialogue: 2,0:43:59.26,0:44:02.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,meaning normal villager trades will become more expensive.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:02.32,0:44:05.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说白了就是村民会记恨你 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:02.32,0:44:05.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In other words, the villagers will start hating you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:04.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\frz5.999\pos(99.734,89.467)}“这个畜生是谁？”
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.54,0:44:04.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\frz355.5\pos(281.067,97.29)}“滚开！”
Dialogue: 1,0:44:06.14,0:44:13.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你以为自己在村民中的声望仅限于那个单一的村落结构 那你可要重新想想了
Dialogue: 2,0:44:06.14,0:44:09.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Not only that, if you thought your popularity among
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.39,0:44:13.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the villagers was just within that one villager structure, then think again.
Dialogue: 2,0:44:13.72,0:44:15.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以你打了村民
Dialogue: 2,0:44:13.72,0:44:15.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you attack a villager,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:15.32,0:44:20.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,整个世界中所有村庄建筑的声望惩罚都会波及
Dialogue: 2,0:44:15.32,0:44:20.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,your popularity will decrease within every village structure in your Minecraft world,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:20.54,0:44:22.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以千万别招惹村民
Dialogue: 2,0:44:20.54,0:44:22.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so just don't attack villagers guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:23.00,0:44:25.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当你看见成群的小村民时
Dialogue: 2,0:44:23.00,0:44:25.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you see a group of baby villagers,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:25.46,0:44:29.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他们常在村庄里追逐嬉戏
Dialogue: 2,0:44:25.46,0:44:29.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then they'll often be running around the village playing tag with each other,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:29.48,0:44:30.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,场面相当温馨 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:29.48,0:44:30.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is quite wholesome.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:30.70,0:44:35.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.14版本彻底重制前 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:30.70,0:44:35.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before the villager skins were overhauled in Minecraft 1.14,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:35.36,0:44:38.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,村民皮肤仅有这几种经典款式 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:35.36,0:44:38.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only villager skins we had were these skins.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:38.88,0:44:41.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,安息吧 初代村民皮肤 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:38.88,0:44:41.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace OG villager skins,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:41.38,0:44:42.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们永远怀念你 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:41.38,0:44:42.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will be missed.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:42.52,0:44:46.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Java版中若切换至程序员艺术材质包 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:42.52,0:44:46.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Java edition, when the player switches to the programmer art resource pack,
Dialogue: 1,0:44:46.88,0:44:51.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所有村民都会变成戴绿兜帽的造型 
Dialogue: 2,0:44:46.88,0:44:51.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,all villagers will have a green hood on their head and they all look like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:51.56,0:44:59.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界传送门于2010年10月29日随Alpha1.2版本正式加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:44:51.56,0:44:59.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The nether portal was officially added into Minecraft in version alpha 1.2 on October 29th,2010.
Dialogue: 1,0:44:59.92,0:45:04.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在传送门正式加入游戏的七天前
Dialogue: 2,0:44:59.92,0:45:04.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, 7 days before nether portals were added publicly into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:05.12,0:45:09.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,恶魂原本设计为会从激活的传送门中生成
Dialogue: 2,0:45:05.12,0:45:09.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the ghast was actually planned to spawn from activated nether portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:10.00,0:45:14.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着恶魂原本有可能在主世界生成
Dialogue: 2,0:45:10.00,0:45:14.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This meant the ghast could have potentially spawned in the overworld,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:14.38,0:45:17.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那绝对会引发一场大混乱
Dialogue: 2,0:45:14.38,0:45:17.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which would have been absolutely mayhem.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:17.32,0:45:22.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但转眼11年过去  这个特性至今仍未实装
Dialogue: 2,0:45:17.32,0:45:22.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But hey, here we are nearly 11 years later and we still don't have this feature.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:22.08,0:45:25.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当下界维度首次加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,0:45:22.08,0:45:25.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When the nether dimension was first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:26.18,0:45:28.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Notch最初将其称为“滑界”
Dialogue: 2,0:45:26.18,0:45:28.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Notch originally referred to it as the slip,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:29.26,0:45:33.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此我们现在熟知的下界传送门  最初被称为“滑界传送门”
Dialogue: 2,0:45:29.26,0:45:33.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant the nether portals we know and love were referred to as slip portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:34.04,0:45:38.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我绝对更喜欢“下界传送门”这个名称 而不是“滑界传送门”
Dialogue: 2,0:45:34.04,0:45:38.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I definitely prefer the name nether portals to slip portals,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:38.10,0:45:39.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是说这名字也太奇怪了吧
Dialogue: 2,0:45:38.10,0:45:39.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean what even is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:45:39.20,0:45:42.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若通过指令生成传送门框架方块  
Dialogue: 2,0:45:39.20,0:45:42.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you spawn in a portal frame block by using commands,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.74,0:45:48.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现沙砾等下落方块能穿过传送门  
Dialogue: 2,0:45:42.74,0:45:45.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll quickly discover that falling blocks such as
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.54,0:45:48.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,sand or gravel are able to go through the portal.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:49.00,0:45:51.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当这些方块进入下界后  
Dialogue: 2,0:45:49.00,0:45:51.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Upon entering the portal into the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.28,0:45:56.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们会直接以物品形式掉落而不会被销毁  
Dialogue: 2,0:45:51.28,0:45:56.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll also realise that the sand and gravel just drop as an item and don't get destroyed,
Dialogue: 1,0:45:56.92,0:45:58.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个机制相当有趣  
Dialogue: 2,0:45:56.92,0:45:58.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:45:58.60,0:46:05.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,凋灵是我的世界中少数无法穿越下界传送门的生物之一  
Dialogue: 2,0:45:58.60,0:46:02.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The wither boss is one of the only mobs in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.08,0:46:05.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that is not able to travel through nether portals.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.03,0:46:02.63,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(181.866,67.422)}真讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.23,0:46:03.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(192,71.689)}让我进去！>:(
Dialogue: 1,0:46:05.54,0:46:06.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,“你还好吗凋灵？”
Dialogue: 2,0:46:05.54,0:46:06.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Are you okay there wither?
Dialogue: 1,0:46:07.02,0:46:08.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,“来 摧毁我的存档吧”
Dialogue: 2,0:46:07.02,0:46:08.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Here, destroy my Minecraft world,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:09.00,0:46:10.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,“这样你会好受些”
Dialogue: 2,0:46:09.00,0:46:10.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,that will make you feel better.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:10.24,0:46:12.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,回溯早期版本
Dialogue: 2,0:46:10.24,0:46:12.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:12.70,0:46:16.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家曾利用下界传送门实现物品复制
Dialogue: 2,0:46:12.70,0:46:16.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to duplicate items by using nether portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:16.98,0:46:18.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,要触发这个复制漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:46:16.98,0:46:18.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,To do this duplication glitch,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:18.80,0:46:20.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你需要搭建一个下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:46:18.80,0:46:20.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd need a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:20.44,0:46:24.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一辆运输矿车  若干铁轨延伸至传送门处
Dialogue: 2,0:46:20.44,0:46:24.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a minecart chest and some rails leading to the portal itself.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.88,0:46:32.13,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家将需要复制的物品放入运输矿车  然后缓缓将其推向传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:46:24.88,0:46:29.11,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Players would then put the item they want to duplicate in the minecart chest 
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.11,0:46:32.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and then slowly push it towards the nether portal.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:32.18,0:46:34.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就在运输矿车即将进入下界时
Dialogue: 2,0:46:32.18,0:46:34.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Then right before the minecart chest enters the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:35.00,0:46:37.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你要立即从箱子里取出物品
Dialogue: 2,0:46:35.00,0:46:37.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'd take the item out of the chest.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:37.36,0:46:39.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若操作得当  当矿车进入下界时
Dialogue: 2,0:46:37.36,0:46:39.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If done correctly, upon entering the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:39.98,0:46:43.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会发现钻石仍留在运输矿车中
Dialogue: 2,0:46:39.98,0:46:43.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll discover that your diamonds are still in the minecart chest,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:43.64,0:46:45.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着你可以无限复制这些钻石
Dialogue: 2,0:46:43.64,0:46:45.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which means you are able to duplicate them.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:46.18,0:46:47.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft生存模式中
Dialogue: 2,0:46:46.18,0:46:47.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft survival,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:47.40,0:46:51.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,进入下界传送门需要整整4秒
Dialogue: 2,0:46:47.40,0:46:51.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,entering a nether portal takes exactly 4 seconds,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:51.44,0:46:55.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在创造模式中  进入传送门几乎是瞬间完成的
Dialogue: 2,0:46:51.44,0:46:55.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas entering a portal in creative mode is almost instant.
Dialogue: 1,0:46:55.34,0:46:57.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:46:55.34,0:46:57.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:46:57.80,0:47:00.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha 1.2.2a版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:46:57.80,0:47:00.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in version alpha 1.2.2a,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:00.90,0:47:07.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过按下键盘上的F4键  直接生成已激活的下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:47:00.90,0:47:07.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to spawn in activated nether portals by pressing the F4 key on their keyboard.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:07.50,0:47:15.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个漏洞原本是开发者专用功能  却意外留在了公开发行版中
Dialogue: 2,0:47:07.50,0:47:11.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this cheat was accidentally left in a public version of Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.99,0:47:15.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when it was intended to be by developers when
Dialogue: 1,0:47:15.04,0:47:17.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界传送门最初正处于开发完善阶段时
Dialogue: 2,0:47:15.04,0:47:17.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,nether portals were first being well developed.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:18.28,0:47:26.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Notch很快发现调试指令被公开  并于当天紧急发布了Alpha 1.2.2b版本
Dialogue: 2,0:47:18.28,0:47:21.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Notch quickly realised the debug cheat was public to
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.66,0:47:26.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players and released alpha 1.2.2b on the same day,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:26.42,0:47:29.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,移除了生成下界传送门的功能
Dialogue: 2,0:47:26.42,0:47:29.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,removing the ability to spawn in nether portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:29.58,0:47:32.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我打赌当年玩家们玩这个漏洞玩得不亦乐乎
Dialogue: 2,0:47:29.58,0:47:32.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I bet players had so much fun with this cheat back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:33.04,0:47:38.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.11版本的16w32a快照中
Dialogue: 2,0:47:33.04,0:47:38.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the 16w32a snapshot for 1.11,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:38.28,0:47:41.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界传送门存在一个致命漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:47:38.28,0:47:41.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a bug existed in the game with nether portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:41.58,0:47:43.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在这个快照版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:47:41.58,0:47:43.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, in said snapshot,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:43.94,0:47:48.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果玩家使用钓鱼竿  让浮漂穿过下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:47:43.94,0:47:48.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if the player used a fishing rod and let the bobber go through a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:48.76,0:47:51.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏就会莫名其妙崩溃
Dialogue: 2,0:47:48.76,0:47:51.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it would crash the game for some reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:51.40,0:47:54.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,是的 如果你想在这个版本里搞崩游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:47:51.40,0:47:54.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yep, that's right, if you want to crash your game in this version,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:54.58,0:47:57.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只要对着下界传送门甩钓竿就行
Dialogue: 2,0:47:54.58,0:47:57.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then just use a fishing rod on a nether portal.
Dialogue: 1,0:47:57.42,0:47:59.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft远古时期
Dialogue: 2,0:47:57.42,0:47:59.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:47:59.84,0:48:05.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.7版本之前  下界传送门存在一个漏洞
Dialogue: 2,0:47:59.84,0:48:05.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,before version 1.7, a bug existed in the game with nether portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:05.56,0:48:09.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正如我所说 如果你在1.7版本前玩过Minecraft 
Dialogue: 2,0:48:05.56,0:48:09.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So like I said, if you played Minecraft before 1.7,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:09.64,0:48:14.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,透过下界传送门观察时  水体会完全隐形
Dialogue: 2,0:48:09.64,0:48:14.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,water would be completely invisible when trying to look at it through a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:15.04,0:48:16.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这现象非常诡异 
Dialogue: 2,0:48:15.04,0:48:16.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was very strange.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:16.84,0:48:23.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 透过下界传送门观察时  冰块也会完全隐形
Dialogue: 2,0:48:16.84,0:48:21.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of this, ice was also completely invisible to players
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.18,0:48:23.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when trying to view it through a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:24.14,0:48:27.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但奇怪的是 岩浆却可以正常显示
Dialogue: 2,0:48:24.14,0:48:27.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,yet lava for example was completely fine to look at.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:27.60,0:48:29.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在1.7版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:48:27.60,0:48:29.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, in version 1.7,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:29.78,0:48:30.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个漏洞被修复了
Dialogue: 2,0:48:29.78,0:48:30.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the bug was fixed.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:31.14,0:48:37.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,疣猪兽是我的世界中的敌对生物  生成于下界维度  若未做好充分准备它们能轻易置你于死地
Dialogue: 2,0:48:31.14,0:48:34.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Hoglins are hostile mobs in Minecraft that can spawn in the nether
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.99,0:48:37.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they can kill you pretty easily if you're not careful.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:38.02,0:48:42.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你站在下界传送门附近  疣猪兽就不会攻击你
Dialogue: 2,0:48:38.02,0:48:42.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, hoglins will not attack you if you are standing near a nether portal.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:43.18,0:48:48.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为疣猪兽惧怕下界传送门  当它们靠近传送门时
Dialogue: 2,0:48:43.18,0:48:48.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is because hoglins are scared of nether portals and if they go near one,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:48.16,0:48:49.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们会立即逃之夭夭
Dialogue: 2,0:48:48.16,0:48:49.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they'll just run away.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:49.60,0:48:51.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没关系的疣猪兽 只是个传送门而已
Dialogue: 2,0:48:49.60,0:48:51.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's okay hoglin, it's just a portal.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:52.20,0:48:57.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你和我一样  有时候懒得挖黑曜石造下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:48:52.20,0:48:57.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you're like me and you're sometimes too lazy to mine obsidian to make a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:48:57.48,0:48:59.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你并不孤单
Dialogue: 2,0:48:57.48,0:48:59.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are not alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:48:59.46,0:49:01.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但别担心 在我的世界中
Dialogue: 2,0:48:59.46,0:49:01.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But not to worry, as in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:01.86,0:49:06.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其实无需开采黑曜石  也能建造下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:49:01.86,0:49:06.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it is actually possible to create a nether portal without mining obsidian.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:06.82,0:49:13.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,只需将水倒在熔岩上方  直到形成传送门的形状  这样就大功告成了
Dialogue: 2,0:49:06.82,0:49:10.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just simply place water on top of lava until you
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.48,0:49:13.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,form the shape of a nether portal and there you go,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:13.54,0:49:19.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,点燃传送门即可前往下界  再也不用辛苦开采成堆的黑曜石了
Dialogue: 2,0:49:13.54,0:49:17.19,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you can light the portal and go to the nether knowing you didn't have to 
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.19,0:49:19.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,painfully mine a bunch of obsidian.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:19.48,0:49:21.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,众所周知 在如今的我的世界中
Dialogue: 2,0:49:19.48,0:49:21.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So we all know that in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:21.88,0:49:25.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你可以建造各种尺寸的下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:49:21.88,0:49:25.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you are able to create nether portals in lots of different sizes.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:26.28,0:49:29.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在我的世界的远古版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:49:26.28,0:49:29.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in the olden days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:29.68,0:49:35.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个下界传送门是唯一能激活的设计  如果你还记得这个
Dialogue: 2,0:49:29.68,0:49:35.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this nether portal was the only design that let you activate it and if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:35.08,0:49:37.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:49:35.08,0:49:37.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:37.50,0:49:46.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界原版中  可建造的最大下界传送门尺寸上限为23x23的黑曜石框架
Dialogue: 2,0:49:37.50,0:49:40.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The biggest possible nether portal you can make
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.61,0:49:46.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in vanilla Minecraft is a maximum build of 23x23 obsidian,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:46.62,0:49:48.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个尺寸确实相当惊人
Dialogue: 2,0:49:46.62,0:49:48.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is honestly pretty huge.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:48.90,0:49:51.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看看这个传送门吧
Dialogue: 2,0:49:48.90,0:49:51.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean just look at this portal man,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:51.16,0:49:52.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真是令人叹为观止
Dialogue: 2,0:49:51.16,0:49:52.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it's very impressive.
Dialogue: 1,0:49:52.68,0:49:56.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若你想在末地维度前往下界
Dialogue: 2,0:49:52.68,0:49:56.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you want to travel to the nether in the N dimension,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:56.22,0:49:59.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你可办不到  因为无论怎么尝试  
Dialogue: 2,0:49:56.22,0:49:59.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you can't, as no matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 1,0:49:59.22,0:50:01.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,都无法在末地维度激活下界传送门  
Dialogue: 2,0:49:59.22,0:50:01.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you cannot activate a nether portal in the N,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:01.86,0:50:03.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以不必白费力气了  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:01.86,0:50:03.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so don't even bother trying.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:03.72,0:50:05.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我制作本期视频时  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:03.72,0:50:05.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At the time of me making this video,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:05.76,0:50:09.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界传送门已存在近11年  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:05.76,0:50:09.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the nether portal is nearly 11 years old,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:09.22,0:50:11.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,细想真是令人难以置信  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:09.22,0:50:11.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is honestly crazy to think about.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:11.76,0:50:13.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们是什么时候开始玩我的世界的？  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:11.76,0:50:13.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,When did you guys start playing Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,0:50:13.88,0:50:15.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,欢迎在评论区留言分享  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:13.88,0:50:15.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Let me know in the comments below.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:15.56,0:50:17.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,回溯我的世界的早期岁月  
Dialogue: 2,0:50:15.56,0:50:17.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:18.06,0:50:20.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在游戏的Alpha和Beta版本时期
Dialogue: 2,0:50:18.06,0:50:20.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha and beta versions of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:20.78,0:50:25.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,流动的水能摧毁已激活的下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:50:20.78,0:50:25.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,flowing water was able to destroy activated nether portals,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:25.40,0:50:27.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实相当烦人 
Dialogue: 2,0:50:25.40,0:50:27.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was honestly quite annoying.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:27.54,0:50:29.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在如今的我的世界中
Dialogue: 2,0:50:27.54,0:50:29.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:29.42,0:50:32.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,流动的水对下界传送门已毫无影响
Dialogue: 2,0:50:29.42,0:50:32.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,flowing water will do nothing to said nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:32.86,0:50:34.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是极好的改进
Dialogue: 2,0:50:32.86,0:50:34.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very lovely.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:34.30,0:50:39.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过你仍可对着传送门本体放置水直接将其摧毁
Dialogue: 2,0:50:34.30,0:50:39.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You can, however, place a water bucket on the portal itself and destroy it.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:39.22,0:50:47.89,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 确实存在罕见情况  主世界激活的下界传送门会生成僵尸猪灵
Dialogue: 2,0:50:39.22,0:50:43.81,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, it is actually possible for a zombified piglin
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.81,0:50:47.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to rarely spawn from an activated nether portal in the overworld.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:47.94,0:50:49.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过话虽如此
Dialogue: 2,0:50:47.94,0:50:49.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,With that said, however,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:49.22,0:50:54.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这些从下界传送门生成的僵尸猪灵  其生成概率取决于你设定的游戏难度
Dialogue: 2,0:50:49.22,0:50:51.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the spawn rate of these zombie piglins
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.38,0:50:54.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,from nether portals is based on the difficulty you play on.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:54.78,0:50:57.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在简单模式下 生成概率是正常水平
Dialogue: 2,0:50:54.78,0:50:57.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So on easy mode, the spawn rate is normal.
Dialogue: 1,0:50:57.96,0:50:59.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在普通难度下
Dialogue: 2,0:50:57.96,0:50:59.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On normal difficulty,
Dialogue: 1,0:50:59.30,0:51:00.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们的生成频率会翻倍
Dialogue: 2,0:50:59.30,0:51:00.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they can spawn twice as often.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:01.16,0:51:03.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在困难模式下  生成频率会提升至三倍
Dialogue: 2,0:51:01.16,0:51:03.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And on hard mode, they can spawn three times as often.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:04.36,0:51:06.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以没错 如果你在困难模式下游戏
Dialogue: 2,0:51:04.36,0:51:06.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you're playing on hard mode,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:06.96,0:51:11.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就能看到僵尸猪灵  从下界传送门频繁冒出来了
Dialogue: 2,0:51:06.96,0:51:11.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,expect to see a few zombie piglins spawning from your nether portals.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:11.50,0:51:14.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,随它们去吧 别管就没事
Dialogue: 2,0:51:11.50,0:51:14.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It's okay, just let them vibe and you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:14.68,0:51:20.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,地狱中的恶魂非常烦人  它们会不断朝你发射火球
Dialogue: 2,0:51:14.68,0:51:20.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The ghast mob can be very annoying in the nether as they can intend to shoot fireballs at you,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:20.88,0:51:24.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但一不小心  它们可能会误击并摧毁你的下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:51:20.88,0:51:24.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but accidentally hit and destroy your nether portal in the process.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:25.16,0:51:27.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,谢了恶魂兄 真是帮大忙了伙计
Dialogue: 2,0:51:25.16,0:51:27.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Cheers ghast, appreciate that mate.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:27.28,0:51:28.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过别担心 伙计们 
Dialogue: 2,0:51:27.28,0:51:28.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But don't worry guys,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:28.64,0:51:30.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你的下界传送门在地狱中被破坏了
Dialogue: 2,0:51:28.64,0:51:30.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if your nether portal breaks in the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:31.00,0:51:36.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,恶魂还能再次朝你发射火球  重新激活你的下界传送门
Dialogue: 2,0:51:31.00,0:51:36.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a ghast can also reactivate your nether portal by once again shooting another fireball at you.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:36.74,0:51:39.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧恶魂 我收回刚才的嘲讽
Dialogue: 2,0:51:36.74,0:51:39.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay ghast, I take back my sarcastic comment,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:39.16,0:51:40.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真心感谢你 伙计
Dialogue: 2,0:51:39.16,0:51:40.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate it man.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:40.70,0:51:43.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 当你进入下界传送门时
Dialogue: 2,0:51:40.70,0:51:43.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, when you enter a nether portal,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:43.38,0:51:47.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,进入传送门时  你会看到这种眩晕动画表示正在准备前往下界
Dialogue: 2,0:51:43.38,0:51:47.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll get this nausea animation while preparing to go to the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:47.70,0:51:48.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样的 
Dialogue: 2,0:51:47.70,0:51:48.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:51:49.08,0:51:51.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 在我的世界早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:51:49.08,0:51:51.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:52.30,0:51:53.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在游戏的Alpha版本时期 
Dialogue: 2,0:51:52.30,0:51:53.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha days of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:53.96,0:51:58.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,进入传送门时的眩晕动画  速度要快得多
Dialogue: 2,0:51:53.96,0:51:58.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the nausea animation while entering a portal moved a lot faster,
Dialogue: 1,0:51:58.30,0:52:01.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这甚至导致部分玩家出现晕动症状
Dialogue: 2,0:51:58.30,0:52:01.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which actually caused motion sickness for some players.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:01.50,0:52:08.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正因如此 传送门动画在Beta版本中被调缓并一直保持至今
Dialogue: 2,0:52:01.50,0:52:06.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because of this, the portal animation was toned down in Minecraft beta
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.36,0:52:08.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and it's remained like this ever since.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:08.96,0:52:12.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界Beta 1.9预发布版4中 
Dialogue: 2,0:52:08.96,0:52:12.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft beta 1.9 pre-release 4,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:12.22,0:52:17.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界传送门的材质被修改为  略微暗沉的色调
Dialogue: 2,0:52:12.22,0:52:17.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the nether portal's texture was changed to have a slightly darker look.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:17.16,0:52:25.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,此外 传送门框架本身会散发出  暗红色微光而非我们熟悉的紫色光效
Dialogue: 2,0:52:17.16,0:52:21.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of this, the portal frame itself gave off a slightly dark
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.78,0:52:25.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,reddish colour rather than the purple colour we're all familiar with.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:25.54,0:52:31.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 这个怪异的下界传送门材质改动  在我的世界1.0版本中被撤销了
Dialogue: 2,0:52:25.54,0:52:31.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, this weird nether portal texture change was reverted in Minecraft 1.0.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:31.66,0:52:36.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,下界传送门框架的硬度与基岩完全相同
Dialogue: 2,0:52:31.66,0:52:36.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The nether portal frame has the exact same hardness as bedrock,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:36.10,0:52:41.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着在我的世界中  你无法用拳头或任何工具摧毁它们
Dialogue: 2,0:52:36.10,0:52:41.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which means they're impossible to destroy with your fist or any tool in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:41.50,0:52:43.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的旧版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:52:41.50,0:52:43.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In older versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:52:43.76,0:52:49.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在旧版我的世界中  试图用命名牌给村民命名时  反而会触发交易界面
Dialogue: 2,0:52:43.76,0:52:49.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,trying to name a villager with a nametag would instead cause the trading interface to open.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:50.10,0:52:57.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,为此 玩家必须站在激活的传送门内  并快速为村民完成命名
Dialogue: 2,0:52:50.10,0:52:54.61,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,To counter this, players would have to stand inside of an activated
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.61,0:52:57.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,nether portal and quickly name said villager.
Dialogue: 1,0:52:57.82,0:53:00.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界1.8版本之前
Dialogue: 2,0:52:57.82,0:53:00.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before Minecraft version 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:00.40,0:53:06.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过输入/give指令  将下界传送门框架作为物品生成出来
Dialogue: 2,0:53:00.40,0:53:06.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were able to spawn in the nether portal frame as an item by using the slash give command.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:06.98,0:53:15.49,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着你可以将传送门框架收入物品栏  并放置在地面上随心所欲地进入下界
Dialogue: 2,0:53:06.98,0:53:10.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This meant you could have the portal frame in your inventory
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.74,0:53:15.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and also place it on the ground for you to enter into the nether if you wish.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:15.54,0:53:20.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而 将下界传送门框架作为物品生成的功能已被移除 
Dialogue: 2,0:53:15.54,0:53:20.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, the ability to spawn in the nether portal frame as an item was removed,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:21.00,0:53:24.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你仍可通过/setblock指令生成传送门框架
Dialogue: 2,0:53:21.00,0:53:24.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you could still spawn it in by using the set block command,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:24.66,0:53:26.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这勉强也算是个办法吧
Dialogue: 2,0:53:24.66,0:53:26.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is something I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:26.36,0:53:32.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸于2009年9月1日  在生存测试版本中加入我的世界
Dialogue: 2,0:53:26.36,0:53:32.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The zombie was added into Minecraft in the survival test version on September 1st 2009,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:32.80,0:53:34.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,距今已有12年之久
Dialogue: 2,0:53:32.80,0:53:34.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was over 12 years ago.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:35.12,0:53:42.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 所有在沙漠生物群系生成的僵尸  有80%的概率会被尸壳替代
Dialogue: 2,0:53:35.12,0:53:38.63,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, all zombies that spawn in desert biomes
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.63,0:53:42.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,have an 80% chance to spawn being replaced by the husk mob,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:43.00,0:53:44.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来是这样的
Dialogue: 2,0:53:43.00,0:53:44.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:44.34,0:53:51.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着在沙漠中遇到普通僵尸其实相当罕见  因为绝大多数时候出现的都是尸壳
Dialogue: 2,0:53:44.34,0:53:47.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This means it's actually rather rare for a zombie
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.59,0:53:51.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to be in a biome as most of the time they'll just be husks.
Dialogue: 1,0:53:51.58,0:53:54.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在2013年的Minecraft 1.5更新中
Dialogue: 2,0:53:51.58,0:53:54.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the Minecraft 1.5 update in 2013,
Dialogue: 1,0:53:54.94,0:54:01.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2013年的1.5版本更新中曾短暂调整过僵尸机制  当僵尸生命值较低时  会对玩家造成更高伤害
Dialogue: 2,0:53:54.94,0:53:58.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was briefly made to zombies where said zombies
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.58,0:54:01.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would do increased damage to the player when the zombie's health was low.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:02.96,0:54:05.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,换句话说 当僵尸濒临死亡时 
Dialogue: 2,0:54:02.96,0:54:05.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in other words, when a zombie was about to die,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:05.56,0:54:07.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们能更轻易地杀死玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:54:05.56,0:54:07.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they could kill the player a bit easier,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:07.74,0:54:09.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这大概给了它们背水一战的机会吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:07.74,0:54:09.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which gave them a fighting chance I guess.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:09.98,0:54:11.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过在1.6版本中  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:09.98,0:54:11.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in version 1.6,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:12.06,0:54:13.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个特性就被移除了  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:12.06,0:54:13.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this feature was removed,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:13.58,0:54:15.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,相信很多玩家都为此感到高兴  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:13.58,0:54:15.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I'm sure a lot of players were happy about.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:15.88,0:54:18.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在早期我的世界  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:15.88,0:54:18.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:18.36,0:54:20.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,生存测试版本里
Dialogue: 2,0:54:18.36,0:54:20.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the survival test version of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:20.46,0:54:23.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸偶尔会穿戴盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:54:20.46,0:54:23.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombies would occasionally wear armour.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:23.46,0:54:24.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在这个版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:54:23.46,0:54:24.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In this version however,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:24.84,0:54:29.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸只会佩戴铁头盔和铁胸甲
Dialogue: 2,0:54:24.84,0:54:29.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the zombies would only wear iron helmets and iron chest plates.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:29.24,0:54:38.73,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,更重要的是 生存测试版里僵尸的盔甲纯粹是装饰性的 并不会提升它们的防御力
Dialogue: 2,0:54:29.24,0:54:33.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of this, the armour that the zombies wore in the survival test
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.44,0:54:38.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were purely cosmetic and did not increase the zombies' protection at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:38.76,0:54:41.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说白了 僵尸们只是想耍帅  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:38.76,0:54:41.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In other words, the zombies just wanted to look cool,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:41.68,0:54:42.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而且它们确实做到了  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:41.68,0:54:42.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they did.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:42.64,0:54:43.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,至少我觉得挺酷的  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:42.64,0:54:43.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well I thought they looked cool,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:43.90,0:54:44.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,言归正传  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:43.90,0:54:44.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,anyways moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:44.92,0:54:46.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界基岩版中  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:44.92,0:54:46.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:46.54,0:54:52.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,有个独占特性 幼年僵尸能骑乘成年流浪猫  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:46.54,0:54:52.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there is an exclusive feature in the game where baby zombies are able to ride adult stray cats,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:52.98,0:54:54.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,若你想知道那场景有多诡异  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:52.98,0:54:54.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and if you wanna know what that looks like,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:54.68,0:54:55.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,请看画面  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:54.68,0:54:55.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then here you go.
Dialogue: 1,0:54:56.00,0:54:58.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 在基岩版里  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:56.00,0:54:58.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but in Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,0:54:58.52,0:55:01.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,幼年僵尸还能骑熊猫  
Dialogue: 2,0:54:58.52,0:55:01.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,baby zombies can also ride pandas,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:01.38,0:55:03.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这遭遇战也够离奇的  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:01.38,0:55:03.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which too is a rather strange thing to encounter,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:04.20,0:55:06.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,喏 效果如图所示  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:04.20,0:55:06.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but hey, it looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:06.26,0:55:08.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我真心疼那只猫啊  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:06.26,0:55:08.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I just feel so bad for the cat man,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:08.30,0:55:09.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你看它生无可恋的样子  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:08.30,0:55:09.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean just look at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:09.44,0:55:10.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,继续往下说  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:09.44,0:55:10.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:10.54,0:55:16.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏中多数敌对生物在16格范围内追踪玩家  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:10.54,0:55:16.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, most hostile mobs will track the player within 16 blocks of their proximity,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:16.02,0:55:21.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而僵尸的感知距离长达42格  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:16.02,0:55:21.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas zombies can track the player from up to a whopping 42 blocks away.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:21.14,0:55:23.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这让僵尸格外烦人  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:21.14,0:55:23.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This makes zombies rather annoying,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:23.72,0:55:28.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你总能看到它们从老远就冲过来  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:23.72,0:55:28.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you'll always see a bunch of zombies approaching you from very far away.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:28.36,0:55:29.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,喂 我看见你了  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:28.36,0:55:29.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can see you mate,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:29.90,0:55:31.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,能别追了吗？  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:29.90,0:55:31.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,can you just go away please?
Dialogue: 1,0:55:31.72,0:55:35.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你戴上僵尸头颅  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:31.72,0:55:35.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you happen to obtain a zombie head and wear it,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:35.94,0:55:40.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸的探测范围就会缩减50%  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:35.94,0:55:40.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the detection range of the zombies is reduced by 50%.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:40.08,0:55:45.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 戴上后它们只能在21格外发现你  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:40.08,0:55:45.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, wear a zombie head and zombies will only be able to see you from 21 blocks away,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:46.06,0:55:47.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,虽然还是有点烦  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:46.06,0:55:47.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is still a bit annoying,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:47.88,0:55:49.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但总比42格强  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:47.88,0:55:49.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it's better than 42.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:49.84,0:55:53.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸堪称游戏里最恶毒的生物  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:49.84,0:55:53.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Zombies are potentially the meanest mobs in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:53.38,0:55:55.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们连幼年海龟都不放过  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:53.38,0:55:55.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as they will attack and kill baby turtles,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:56.14,0:55:57.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,简直丧心病狂
Dialogue: 2,0:55:56.14,0:55:57.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is just horrible.
Dialogue: 1,0:55:57.72,0:55:59.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这画面太残忍了  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:57.72,0:55:59.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is so hard to watch man,
Dialogue: 1,0:55:59.54,0:56:01.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但为了视频效果不得不放  
Dialogue: 2,0:55:59.54,0:56:01.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I had to show it for the purpose of the video,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:01.44,0:56:02.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,实在对不住各位  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:01.44,0:56:02.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:02.58,0:56:04.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果觉得刚才够过分  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:02.58,0:56:04.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you thought that was bad,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:04.20,0:56:05.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,还有更糟的  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:04.20,0:56:05.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it just gets worse,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:05.56,0:56:11.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸会主动搜寻并摧毁24格内的海龟蛋  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:05.56,0:56:11.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as zombies will also seek out and destroy turtle eggs within a 24 block radius,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:11.56,0:56:13.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这也太缺德了  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:11.56,0:56:13.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is just awful as well,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:13.16,0:56:14.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没想到游戏真有这种设定  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:13.16,0:56:14.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this is a thing in Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:15.32,0:56:17.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,安东尼咱们消消气  
Dialogue: 2,0:56:15.32,0:56:17.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways Anthony, let's just relax,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:17.12,0:56:18.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,冷静点兄弟 继续往下看吧
Dialogue: 2,0:56:17.12,0:56:18.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,calm down mate, let's move on again.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:18.70,0:56:20.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:56:18.70,0:56:20.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:21.24,0:56:23.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在游戏的生存测试版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:56:21.24,0:56:23.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the survival test version of the game,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:23.44,0:56:26.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸的移动速度能和玩家一样快
Dialogue: 2,0:56:23.44,0:56:26.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombies could run as fast as the player,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:26.18,0:56:28.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这让玩家根本无处可逃
Dialogue: 2,0:56:26.18,0:56:28.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,making them really difficult to get away from.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:28.74,0:56:30.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老兄 离我远点行不行？
Dialogue: 2,0:56:28.74,0:56:30.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Listen mate, get away from me alright?
Dialogue: 1,0:56:30.52,0:56:33.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我宁愿被苦力怕炸飞也不想被你追着跑
Dialogue: 2,0:56:30.52,0:56:33.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'd rather have a creeper blow me up than have you chase me.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:33.26,0:56:36.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,由于僵尸是Minecraft中的亡灵生物
Dialogue: 2,0:56:33.26,0:56:36.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Due to zombies being undead mobs in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:36.84,0:56:40.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,伤害药水反而会治愈僵尸
Dialogue: 2,0:56:36.84,0:56:40.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a potion of harming will actually heal the zombies rather than,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:40.60,0:56:41.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而不是伤害它们 
Dialogue: 2,0:56:40.60,0:56:41.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,well, harm them.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:41.84,0:56:46.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正因如此 治疗药水对僵尸反而会造成伤害 
Dialogue: 2,0:56:41.84,0:56:46.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Because of this, a potion of healing will do the complete opposite to zombies.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:46.64,0:56:50.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 如果你朝僵尸扔治疗药水 
Dialogue: 2,0:56:46.64,0:56:50.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, if you chuck a potion of healing at a zombie,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:50.36,0:56:54.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它实际上会对僵尸造成伤害 最终将其消灭
Dialogue: 2,0:56:50.36,0:56:54.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it will actually deal damage to them and eventually kill them.
Dialogue: 1,0:56:54.22,0:56:57.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft开发版的0.31版本中 
Dialogue: 2,0:56:54.22,0:56:57.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the 0.31 version of Minecraft in dev,
Dialogue: 1,0:56:57.84,0:57:03.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸曾被改为完全被动 根本不会攻击玩家
Dialogue: 2,0:56:57.84,0:57:00.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was briefly made to where zombies
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.59,0:57:03.83,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,were completely passive and wouldn't attack you at all.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:04.02,0:57:07.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你想和僵尸一起放松嗨皮
Dialogue: 2,0:57:04.02,0:57:07.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, if you wanna chill and vibe with the zombies,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:07.82,0:57:09.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩这个版本的Minecraft
Dialogue: 2,0:57:07.82,0:57:09.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,play this version of Minecraft.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:09.68,0:57:12.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,或者你也可以直接玩创造模式 
Dialogue: 2,0:57:09.68,0:57:12.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Or you know, you can just play creative mode,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:12.14,0:57:13.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但你应该明白我的意思
Dialogue: 2,0:57:12.14,0:57:13.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but you get my point.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:13.32,0:57:19.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在万圣节期间 Minecraft会变得稍微困难一些 原因如下
Dialogue: 2,0:57:13.32,0:57:19.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,During Halloween, Minecraft is considered to be a slightly harder game and here is why.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:19.36,0:57:22.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此每年10月31日那天
Dialogue: 2,0:57:19.36,0:57:22.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So every year on October 31st,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:22.10,0:57:25.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸有几率生成时头戴南瓜  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:22.10,0:57:25.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombies have a chance to spawn wearing a pumpkin on their head,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:25.78,0:57:28.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着它们在阳光下不会燃烧死亡  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:25.78,0:57:28.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which means they won't burn and die in daylight.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:28.36,0:57:32.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以万圣节白天也要应付僵尸咯  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:28.36,0:57:32.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, enjoy dealing with zombies during the day on Halloween.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:33.36,0:57:35.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不知道为什么我用这种语气说万圣节  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:33.36,0:57:35.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Not sure why I said Halloween like that,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:35.74,0:57:37.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过无所谓 继续吧  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:35.74,0:57:37.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but fair enough, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:37.52,0:57:41.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸是Minecraft史上第二个加入的生物  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:37.52,0:57:41.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the zombie was the second ever mob to be added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:41.76,0:57:43.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但第一个生物是什么呢？  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:41.76,0:57:43.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but what was the first mob?
Dialogue: 1,0:57:43.28,0:57:49.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,首个加入的是人类生物 它们就是顶着史蒂夫皮肤  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:43.28,0:57:46.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So the first mob added was the human mob
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.03,0:57:49.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they were just Steve skins that would run around aimlessly while flapping
Dialogue: 1,0:57:49.98,0:57:52.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,胡乱挥舞手臂到处乱跑 看起来特别滑稽  
Dialogue: 2,0:57:49.98,0:57:52.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,their arms about, which looked pretty funny.
Dialogue: 1,0:57:52.38,0:57:56.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过人类生物后来被移除了
Dialogue: 2,0:57:52.38,0:57:56.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, the human mob has since been removed from Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:57:56.40,0:58:00.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着僵尸成为了Minecraft现存最古老的敌对生物
Dialogue: 2,0:57:56.40,0:58:00.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which means zombies are the oldest surviving hostile mob in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:01.04,0:58:01.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实很了不起 
Dialogue: 2,0:58:01.04,0:58:01.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is impressive.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:02.30,0:58:04.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮僵尸 我为你骄傲伙计
Dialogue: 2,0:58:02.30,0:58:04.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well done zombie, I'm proud of you mate.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:04.38,0:58:09.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期阶段 从开发版本到Beta 1.7时期 
Dialogue: 2,0:58:04.38,0:58:09.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft from version in dev to beta 1.7,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:09.92,0:58:13.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸死亡时会掉落0-2根羽毛
Dialogue: 2,0:58:09.92,0:58:13.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombies would drop 0-2 feathers upon death.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:13.48,0:58:14.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个细节
Dialogue: 2,0:58:13.48,0:58:14.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now if you remember this,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:14.90,0:58:17.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你就是Minecraft老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,0:58:14.90,0:58:17.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:17.28,0:58:26.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,此外 僵尸会掉落羽毛的唯一原因是Notch当时根本不知道僵尸 该掉落什么物品
Dialogue: 2,0:58:17.28,0:58:21.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Additionally, the only reason zombies ever dropped feathers in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.96,0:58:26.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was because Notch had no idea what zombies should drop when they were killed.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:26.46,0:58:28.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如今在Minecraft里
Dialogue: 2,0:58:26.46,0:58:28.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But hey, in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:28.16,0:58:30.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸现在会掉落各种物品了
Dialogue: 2,0:58:28.16,0:58:30.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombies drop all sorts of things now,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:30.18,0:58:35.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但说实话 我有点怀念它们掉落羽毛的日子  因为那样制作箭矢会容易得多
Dialogue: 2,0:58:30.18,0:58:32.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but I kinda miss it when they dropped feathers to be honest
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.76,0:58:35.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because it made it quite easy to craft arrows.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:35.36,0:58:36.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 继续下一个话题
Dialogue: 2,0:58:35.36,0:58:36.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:36.60,0:58:42.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在困难难度下  僵尸有48%的几率生成时穿戴金质盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:58:36.60,0:58:42.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On hard difficulty, zombies have a 48% chance to spawn wearing gold armor.
Dialogue: 1,0:58:42.72,0:58:46.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们还有37%的几率  生成时穿戴皮革盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:58:42.72,0:58:46.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,They then have a 37% chance to spawn wearing leather armor,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:46.94,0:58:50.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,12%的几率生成时穿戴锁链盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:58:46.94,0:58:50.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a 12% chance to spawn wearing chain armor,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:50.28,0:58:53.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,1%的几率生成时穿戴铁质盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:58:50.28,0:58:53.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a 1% chance to spawn wearing iron armor,
Dialogue: 1,0:58:53.66,0:59:00.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最后 僵尸在困难难度下  有0.04%的几率生成时穿戴钻石盔甲
Dialogue: 2,0:58:53.66,0:59:00.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and finally, zombies have a 0.04% chance to spawn wearing diamond armor on hard difficulty,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:01.12,0:59:02.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这概率简直低得离谱
Dialogue: 2,0:59:01.12,0:59:02.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is extremely rare.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:03.16,0:59:05.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你曾见过穿戴钻石盔甲的僵尸
Dialogue: 2,0:59:03.16,0:59:05.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now if you've ever seen a zombie wearing diamond armor,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:06.04,0:59:10.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那一定要在评论区告诉我  因为我超好奇你们有没有遇到过这种情况
Dialogue: 2,0:59:06.04,0:59:08.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then let me know in the comments because I'm very curious
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.51,0:59:10.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to hear if you guys have ever encountered it.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:10.94,0:59:14.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸其实也能在下界生成
Dialogue: 2,0:59:10.94,0:59:14.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Zombies are actually able to spawn in the nether,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:14.74,0:59:15.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,原因如下
Dialogue: 2,0:59:14.74,0:59:15.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and here is why.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:15.84,0:59:17.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在困难难度下
Dialogue: 2,0:59:15.84,0:59:17.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So on hard difficulty,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:17.60,0:59:23.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸猪灵在被玩家攻击时  偶尔会召唤增援部队
Dialogue: 2,0:59:17.60,0:59:23.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,zombified piglins will occasionally spawn reinforcements when they are attacked by the player.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:23.52,0:59:24.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但大多数情况下
Dialogue: 2,0:59:23.52,0:59:24.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now most of the time,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:24.74,0:59:27.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,增援部队通常只是更多的僵尸猪灵
Dialogue: 2,0:59:24.74,0:59:27.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the reinforcements will just be more zombified piglins,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:28.06,0:59:31.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但有时增援部队中  也会出现普通僵尸
Dialogue: 2,0:59:28.06,0:59:31.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but sometimes zombies can be a part of the reinforcements as well,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:31.96,0:59:33.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这还挺有意思的
Dialogue: 2,0:59:31.96,0:59:33.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:33.44,0:59:35.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,0:59:33.44,0:59:35.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:35.80,0:59:38.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当僵尸站在蜘蛛网里时
Dialogue: 2,0:59:35.80,0:59:38.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when zombies were standing inside of a cobweb,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:38.86,0:59:41.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们不知为何不会在阳光下燃烧
Dialogue: 2,0:59:38.86,0:59:41.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they would not burn in sunlight for some reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:41.82,0:59:46.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们反而会在蜘蛛网里  悠闲地度过白天时光
Dialogue: 2,0:59:41.82,0:59:46.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Instead, they'd just chill in the cobweb and vibe during the daytime,
Dialogue: 1,0:59:46.24,0:59:48.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想必僵尸们对此相当享受
Dialogue: 2,0:59:46.24,0:59:48.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I'm sure zombies absolutely loved.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:48.98,0:59:56.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我在视频前面提到的僵尸头颅物品  只能通过极其罕见的情况获得
Dialogue: 2,0:59:48.98,0:59:52.43,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The zombie head item I mentioned earlier in the video
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.43,0:59:56.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,can only be obtained from a very rare scenario.
Dialogue: 1,0:59:56.32,1:00:03.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因此玩家只有在闪电苦力怕爆炸  并杀死附近的僵尸时才能获得僵尸头颅
Dialogue: 2,0:59:56.32,1:00:03.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So players can only obtain a zombie head if a charge creeper explodes and kills a nearby zombie.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:03.14,1:00:05.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以啊 遇到闪电苦力怕可得当心点 
Dialogue: 2,1:00:03.14,1:00:05.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, be careful of the charge creepers.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:05.94,1:00:08.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果尸壳恰好身处水下 
Dialogue: 2,1:00:05.94,1:00:08.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a husk ever happens to be underwater,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:08.92,1:00:14.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它会在水下停留30秒后  转变为普通僵尸
Dialogue: 2,1:00:08.92,1:00:14.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it will turn into a normal zombie after vibing there for 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:14.50,1:00:22.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这只新转化的僵尸若继续留在水中  再过30秒就会变成溺尸
Dialogue: 2,1:00:14.50,1:00:18.51,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This newly turned zombie will then turn into a drowned mob
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.51,1:00:22.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,after an additional 30 seconds if it continues to stay there underwater.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.56,1:00:22.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,{\pos(86.933,116.489)}为什么不帮我:(
Dialogue: 1,1:00:23.16,1:00:25.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界的早期版本中 
Dialogue: 2,1:00:23.16,1:00:25.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:25.58,1:00:30.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本中  幼年僵尸在白天阳光下是不会自燃的
Dialogue: 2,1:00:25.58,1:00:30.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the baby zombie mob used to not burn in sunlight during the daytime.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:30.64,1:00:33.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这使得它们成为游戏中最烦人的生物之一
Dialogue: 2,1:00:30.64,1:00:33.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This made them one of the most annoying mobs ever,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:34.06,1:00:40.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正当你白天想悠闲度日时  总会有烦人的幼年僵尸  突然冲过来袭击你
Dialogue: 2,1:00:34.06,1:00:36.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you'd just be trying to vibe during the day
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.64,1:00:40.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,when a stupid baby zombie would come charging towards you and potentially
Dialogue: 1,1:00:40.30,1:00:41.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,把你干掉
Dialogue: 2,1:00:40.30,1:00:41.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,kill you as well.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:41.52,1:00:44.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但幸运的是 在1.13版本中 
Dialogue: 2,1:00:41.52,1:00:44.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But luckily, in version 1.13,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:44.18,1:00:47.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一项改动使得幼年僵尸  现在也会在阳光下燃烧
Dialogue: 2,1:00:44.18,1:00:47.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was made to where baby zombies would now burn in the sun,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:47.90,1:00:49.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这改动简直大快人心
Dialogue: 2,1:00:47.90,1:00:49.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which I am so happy about.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:50.38,1:00:54.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果僵尸在燃烧时攻击玩家
Dialogue: 2,1:00:50.38,1:00:54.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a zombie attacks the player while they're on fire,
Dialogue: 1,1:00:54.28,1:00:58.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么玩家也有一定几率会被点燃
Dialogue: 2,1:00:54.28,1:00:58.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then there's a small chance that the player will be set on fire as well.
Dialogue: 1,1:00:58.78,1:01:01.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 游戏难度越高
Dialogue: 2,1:00:58.78,1:01:01.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of this, the higher the difficulty you're playing on,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:01.98,1:01:05.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,僵尸点燃你的概率就越高
Dialogue: 2,1:01:01.98,1:01:05.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the higher the chance the zombie has to set you on fire,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:05.50,1:01:08.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以玩极限模式时  千万要当心燃烧的僵尸
Dialogue: 2,1:01:05.50,1:01:08.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so watch out for burning zombies if you're playing hardcore.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:08.74,1:01:10.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,截至我制作本期视频时
Dialogue: 2,1:01:08.74,1:01:10.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,As of the time of me making this video,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:11.04,1:01:15.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,目前我的世界中  关于美西螈存在一个漏洞
Dialogue: 2,1:01:11.04,1:01:15.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there is a glitch present in Minecraft when it comes to axolotls.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:15.20,1:01:17.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你用拴绳拴住一只美西螈 
Dialogue: 2,1:01:15.20,1:01:17.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you attach a lead to an axolotl,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:17.98,1:01:22.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,拴住后它就会像这样  绕着玩家飞速转圈
Dialogue: 2,1:01:17.98,1:01:22.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then it will begin to walk extremely fast around the player as you can see.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:22.32,1:01:24.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,至于原因 我也百思不得其解
Dialogue: 2,1:01:22.32,1:01:24.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Why they do this, I have no idea,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:24.88,1:01:27.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这只美西螈显然乐在其中
Dialogue: 2,1:01:24.88,1:01:27.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but this axolotl is absolutely loving it.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:27.80,1:01:31.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个漏洞对多只美西螈也有效  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:27.80,1:01:31.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This glitch also works with more than one axolotl,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:31.16,1:01:37.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,意味着你可以用拴绳拴住一群美西螈  它们就会绕着玩家急速转圈  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:31.16,1:01:33.99,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which means you can attach multiple axolotls to a lead
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.99,1:01:37.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and they'll all just circle around the player very quickly,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:37.22,1:01:39.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,场面简直混乱到极点  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:37.22,1:01:39.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which just looks absolutely mayhem.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:39.86,1:01:41.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 我们继续  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:39.86,1:01:41.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's move on.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:41.58,1:01:48.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,美西螈被加入我的世界的原因  是因为现实中的美西螈濒临灭绝  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:41.58,1:01:45.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The reason why axolotls were added into Minecraft is
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.24,1:01:48.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,because axolotls in real life are critically endangered,
Dialogue: 1,1:01:49.26,1:01:52.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我觉得Mojang借此提高公众意识的做法很棒  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:49.26,1:01:52.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so I think it's great that Mojang are raising awareness for them.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:52.74,1:01:58.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏中美西螈会攻击所有水下生物  除了海龟和海豚  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:52.74,1:01:58.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, axolotls will attack all underwater mobs except turtles and dolphins.
Dialogue: 1,1:01:59.22,1:02:00.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这包括溺尸  
Dialogue: 2,1:01:59.22,1:02:00.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This includes the drowned,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:01.24,1:02:02.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,守卫者 远古守卫者  
Dialogue: 2,1:02:01.24,1:02:02.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,guardian, elder guardian,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:03.28,1:02:05.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,鱿鱼 荧光鱿鱼 以及各种鱼类
Dialogue: 2,1:02:03.28,1:02:05.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,squid, glow squid, and fish.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:06.08,1:02:08.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果有生物或玩家攻击美西螈
Dialogue: 2,1:02:06.08,1:02:08.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a mob or player attacks an axolotl,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:08.84,1:02:11.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们有1/3的概率会装死
Dialogue: 2,1:02:08.84,1:02:11.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then they have a 1 in 3 chance of playing dead.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:12.20,1:02:17.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着它们会装死10秒钟  同时恢复2颗心的生命值
Dialogue: 2,1:02:12.20,1:02:17.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This means they'll pretend to be dead for 10 seconds while recovering 2 hearts of health.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:17.84,1:02:24.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在屏幕上显示的是未发布的绿色变种美西螈  看起来还挺酷的
Dialogue: 2,1:02:17.84,1:02:24.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The axolotl you see on screen is an unreleased green variant of the mob and it looks kinda cool.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:24.52,1:02:30.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,2020年我的世界直播回顾截图中  就曾出现过这只绿色美西螈
Dialogue: 2,1:02:24.52,1:02:30.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, the green axolotl was seen in the Minecraft live recap screenshot in 2020,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:30.52,1:02:33.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但它从未在我的世界1.17版本中正式加入
Dialogue: 2,1:02:30.52,1:02:33.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it was never officially added in Minecraft 1.17,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:34.12,1:02:35.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这真是挺遗憾的
Dialogue: 2,1:02:34.12,1:02:35.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a shame to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:35.88,1:02:40.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,除此之外 在洞穴与山崖更新第一部分的预告视频中
Dialogue: 2,1:02:35.88,1:02:40.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On top of this, in the trailer video for part 1 of the Caves and Cliffs update,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:40.90,1:02:46.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管绿色美西螈并未出现在正式更新中  但在预告视频里仍能短暂看到它的身影
Dialogue: 2,1:02:40.90,1:02:46.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the green axolotl can briefly be seen despite it not appearing in the update itself.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:46.56,1:02:48.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,安息吧 绿色美西螈 
Dialogue: 2,1:02:46.56,1:02:48.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Rest in peace, green axolotl,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:48.70,1:02:49.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们会想念你的 
Dialogue: 2,1:02:48.70,1:02:49.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you will be missed.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:49.86,1:02:54.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界中 可以通过使用热带鱼桶来繁殖美西螈
Dialogue: 2,1:02:49.86,1:02:54.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft, axolotls can be bred by using buckets of tropical fish,
Dialogue: 1,1:02:54.76,1:02:58.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但不能直接使用热带鱼物品来繁殖
Dialogue: 2,1:02:54.76,1:02:58.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but not by using the tropical fish items themselves.
Dialogue: 1,1:02:58.64,1:03:00.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这是因为在现实中 
Dialogue: 2,1:02:58.64,1:03:00.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is because in real life,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:00.80,1:03:03.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,美西螈只以活鱼为食
Dialogue: 2,1:03:00.80,1:03:03.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,axolotls will only eat living fish.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:03.84,1:03:07.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而你知道的 装在桶里的鱼仍然是活着的 
Dialogue: 2,1:03:03.84,1:03:07.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,And you know, the fish that are still in the buckets are still alive,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:07.78,1:03:09.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以这个设定非常合理 
Dialogue: 2,1:03:07.78,1:03:09.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so this feature makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:09.62,1:03:13.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,蓝色美西螈的生成概率设定为1/1200
Dialogue: 2,1:03:09.62,1:03:13.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The reason why blue axolotls have a 1 in 1,200
Dialogue: 1,1:03:13.46,1:03:18.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,之所以设定为1/1200的生成概率  是因为现实世界中仅存约1200只
Dialogue: 2,1:03:13.46,1:03:18.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,chance to spawn is due to the fact that there are only roughly 1,200
Dialogue: 1,1:03:18.00,1:03:20.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,野生美西螈存活于现实世界 
Dialogue: 2,1:03:18.00,1:03:20.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,axolotls left in the wild in real life.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:21.02,1:03:23.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 读到这个事实挺让人难过的  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:21.02,1:03:23.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, reading that fact is rather sad,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:23.88,1:03:27.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过我很高兴Mojang通过游戏提高了人们对美西螈的关注  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:23.88,1:03:27.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but again, I'm glad Mojang is bringing awareness to axolotls.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:27.94,1:03:29.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管体型娇小  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:27.94,1:03:29.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Despite their small size,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:29.50,1:03:33.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但正如你所见 游戏里的美西螈能爬上方块  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:29.50,1:03:33.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,axolotls in Minecraft are able to climb up blocks as you can see,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:33.50,1:03:35.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话这动作萌翻了  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:33.50,1:03:35.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks so cute to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:35.44,1:03:36.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们正努力向上爬  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:35.44,1:03:36.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, they're getting there,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:36.94,1:03:37.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这份努力值得鼓励  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:36.94,1:03:37.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they're trying.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:37.88,1:03:39.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,加油啊小家伙  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:37.88,1:03:39.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You've got this axolotl.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:39.16,1:03:42.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当玩家击杀与美西螈战斗的怪物时  
Dialogue: 2,1:03:39.16,1:03:42.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If a player kills a mob that an axolotl is in combat with,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:42.90,1:03:47.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,美西螈会给予玩家几秒钟的生命恢复效果
Dialogue: 2,1:03:42.90,1:03:47.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the axolotl will give you the regeneration effect for a few seconds,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:47.34,1:03:48.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它们真是太贴心了
Dialogue: 2,1:03:47.34,1:03:48.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very lovely of them.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:49.02,1:03:53.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,用桶右键点击美西螈就能把它装进桶里带走
Dialogue: 2,1:03:49.02,1:03:53.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Right clicking on an axolotl with a bucket allows you to collect it,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:53.24,1:03:55.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,获得一桶美西螈
Dialogue: 2,1:03:53.24,1:03:55.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,giving you a bucket of axolotl,
Dialogue: 1,1:03:55.48,1:03:56.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来就像这样
Dialogue: 2,1:03:55.48,1:03:56.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:03:56.94,1:04:04.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这样你就能把美西螈桶放进发射器里  只需点击按钮就能放出美西螈
Dialogue: 2,1:03:56.94,1:04:01.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This allows you to put the bucket of axolotl in a dispenser
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.03,1:04:04.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and dispense an axolotl at the click of a button.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:04.60,1:04:13.29,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你还可以把美西螈桶放进物品展示框里  展示这些可爱的小家伙
Dialogue: 2,1:04:04.60,1:04:08.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another thing you can do with a bucket of axolotl is
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.08,1:04:13.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,put the bucket inside of an item frame and display your lovely axolotl.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:13.32,1:04:16.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话 这感觉有点残忍
Dialogue: 2,1:04:13.32,1:04:16.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna lie, this feels a bit mean to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:16.30,1:04:20.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,美西螈本该在水中悠游自在  却被困在展示框里动弹不得
Dialogue: 2,1:04:16.30,1:04:20.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The axolotl should be chilling in the water and instead it's just trapped in an item frame,
Dialogue: 1,1:04:20.68,1:04:21.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这实在太残忍了
Dialogue: 2,1:04:20.68,1:04:21.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is horrible.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:21.68,1:04:22.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好了 我们继续
Dialogue: 2,1:04:21.68,1:04:22.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:22.86,1:04:28.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,蓝色美西螈是唯一一种  现实中不存在的变种
Dialogue: 2,1:04:22.86,1:04:28.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The blue axolotl is the only variant that is not based on a real life axolotl.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:28.92,1:04:34.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而其他四种美西螈  确实都源自现实中的品种
Dialogue: 2,1:04:28.92,1:04:34.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The other four axolotls on the other hand are in fact based on real axolotls,
Dialogue: 1,1:04:34.28,1:04:36.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个细节设计得相当用心
Dialogue: 2,1:04:34.28,1:04:36.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is a nice attention to detail.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:36.70,1:04:43.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过别担心  蓝色美西螈依然很有趣  它是根据Reddit网友建议加入游戏的
Dialogue: 2,1:04:36.70,1:04:40.49,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But don't worry, the blue axolotl is still very interesting
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.49,1:04:43.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as it was added after somebody suggested it on Reddit.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:44.12,1:04:52.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,于是Reddit用户DarkEyesFlame提议  我的世界应该加入稀有的蓝色美西螈  其外观
Dialogue: 2,1:04:44.12,1:04:48.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So Reddit user known as DarkEyesFlame mentioned that Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.46,1:04:52.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,should add a rare blue axolotl and have its appearance be
Dialogue: 1,1:04:52.06,1:04:54.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,参考精灵宝可梦系列中水跃鱼的外观
Dialogue: 2,1:04:52.06,1:04:54.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,based off Mudkip from the Pokemon series.
Dialogue: 1,1:04:54.94,1:04:58.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以没错 蓝色美西螈并非源自现实生物 
Dialogue: 2,1:04:54.94,1:04:58.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, the blue axolotl isn't based on real life,
Dialogue: 1,1:04:58.38,1:05:00.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但它确实参考了宝可梦里的水跃鱼 
Dialogue: 2,1:04:58.38,1:05:00.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it is based off Mudkip from Pokemon,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:00.96,1:05:02.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这真是太酷了
Dialogue: 2,1:05:00.96,1:05:02.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very cool.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:02.22,1:05:07.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,无论剩余耐久度多少  木制工具在熔炉中燃烧时间完全相同
Dialogue: 2,1:05:02.22,1:05:07.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A wooden tool will burn exactly the same in a furnace regardless of its remaining durability.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:07.88,1:05:13.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着耐久度耗尽的旧木制工具  在熔炉中的燃烧效果  和全新的木制工具完全一样
Dialogue: 2,1:05:07.88,1:05:13.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fs9}This means a used up wooden tool with low durability will be just as effective as a new wooden tool.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:13.86,1:05:16.06,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在熔炉加入我的世界之前
Dialogue: 2,1:05:13.86,1:05:16.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before furnaces were added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:16.40,1:05:18.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,物品是通过另一种方式熔炼的
Dialogue: 2,1:05:16.40,1:05:18.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,items were smelted in a different way.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:19.06,1:05:21.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以在我的世界开发早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:05:19.06,1:05:21.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in the early versions of Minecraft in dev,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:21.70,1:05:27.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以通过将矿石扔在地上  然后用打火石点燃来熔炼它们
Dialogue: 2,1:05:21.70,1:05:25.09,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players could smelt ores by dropping the item on the ground
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.09,1:05:27.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and setting them on fire with a flint and steel.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:28.12,1:05:30.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实是种非常独特的熔炼矿石方式
Dialogue: 2,1:05:28.12,1:05:30.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Definitely a very different way of smelting ores,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:31.00,1:05:32.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过嘛 至少这方法确实管用
Dialogue: 2,1:05:31.00,1:05:32.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but hey, at least it worked.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:32.46,1:05:40.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,岩浆桶是我的世界中最高效的熔炉燃料  单桶就能熔炼多达100个物品
Dialogue: 2,1:05:32.46,1:05:36.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A lava bucket is the most effective furnace fuel to use in Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.88,1:05:40.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as it can smelt up to a whopping 100 items,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:40.44,1:05:41.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直太疯狂了
Dialogue: 2,1:05:40.44,1:05:41.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is crazy.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:41.54,1:05:43.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界Java版中
Dialogue: 2,1:05:41.54,1:05:43.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In Minecraft Java Edition,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:43.26,1:05:45.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你徒手破坏熔炉
Dialogue: 2,1:05:43.26,1:05:45.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,if you break a furnace with your hand,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:45.46,1:05:49.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,需要整整17.5秒
Dialogue: 2,1:05:45.46,1:05:49.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it takes exactly 17.5 seconds to destroy it.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:49.68,1:05:52.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,值得一提的是 这样破坏熔炉并不会使其掉落为可拾取物品 
Dialogue: 2,1:05:49.68,1:05:52.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,With that said, the furnace will not drop as an item,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:52.22,1:05:54.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以别像我一样浪费时间做这种傻事
Dialogue: 2,1:05:52.22,1:05:54.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so don't waste your time doing this like I did.
Dialogue: 1,1:05:54.42,1:05:56.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在我的世界基岩版中
Dialogue: 2,1:05:54.42,1:05:56.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,On Minecraft Bedrock Edition however,
Dialogue: 1,1:05:56.82,1:06:01.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而在基岩版中  徒手破坏熔炉同样需要17.5秒
Dialogue: 2,1:05:56.82,1:06:01.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,destroying a furnace with your hand again takes 17.5 seconds,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:01.34,1:06:03.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但熔炉会作为物品掉落
Dialogue: 2,1:06:01.34,1:06:03.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but the furnace will drop as an item.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:03.66,1:06:08.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,每个物品在燃烧的熔炉中  熔炼时间恰好为8秒
Dialogue: 2,1:06:03.66,1:06:08.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The smelting time of each item in an active furnace is exactly 8 seconds.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:09.26,1:06:11.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界Alpha版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:06:09.26,1:06:11.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the alpha versions of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:11.18,1:06:15.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,熔炉的顶部材质原本是石头制成的
Dialogue: 2,1:06:11.18,1:06:15.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the top part of the furnace texture was made out of stone,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:15.10,1:06:16.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来就像这样
Dialogue: 2,1:06:15.10,1:06:16.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:16.66,1:06:23.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这让熔炉更容易隐藏在其他玩家视线中  因为你可以把它和普通石头混在一起
Dialogue: 2,1:06:16.66,1:06:20.69,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This made the furnace a lot easier to hide from other players
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.69,1:06:23.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as you could blend the furnace in with regular stone,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:24.14,1:06:25.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设计相当酷
Dialogue: 2,1:06:24.14,1:06:25.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was pretty cool.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:25.36,1:06:27.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过在我的世界Beta版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:06:25.36,1:06:27.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in Minecraft Beta,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:27.48,1:06:30.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,熔炉顶部获得了专属的新材质
Dialogue: 2,1:06:27.48,1:06:30.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the top part of the furnace received its own texture.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:30.46,1:06:36.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在雪地生物群系生成的村庄建筑里会有这种覆雪的小屋
Dialogue: 2,1:06:30.46,1:06:33.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The village structures that you find in snow biomes
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.44,1:06:36.29,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,contain these snowy houses that look like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:36.50,1:06:43.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在这些雪屋中 你能找到的箱子里有9.9%概率会出现熔炉
Dialogue: 2,1:06:36.50,1:06:43.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In said snowy house, you can find a chest that has a 9.9% chance to have a furnace inside of it.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:44.06,1:06:47.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你在游戏中驯服了猫  同时点燃了熔炉
Dialogue: 2,1:06:44.06,1:06:47.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you have tamed a cat in Minecraft and have an active furnace going,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:48.16,1:06:52.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就要做好准备——你的猫会蹲在燃烧的熔炉上取暖
Dialogue: 2,1:06:48.16,1:06:52.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then be prepared as your cat will sit on the lit furnace to keep warm.
Dialogue: 1,1:06:52.54,1:06:55.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在InfDev版本的某个时期
Dialogue: 2,1:06:52.54,1:06:55.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,At some point in Minecraft version InfDev,
Dialogue: 1,1:06:55.30,1:07:01.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,曾短暂修改过熔炉材质  移除了“面部”特征 改用全周统一贴图
Dialogue: 2,1:06:55.30,1:06:59.13,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was briefly made to where the furnaces no longer had a face
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.13,1:07:01.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and used the same texture all around.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:02.12,1:07:03.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说实话
Dialogue: 2,1:07:02.12,1:07:03.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm not going to lie,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:03.64,1:07:05.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这看起来实在太奇怪了
Dialogue: 2,1:07:03.64,1:07:05.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this does not look right at all,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:05.64,1:07:07.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过这个改动很快就被撤销了
Dialogue: 2,1:07:05.64,1:07:07.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah, this change was quickly reverted.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:07.88,1:07:13.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,InfDev版本另一个短暂存在的改动  是熔炉的冶炼速度
Dialogue: 2,1:07:07.88,1:07:11.73,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Another change that was briefly made in the InfDev version of Minecraft
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.73,1:07:13.59,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,was the furnace smelt time.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:13.74,1:07:15.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,正如之前提到的
Dialogue: 2,1:07:13.74,1:07:15.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So, as mentioned before,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:15.34,1:07:18.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,原版每个物品需要熔炼8秒
Dialogue: 2,1:07:15.34,1:07:18.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,each item in Minecraft takes 8 seconds to smelt,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:18.86,1:07:23.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在InfDev中 曾改为仅需4秒就能完成
Dialogue: 2,1:07:18.86,1:07:23.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but in InfDev, a change was made to where items only took 4 seconds to smelt.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:23.64,1:07:26.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 物品在InfDev里熔炼快得多
Dialogue: 2,1:07:23.64,1:07:26.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, items smelted a lot quicker in InfDev,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:26.92,1:07:28.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过这个改动也很快回滚了
Dialogue: 2,1:07:26.92,1:07:28.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but this change was quickly reverted.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:29.12,1:07:35.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,使用煤炭块熔炼物品  比单用煤炭更高效
Dialogue: 2,1:07:29.12,1:07:35.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fs9}Smelting items in a furnace by using a block of coal is more efficient than using just the coal itself.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:35.94,1:07:40.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为1个煤炭块能熔炼80个物品
Dialogue: 2,1:07:35.94,1:07:40.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This is because 1 block of coal can smelt up to 80 items in a furnace,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:40.86,1:07:45.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而9个单独煤炭只能熔炼72个
Dialogue: 2,1:07:40.86,1:07:45.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whereas just using 9 coal in a furnace will only smelt up to 72 items.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:46.12,1:07:48.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:07:46.12,1:07:48.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In the early stages of Minecraft Alpha,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:48.96,1:07:53.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,放置熔炉时存在一个烦人的bug
Dialogue: 2,1:07:48.96,1:07:53.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,there used to be a really annoying bug in the game when it came to placing furnaces.
Dialogue: 1,1:07:54.02,1:07:56.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时放置熔炉时
Dialogue: 2,1:07:54.02,1:07:56.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in Alpha, when you placed a furnace,
Dialogue: 1,1:07:56.68,1:07:59.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它总是会背对玩家放置
Dialogue: 2,1:07:56.68,1:07:59.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it would always place facing away from the player,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:00.02,1:08:03.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,想在房子里摆放时特别让人恼火
Dialogue: 2,1:08:00.02,1:08:03.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was really annoying when you wanted to place it in your house.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:03.58,1:08:05.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当年我可没少为这个生气
Dialogue: 2,1:08:03.58,1:08:05.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I hated this back in the day.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:05.74,1:08:06.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 我是在录视频吗
Dialogue: 2,1:08:05.74,1:08:06.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh wait, am I recording?
Dialogue: 1,1:08:07.08,1:08:07.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,继续往下说
Dialogue: 2,1:08:07.08,1:08:07.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Moving on.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:07.96,1:08:10.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft中使用setblock指令
Dialogue: 2,1:08:07.96,1:08:10.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Using the setblock command in Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:10.80,1:08:15.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,使用setblock指令可以生成  一个已激活的熔炉  即点燃状态的熔炉
Dialogue: 2,1:08:10.80,1:08:15.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you can spawn in an already active furnace known as the lit furnace.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:15.68,1:08:18.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个点燃的熔炉正如其名
Dialogue: 2,1:08:15.68,1:08:18.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now this lit furnace is in the name,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:18.14,1:08:20.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,因为它会始终保持点燃状态  正如你现在看到的这样
Dialogue: 2,1:08:18.14,1:08:20.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,as it will always stay lit as you can see,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:20.94,1:08:22.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,即便里面没有任何物品在熔炼
Dialogue: 2,1:08:20.94,1:08:22.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,even if there's nothing smelting in it,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:22.92,1:08:23.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这确实有点奇怪
Dialogue: 2,1:08:22.92,1:08:23.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is kinda weird.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:24.16,1:08:30.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一组64个煤炭块能让熔炉持续工作14.2小时
Dialogue: 2,1:08:24.16,1:08:30.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,A 64 stack of coal blocks will smelt items in a furnace for a total of 14.2 hours,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:31.02,1:08:33.78,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这相当于游戏里的42个昼夜
Dialogue: 2,1:08:31.02,1:08:33.78,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is equivalent to 42 Minecraft days.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:33.96,1:08:36.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 煤炭块确实能让熔炉运行很久
Dialogue: 2,1:08:33.96,1:08:36.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, the coal blocks can smelt for quite a long time.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:37.06,1:08:40.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,默认情况下 熔炉的界面只显示
Dialogue: 2,1:08:37.06,1:08:40.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,By default, the GUI of a furnace simply says,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:40.96,1:08:41.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,熔炉
Dialogue: 2,1:08:40.96,1:08:41.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,well, furnace.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:42.28,1:08:45.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但如果你在铁砧上  给熔炉重命名
Dialogue: 2,1:08:42.28,1:08:45.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, if you rename the furnace in an anvil,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:45.48,1:08:49.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么界面名称就会变成  你为熔炉重命名的那个名字
Dialogue: 2,1:08:45.48,1:08:49.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then the GUI name will change to whatever you renamed the furnace to,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:49.70,1:08:50.60,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这功能相当酷
Dialogue: 2,1:08:49.70,1:08:50.60,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:50.82,1:08:52.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,熔炉在工作时
Dialogue: 2,1:08:50.82,1:08:52.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Furnaces, when active,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:52.40,1:08:54.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,会发出13级的光照亮度
Dialogue: 2,1:08:52.40,1:08:54.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,emit a light level of 13,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:54.66,1:08:56.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比火把的光照稍暗一些
Dialogue: 2,1:08:54.66,1:08:56.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is slightly dimmer than a torch,
Dialogue: 1,1:08:57.06,1:08:59.18,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而火把的光照等级为14级
Dialogue: 2,1:08:57.06,1:08:59.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which gives off a light level of 14.
Dialogue: 1,1:08:59.38,1:09:02.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,熔炉会照亮周围的所有方块
Dialogue: 2,1:08:59.38,1:09:02.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Furnaces will light up the blocks all around it,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:02.26,1:09:04.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,尽管只有正面发光
Dialogue: 2,1:09:02.26,1:09:04.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,despite it only being lit up from the front.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:05.24,1:09:08.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,然而在1.4版本的快照阶段
Dialogue: 2,1:09:05.24,1:09:08.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, during the snapshot phase of the 1.4 update,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:08.82,1:09:12.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时对熔炉的照明效果  进行了一项实验性改动
Dialogue: 2,1:09:08.82,1:09:12.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,an experimental change was made to the lighting of furnaces.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:13.02,1:09:15.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以在快照12w39a中
Dialogue: 2,1:09:13.02,1:09:15.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So in snapshot 12w39a,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:16.02,1:09:20.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,当时修改了熔炉的照明范围  使其仅能照亮正前方的方块
Dialogue: 2,1:09:16.02,1:09:20.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was made to where the furnaces only lit up the blocks in front of them.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:20.72,1:09:23.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在后续的1.4快照中
Dialogue: 2,1:09:20.72,1:09:23.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But then in a later 1.4 snapshot,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:23.20,1:09:27.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这一改动又被撤销了  因为显然它导致了性能问题
Dialogue: 2,1:09:23.20,1:09:27.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the change was reverted as apparently it was causing performance issues.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:28.00,1:09:29.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Minecraft的早期版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:09:28.00,1:09:29.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:30.08,1:09:32.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在1.9战斗更新之前
Dialogue: 2,1:09:30.08,1:09:32.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,before the 1.9 combat update,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:32.16,1:09:36.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家可以生成我之前提到的  点燃状态的熔炉物品
Dialogue: 2,1:09:32.16,1:09:36.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players could spawn in the lit furnace I mentioned earlier as an item.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:37.20,1:09:40.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,从1.3到1.7版本期间
Dialogue: 2,1:09:37.20,1:09:40.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So from version 1.3 to 1.7,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:40.18,1:09:44.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,点燃的熔炉物品在物品栏中  显示效果是正常的
Dialogue: 2,1:09:40.18,1:09:44.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the lit furnace item looked as it was supposed to look in the inventory.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:44.90,1:09:47.30,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在1.8版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:09:44.90,1:09:47.30,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in version 1.8,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:47.44,1:09:53.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,出现了一个bug导致点燃的熔炉物品  在物品栏显示为缺失材质
Dialogue: 2,1:09:47.44,1:09:53.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a bug formed where the lit furnace item changed to have a missing texture in the inventory,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:53.42,1:09:54.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,看起来就像这样
Dialogue: 2,1:09:53.42,1:09:54.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looked like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:09:54.92,1:09:57.34,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,奇怪的是当你放置点燃的熔炉时
Dialogue: 2,1:09:54.92,1:09:57.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This was strange because when you placed the lit furnace,
Dialogue: 1,1:09:57.44,1:10:00.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它看起来很正常  但物品形态却完全错乱
Dialogue: 2,1:09:57.44,1:10:00.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it looked normal, but the item just looked all messed up.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:00.26,1:10:02.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过在1.9战斗更新后
Dialogue: 2,1:10:00.26,1:10:02.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But then in the 1.9 combat update,
Dialogue: 1,1:10:02.60,1:10:08.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这已经无关紧要了  因为游戏移除了生成点燃熔炉物品的功能
Dialogue: 2,1:10:02.60,1:10:05.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it didn't matter anyway because the ability to spawn in the lit
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.93,1:10:08.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,furnace as an item was removed from the game.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:08.88,1:10:15.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,工作台于2010年1月30日  在Minecraft的in-dev版本中加入游戏
Dialogue: 2,1:10:08.88,1:10:15.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The crafting table was added into Minecraft in version in-dev on January 30th in 2010.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:16.02,1:10:20.28,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着工作台  现在已经12岁了
Dialogue: 2,1:10:16.02,1:10:20.28,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,This means the crafting table is now turning 12 years old,
Dialogue: 1,1:10:20.38,1:10:22.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直让我觉得太不可思议了
Dialogue: 2,1:10:20.38,1:10:22.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is absolutely crazy to me man.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:22.88,1:10:28.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Minecraft中首个加入的合成配方  绝对是个奇怪的存在
Dialogue: 2,1:10:22.88,1:10:28.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The first ever crafting recipe added into Minecraft was definitely a strange one.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:28.62,1:10:36.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,合成系统首次在Minecraft in-dev版本中引入  而史上第一个合成配方  竟然是箭的配方
Dialogue: 2,1:10:28.62,1:10:32.34,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So crafting was first introduced in Minecraft in-dev
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.34,1:10:36.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and the first ever crafting recipe was a recipe for the arrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:36.24,1:10:38.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,现在要合成这支箭
Dialogue: 2,1:10:36.24,1:10:38.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now to craft this arrow,
Dialogue: 1,1:10:38.66,1:10:43.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你需要用8个苹果  按照国际象棋棋盘的样子排列  
Dialogue: 2,1:10:38.66,1:10:43.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you would need 8 apples in the shape of a chess plate like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:43.72,1:10:45.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 我可不是在开玩笑
Dialogue: 2,1:10:43.72,1:10:45.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Yep, I'm not joking guys,
Dialogue: 1,1:10:45.62,1:10:48.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是开创一切的原始合成配方
Dialogue: 2,1:10:45.62,1:10:48.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,this was the crafting recipe that started it all.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:48.62,1:10:49.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这难道不美妙吗？
Dialogue: 2,1:10:48.62,1:10:49.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Isn't it just beautiful?
Dialogue: 1,1:10:50.12,1:10:59.21,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,锻造台是我的世界中的一种方块   玩家可以用它将钻石工具和盔甲升级为更高级的
Dialogue: 2,1:10:50.12,1:10:54.06,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The smithing table is a block in Minecraft that players can use
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.06,1:10:59.21,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,to upgrade their diamond tools and armor into the more powerful netherite type.
Dialogue: 1,1:10:59.34,1:11:02.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,目前锻造台的界面是这样的
Dialogue: 2,1:10:59.34,1:11:02.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the smithing table currently looks like this,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:02.52,1:11:05.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但当它最初在Minecraft 1.14版本加入时
Dialogue: 2,1:11:02.52,1:11:05.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but when it was first added in Minecraft 1.14,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:05.92,1:11:07.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它原本的界面长这样
Dialogue: 2,1:11:05.92,1:11:07.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it used to look like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:08.12,1:11:15.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如你所见 旧版锻造台的纹理确实与工作台的纹理极为相似
Dialogue: 2,1:11:08.12,1:11:11.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now as you can see, the old texture for the smithing table
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.88,1:11:15.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,definitely closely resembles the crafting table texture,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:15.66,1:11:19.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这很可能意味着在被替换之前这只是个临时占位纹理
Dialogue: 2,1:11:15.66,1:11:19.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which likely meant this was a placeholder texture before being changed.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:20.08,1:11:22.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在工作台加入我的世界之前
Dialogue: 2,1:11:20.08,1:11:22.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Before crafting tables were added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:23.34,1:11:24.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家们无法
Dialogue: 2,1:11:23.34,1:11:24.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players couldn't, well,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:25.00,1:11:25.50,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,制作物品 
Dialogue: 2,1:11:25.00,1:11:25.50,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,craft.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:25.66,1:11:27.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好啦好啦 我开玩笑的
Dialogue: 2,1:11:25.66,1:11:27.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'm joking.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:27.40,1:11:28.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧 某种程度上算是 
Dialogue: 2,1:11:27.40,1:11:28.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:28.52,1:11:30.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那么 在工作台出现之前
Dialogue: 2,1:11:28.52,1:11:30.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So, before crafting tables were a thing,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:30.70,1:11:35.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,玩家只能通过按键盘上的B键  来进行合成操作
Dialogue: 2,1:11:30.70,1:11:35.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the only way players could craft was by pressing the B key on their keyboard.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:35.40,1:11:42.46,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 按下B键就能随时随地  调出3x3合成网格进行物品制作
Dialogue: 2,1:11:35.40,1:11:39.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, pressing B meant players could use a 3x3
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.24,1:11:42.46,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,crafting grid to craft items anywhere they wanted to,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:42.60,1:11:43.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,仔细想想
Dialogue: 2,1:11:42.60,1:11:43.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:44.04,1:11:47.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这让我的世界变得简单了些  因为连工作台都不需要
Dialogue: 2,1:11:44.04,1:11:47.40,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,made Minecraft slightly easier because you didn't even need a crafting table,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:47.88,1:11:50.82,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界手机版的早期
Dialogue: 2,1:11:47.88,1:11:50.82,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft Pocket Edition,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:51.10,1:11:53.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也就是现在的基岩版
Dialogue: 2,1:11:51.10,1:11:53.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is now known as Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,1:11:53.08,1:11:58.24,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,手机版玩家无法通过工作台  合成石质方块
Dialogue: 2,1:11:53.08,1:11:58.24,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,players were not able to craft stone-related blocks using the crafting table.
Dialogue: 1,1:11:58.48,1:12:05.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,他们必须使用旧版的切石机  才能制作心爱的石砖
Dialogue: 2,1:11:58.48,1:12:02.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Instead, players on Pocket Edition had to craft their beloved stone blocks by
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.89,1:12:05.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,using an old variant of the stone cutter.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:05.92,1:12:08.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这就是旧版切石机的模样
Dialogue: 2,1:12:05.92,1:12:08.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now the old stone cutter looks like this,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:08.52,1:12:13.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,相信很多手机版老玩家  看到这个方块都会倍感怀念
Dialogue: 2,1:12:08.52,1:12:13.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I'm sure many Pocket Edition players are getting very nostalgic just seeing this block.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:13.92,1:12:19.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,言归正传 工作台其实还能当熔炉燃料使用
Dialogue: 2,1:12:13.92,1:12:19.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, moving on, the crafting table can be used as fuel to smelt items in a furnace.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:20.08,1:12:27.04,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一个工作台可以熔炼  整整1.5个物品
Dialogue: 2,1:12:20.08,1:12:27.04,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now a single crafting table is capable of smelting a whopping total of 1.5 items,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:27.26,1:12:28.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直太疯狂了
Dialogue: 2,1:12:27.26,1:12:28.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is absolutely crazy,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:29.08,1:12:29.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 2,1:12:29.08,1:12:29.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:29.68,1:12:31.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,说真的 还是老老实实用煤炭吧
Dialogue: 2,1:12:29.68,1:12:31.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Honestly, just stick to using coal.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:31.80,1:12:36.12,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你曾低头查看工作台底部
Dialogue: 2,1:12:31.80,1:12:36.12,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you are ever in a situation where you look underneath the crafting table,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:36.30,1:12:42.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你会立刻注意到底部纹理和橡木木板完全相同  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:36.30,1:12:39.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll instantly notice that the bottom texture is using
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.64,1:12:42.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the same texture as the oak plank's texture.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:42.60,1:12:44.42,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,刚才我说了好多次“纹理”这个词  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:42.60,1:12:44.42,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I said texture quite a lot just then.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:44.48,1:12:45.52,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,继续往下说  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:44.48,1:12:45.52,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, let's carry on.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:45.70,1:12:46.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,等等 我刚才讲到哪了？  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:45.70,1:12:46.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was I saying again?
Dialogue: 1,1:12:47.06,1:12:50.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对了 工作台底部的纹理  确实和橡木木板一致  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:47.06,1:12:50.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, the bottom part of the texture is the same as the oak plank's texture,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:50.86,1:12:53.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在MC远古版本里  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:50.86,1:12:53.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:53.32,1:12:55.22,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,比如Indev时期  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:53.32,1:12:55.22,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the early versions of InDev,
Dialogue: 1,1:12:55.32,1:12:58.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,工作台底部其实是另一番景象  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:55.32,1:12:58.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the bottom texture for the crafting table was actually different.
Dialogue: 1,1:12:59.02,1:13:06.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在Indev版本中  工作台底部显示的是橡木原木纹理  
Dialogue: 2,1:12:59.02,1:13:03.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, looking underneath the crafting table in InDev would
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.44,1:13:06.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,bless the player with the oak log texture instead,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:07.06,1:13:10.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这种纹理出现在工作台上  显得格外诡异
Dialogue: 2,1:13:07.06,1:13:10.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which looks extremely weird being on a crafting table,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:10.70,1:13:11.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但也说得过去 
Dialogue: 2,1:13:10.70,1:13:11.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but fair enough.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:11.72,1:13:17.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们有没有专门花时间  好好欣赏过工作台的纹理细节？
Dialogue: 2,1:13:11.72,1:13:17.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Have you guys ever taken some time out of your day to just look and admire the crafting table?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.28,1:13:18.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没有？
Dialogue: 2,1:13:18.28,1:13:18.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:18.88,1:13:19.36,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,就我一个人？
Dialogue: 2,1:13:18.88,1:13:19.36,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just me?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:19.56,1:13:21.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧 如果你和我一样怪
Dialogue: 2,1:13:19.56,1:13:21.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, if you are as weird as me,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:21.28,1:13:24.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你就会发现工作台的纹理上  其实藏着一把小锤子
Dialogue: 2,1:13:21.28,1:13:24.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you'll notice that the crafting table texture features a hammer,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:25.00,1:13:26.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,一把锯子  还有一把钳子
Dialogue: 2,1:13:25.00,1:13:26.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a saw, and some pliers.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:27.10,1:13:29.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,对我来说 这始终有点奇怪
Dialogue: 2,1:13:27.10,1:13:29.92,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now to me, this has always been kind of strange.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:30.06,1:13:32.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,而且我一直以为  那把钳子其实是苦力怕的脸
Dialogue: 2,1:13:30.06,1:13:32.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Also, I always thought those pliers were a creeper face,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:32.92,1:13:35.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这么多年才发现真相  感觉被欺骗了这么多年
Dialogue: 2,1:13:32.92,1:13:35.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I feel lied to after all these years,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:35.88,1:13:39.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,话说回来  你们觉得这些工具  应该被加入Minecraft吗？
Dialogue: 2,1:13:35.88,1:13:39.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Anyways, do you think any of these tools should be added into Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:40.14,1:13:43.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果觉得应该加入的话  请在评论区告诉我  你觉得该加哪个工具以及理由
Dialogue: 2,1:13:40.14,1:13:43.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If so, let me know in the comments which one you think it should be and why.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:44.10,1:13:50.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们还记得以前  每次合成完物品后材料还留在合成格里的时代吗
Dialogue: 2,1:13:44.10,1:13:47.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Oh my god, do you guys remember back to a time where
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.26,1:13:50.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,whenever you'd leave items in the crafting grid after crafting,
Dialogue: 1,1:13:51.24,1:13:55.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那时候一退出合成界面  材料就会直接掉在地上？
Dialogue: 2,1:13:51.24,1:13:55.02,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,they'd just be thrown on the floor when you exited the crafting interface?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:55.52,1:13:57.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,倒也不算特别烦人
Dialogue: 2,1:13:55.52,1:13:57.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, it wasn't insanely annoying.
Dialogue: 1,1:13:57.78,1:13:58.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其实 你知道吗
Dialogue: 2,1:13:57.78,1:13:58.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Actually, you know what?
Dialogue: 1,1:13:58.76,1:14:05.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,确实烦人 因为一关掉合成界面  你的钻石可能就直接飞进岩浆里了
Dialogue: 2,1:13:58.76,1:14:01.18,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,It was, because there was a chance your diamonds
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.18,1:14:05.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,could just go flying into the lava after closing the crafting grid,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:05.28,1:14:07.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那简直能毁掉你一整年的好心情 说真的
Dialogue: 2,1:14:05.28,1:14:07.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which would just ruin your year to be honest.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:07.54,1:14:11.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧 确实  90%是你自己的问题  10%是游戏的锅
Dialogue: 2,1:14:07.54,1:14:11.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, sure, 90% of that would be your fault and 10% the game,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:11.86,1:14:13.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这确实是游戏本身的机制问题
Dialogue: 2,1:14:11.86,1:14:13.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,but it was still in the game,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:13.40,1:14:14.70,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以我也能稍微甩锅给游戏
Dialogue: 2,1:14:13.40,1:14:14.70,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,so I can kind of blame it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:14.76,1:14:16.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过呢 在1.12版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:14:14.76,1:14:16.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, in version 1.12,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:16.94,1:14:25.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏做出了改动  现在关闭合成界面时  留在合成格里的物品会自动返还
Dialogue: 2,1:14:16.94,1:14:19.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,a change was made to where closing the crafting interface
Dialogue: 0,1:14:19.98,1:14:25.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,would now return any items that you left inside the crafting grid to your inventory,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:25.16,1:14:27.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个改动让我举双手双脚赞成
Dialogue: 2,1:14:25.16,1:14:27.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which was a change I welcomed with open arms,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:28.04,1:14:28.94,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,让我告诉你 
Dialogue: 2,1:14:28.04,1:14:28.94,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,let me tell you.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:29.02,1:14:32.96,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得工作台以前叫合成台的时候
Dialogue: 2,1:14:29.02,1:14:32.96,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,If you remember when the crafting table was called the workbench,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:33.06,1:14:35.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是我的世界的老玩家了
Dialogue: 2,1:14:33.06,1:14:35.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:35.62,1:14:39.16,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 从Alpha版到Beta 1.1版本期间
Dialogue: 2,1:14:35.62,1:14:39.16,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, from Minecraft Alpha to Beta 1.1,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:39.28,1:14:42.84,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,合成台在游戏里确实被正式命名为工作台
Dialogue: 2,1:14:39.28,1:14:42.84,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the crafting table was officially known as the workbench.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:43.00,1:14:45.56,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过从Beta 1.2版本开始  
Dialogue: 2,1:14:43.00,1:14:45.56,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, since version Beta 1.2,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:45.68,1:14:49.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我们就改称它为工作台 并沿用至今  
Dialogue: 2,1:14:45.68,1:14:49.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,we have called it the crafting table and it's remained that way ever since,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:49.78,1:14:50.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这个改动我很喜欢  
Dialogue: 2,1:14:49.78,1:14:50.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,and I love it.
Dialogue: 1,1:14:50.72,1:14:53.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在基岩版的早期版本中  
Dialogue: 2,1:14:50.72,1:14:53.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,1:14:54.10,1:14:59.76,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,锻造台原本是用一个工作台加一块圆石合成的  
Dialogue: 2,1:14:54.10,1:14:59.76,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the smithing table used to be crafted by using one crafting table and one cobblestone.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:00.04,1:15:01.80,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在现在的版本里  
Dialogue: 2,1:15:00.04,1:15:01.80,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,However, in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:02.06,1:15:08.92,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,锻造台配方已经改为四块木板加两个铁锭 不再需要工作台
Dialogue: 2,1:15:02.06,1:15:05.89,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it no longer uses the crafting table as the smithing table is now
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.89,1:15:08.93,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,crafted with four planks and two iron ingots.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:09.18,1:15:11.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不仅如此 在基岩版中  
Dialogue: 2,1:15:09.18,1:15:11.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Not only that, but in Minecraft Bedrock Edition,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:11.92,1:15:17.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,制箭台最初也是用一个工作台加一支箭来合成的
Dialogue: 2,1:15:11.92,1:15:17.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the fletching table was originally crafted with one crafting table as well and one arrow.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:17.98,1:15:19.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,不过现在游戏里
Dialogue: 2,1:15:17.98,1:15:19.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But yeah, in Minecraft today,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:19.64,1:15:23.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,制箭台的配方已改为四块木板加两块燧石
Dialogue: 2,1:15:19.64,1:15:23.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,the fletching table is crafted with four planks and two flint.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:23.50,1:15:27.20,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,工作台经历过多次细微的材质改动
Dialogue: 2,1:15:23.50,1:15:27.20,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The crafting table has gone through many small texture changes.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:27.50,1:15:30.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以当工作台最初加入我的世界时
Dialogue: 2,1:15:27.50,1:15:30.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So when the crafting table was first added into Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:31.00,1:15:35.38,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它最初是这样的纹理 现在回看真是充满怀旧感
Dialogue: 2,1:15:31.00,1:15:35.38,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it looked like this, which looking back at it now is a very nostalgic texture.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:35.62,1:15:38.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但在1.14早期快照中
Dialogue: 2,1:15:35.62,1:15:38.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But then in an early 1.14 snapshot,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:38.76,1:15:40.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,它的材质被改成了这样
Dialogue: 2,1:15:38.76,1:15:40.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,it was changed to look like this.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:41.16,1:15:47.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这个改动并未持续太久 在后续的1.14快照中材质又进行了微调
Dialogue: 2,1:15:41.16,1:15:47.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But that didn't last very long as it was slightly changed again in a later snapshot for 1.14.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:47.54,1:15:52.74,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,但这个版本同样没持续多久  最终在1.14.1版本中
Dialogue: 2,1:15:47.54,1:15:52.74,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,But that didn't last very long either as finally in 1.14.1,
Dialogue: 1,1:15:52.88,1:15:59.08,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,工作台的材质最终定型为现在这样  并一直沿用至今
Dialogue: 2,1:15:52.88,1:15:59.08,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,{\fs9}the crafting table was changed for a final time to look like this and it's remained that way ever since.
Dialogue: 1,1:15:59.32,1:16:07.02,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,工作台能在我的世界的某些结构中自然生成  具体包括以下几种建筑
Dialogue: 2,1:15:59.32,1:16:02.53,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,The crafting table is able to naturally generate
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.53,1:16:07.03,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,within a few structures in Minecraft and those are as follows.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:07.34,1:16:11.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,首先 女巫小屋中会生成工作台
Dialogue: 2,1:16:07.34,1:16:11.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,First of all, crafting tables will generate within a witch hut,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:11.42,1:16:12.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这还挺酷的
Dialogue: 2,1:16:11.42,1:16:12.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is pretty cool.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:12.70,1:16:18.14,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,其次 冰屋的地下室里也会生成工作台
Dialogue: 2,1:16:12.70,1:16:18.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Secondly, a crafting table can be generated within the basement of an igloo structure,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:18.36,1:16:19.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这设计非常贴心
Dialogue: 2,1:16:18.36,1:16:19.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is very lovely.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:19.78,1:16:24.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,接下来 你还能在某些村庄小屋中发现工作台
Dialogue: 2,1:16:19.78,1:16:24.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Next up, you can find some crafting tables in some small village houses,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:24.34,1:16:25.64,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这简直令人惊叹
Dialogue: 2,1:16:24.34,1:16:25.64,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which is mind-blowing.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:25.82,1:16:28.54,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,是啊 谁能想到村民家里会有工作台呢？
Dialogue: 2,1:16:25.82,1:16:28.54,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I know, who would have thought villagers would have crafting tables?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:28.84,1:16:29.90,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你在看什么？
Dialogue: 2,1:16:28.84,1:16:29.90,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 1,1:16:30.00,1:16:31.26,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,我是在夸你呢
Dialogue: 2,1:16:30.00,1:16:31.26,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,I was complimenting you.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:31.46,1:16:39.40,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,最后 掠夺者前哨站外围的帐篷里也会生成工作台
Dialogue: 2,1:16:31.46,1:16:35.33,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Then finally, a crafting table is able to be generated
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.33,1:16:39.39,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,within the tents that generate outside the pillager outpost.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:39.52,1:16:41.58,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,所以如果你胆大在那个帐篷里合成  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:39.52,1:16:41.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,So if you're good at craft in that tent,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:41.86,1:16:43.32,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,可要当心那些掠夺者  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:41.86,1:16:43.32,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,be careful of those pillagers,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.48,1:16:43.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,老兄  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.48,1:16:43.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,man.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:43.72,1:16:46.00,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你肯定不想被弩箭射中脸  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:43.72,1:16:46.00,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,You don't want to get a crossbow arrow to the face.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:46.24,1:16:47.86,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那样可就...没法继续合成了  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:46.24,1:16:47.86,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Just couldn't, well, craft.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:48.04,1:16:49.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,好吧好吧 我开玩笑的  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:48.04,1:16:49.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay, I'm joking.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:50.00,1:16:50.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,也不完全是  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:50.00,1:16:50.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Well, sort of.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:50.68,1:16:52.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在我的世界早期版本  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:50.68,1:16:52.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Back in the earlier days of Minecraft,
Dialogue: 1,1:16:52.96,1:16:57.72,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,Alpha测试阶段有个特殊世界类型  那里永远在下雪
Dialogue: 2,1:16:52.96,1:16:57.72,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,in the alpha days, there was a unique world type where it would be snowing all the time.
Dialogue: 1,1:16:57.86,1:16:59.88,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,在Alpha版本创建存档时  
Dialogue: 2,1:16:57.86,1:16:59.88,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,In alpha, when creating a save,
Dialogue: 1,1:17:00.00,1:17:05.98,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你有四分之一的几率生成永恒雪原世界  无论走多远都会持续下雪  
Dialogue: 2,1:17:00.00,1:17:02.58,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,you had a one in four chance to get the world
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.58,1:17:05.98,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,where it would always be snowing no matter how far you travel.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:06.20,1:17:08.62,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,如果你还记得这个特殊世界类型  
Dialogue: 2,1:17:06.20,1:17:08.62,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Now, if you remember this unique world type,
Dialogue: 1,1:17:08.68,1:17:10.66,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,那你绝对是MC老玩家了  
Dialogue: 2,1:17:08.68,1:17:10.66,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,then you are a Minecraft veteran.
Dialogue: 1,1:17:10.90,1:17:13.68,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,你们记得游戏最初没有疾跑功能吗？  
Dialogue: 2,1:17:10.90,1:17:13.68,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,Do you guys remember when sprinting was not in Minecraft?
Dialogue: 1,1:17:14.08,1:17:16.48,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,没错 在Beta 1.8版本之前  
Dialogue: 2,1:17:14.08,1:17:16.48,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,That's right, before the beta 1.8 update,
Dialogue: 1,1:17:16.66,1:17:18.10,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,游戏里根本没有疾跑  
Dialogue: 2,1:17:16.66,1:17:18.10,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,sprinting was not in the game,
Dialogue: 1,1:17:18.22,1:17:24.44,MC-CN,,0,0,0,,这意味着在MC世界里赶路  耗时更长也更折磨人
Dialogue: 2,1:17:18.22,1:17:22.14,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,which meant getting from point A to point B in your Minecraft world
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.14,1:17:24.44,MC-EN,,0,0,0,,took a lot longer and it was a lot more painful.
